<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">LUKÀ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàsön Lukà</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUKÀ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàsön</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lukà</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Bi isàlab un'kaan a Pɔl akà Bàkɔlintɔ u kab lànà mbwo yà kwem aŋinà, ikamɛnà naa un'kaan awà Lukà un'sam a Pɔl kàsön. Nde kàkäl anki un'yudà, nde kàkäl un'ngɛlɛki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nde un'kaan awà kàsöön Tyɔfil u mbul ayà uboo a mbul an'kwem an'syaam aŋinà anà an'kwem nsambwaar ungö a mböör a Yɛsu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukà kàläb ndaa yanswà bàsön Malakɔ anà Màtay, wɛɛ nde kàkwɛy ndaa asin yà ifà ifà. Ndaa kàsön nde ayi:</para>
  <para style="ip">- Muswaŋ naa nde kàläb pànsi pànsi ndaa yanswà kàtɛn anà kàkyer Yɛsu.</para>
  <para style="ip">- Mböör a Ywan anà yà Yɛsu akyeey bàkyään ya kusà a mböör aba.</para>
  <para style="ip">- Iküün a Yɛsu kyàsɛmà akà Adam, iswaŋà naa akà Nzam. Abun nde kà un'yudà mpɛl anki, wɛɛ nde wà mbuur a in'sɛŋ myanswà u mɛɛn.</para>
  <para style="ip">- Nkyeen a Yɛsu Yɛlusàlɛm fà Ngalilɛ anà ndaa asin yà ifà ifà kàkyer nde anà mpay a ukwà kàmɛn nde kwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">- Lukà akyäänà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ akà baar mpa abà Ayudà. Iswaŋà naa Yɛsu kà wà ntɔn Ayudà mpɛl anki. Waa in'sɛŋ myanswà u mɛɛn myàyöb anà myàkyey naa nde wà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a baar banswà.</para>
  <para style="ip">- Ndaa ayà uboo a un'kaan awà ayi:</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.1-4 Lukà kan'söön Tyɔfil</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.5-2.52 Mböör a Ywan anà yà Yɛsu anà imbɛy aba</para>
  <para style="ip">- Kab 3.1-20 Isal a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="ip">- Kab 3.21-4.13 Ndüümà a Yɛsu anà ndɛb ande</para>
  <para style="ip">- 4.14-9.50 Isal a Yɛsu u Ngalilɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">- 9.51-19.27 Yɛsu kan'lwomà u Ngalilɛ mukyà Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="ip">- 19.28-23.56 Ilä a Yɛsu byà ntsüü u Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="ip">- 24.1-53 Yɛsu kan'wiyà, kan'mɛnà akà baar anà kan'beenà du.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Un'sam Tyɔfil.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Baar mbɔɔn bàbön musɔn ndaa yàlyaaŋ uboo a bi. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Ba ya bàsön asànaa bàkyään baar bàmɛn ya u mii fà nsɛmà anà bàbulà asyääl a ndaa a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Lalan mɛ sye kàläb mɛ ndaa ayi pànsi pànsi fà nsɛmà aya. Un'byääl Tyɔfil, yubwaŋ naa mɛ asöön ndaa ayi. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>In'kyer mɛ abà ntɔn ngye ayöb naa an'lɔɔŋ kàwɛl ngye mà ndandaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'kyeey mwɛy kan'kyään mböör a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mpal kàkäl Ɛlɔdi mfum a Yuday, kàkäl anà ngaŋ mwɛy wà itsuŋ a angaŋ a Abya ikɔb ande Zakàlye. Un'kyay ande, mbuur a mbil a Alɔn, ikɔb ande Làsàbɛr. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkäl baar a balàbal u mii a Nzam. Ba bàfalabà ubwaŋàbwaŋ in'kɔɔn myanswà anà nswɛɛŋ yanswà yà Mwol. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Wɛɛ ba bàkäl anki anà baan ntɔn Làsàbɛr kàbör anki, ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkäl aŋànün.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Ilä mwɛy, Zakàlye kàkäl musal ingaŋ ande kusa a Nzam, ntɔn la làkäl taaŋ a itsuŋ aba musal. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Mulab nsyääl a angaŋ, löb làbü akà nde ntɔn mubilà uboo a idwà a Mwol ntɔn musà tswà mbaa kwo. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Umpal musà tswà mbaa, un'sɛŋ a baar wanswà kàkäl u nsà muyamà. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Kà imbürà, un'kyeey a Mwol mwɛy kàyàmɛnà akà Zakàlye: nde kàmbär u kɔɔ a ibaal a mɛsà a tswà. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Mpal kàmɛn Zakàlye un'kyeey awà, lileŋ làkyer un'wal, bɔɔmà làkyer un'kaar. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Wɛɛ un'kyeey kàtɛn a nde naa: « Zakàlye, twon an'man bɔɔmà, ntɔn Nzam akyàwem ngyamàkà angye: un'kyay angye Làsàbɛr ayaböör mwan baal. Ngye ayun'pà ikɔb a Ywan. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Nde asàkal ntwà a un'sak mbɔɔn ntɔn ngye. Baar mbɔɔn sye bàsàman un'sak ntɔn mböör ande. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Ntɔn nde asàkal mbuur a kölàköl u mii a Mwol. Nde usanwaa anki vin, itàkal man manswà bàfàyɔr. Nde asàkal aŋàyɔl a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl sɛmà dum a ngwän. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Nde asàfuur baan a Isàlɛl mbɔɔn akà Mwol awà Nzam aba. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Nde isal ande asàkyer u dweelà anà u ngwal asànaa ŋangɔɔm Ɛlya, ntɔn mutüüb bàtaa anà baan aba, mufuur baar a un'tswe ngwal muyweer asànaa baar a balàbal. Nde asàboom un'sɛŋ aŋàlɔ̈ɔ̈n ntɔn Mwol. » <verse eid="LUK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakàlye kàtɛn a un'kyeey naa: « Mɛ ya in'yàyöb aben? Ntɔn mɛ in'wà un'nün anà umpal ayi un'kyay amɛ sye wàŋànün. » <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Un'kyeey kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'wà Ngàbàlye. Mɛ in'fàkal tsütsü apà Nzam, nde kan'töm muyäm anà ngye anà mukakyään ndaa aŋàbwaŋ ayi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Le, ngye ayàbulà nkiin, ngye ayàkwo anki musà ndaa tii mpal isàkwo ndaa ayi, ntɔn ngye ndaa amɛ akyey anki. Ndaa ayi isàmɛnà umpal ya paa. »<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Umpal ayin, baar banswà bàkäl mudilà Zakàlye u nsà, bàmukabemà naa nde kan'kàkyer itaan uboo a idwà. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Wɛɛ mpal kàyàtoo nde, nde kàkwe anki muyäm anà ba, apan ba waa bàyöb naa nde kan'man impà kà idwà. Muyäm a ba, nde kàyaswaŋà mpin, mun kàkälà wàŋàdübà.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Umpal kàmay nde ilä a isal ande u ndwà a Nzam, nde kàfurà ndwà ande. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Ungö a ilä, un'kyay ande Làsàbɛr kàkäl yöm. Apan nde kàkàyee ngɔn tyeen. Nde kàtɛɛnà naa: <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>« Abà ubwaŋ a Mwol kan'kyer nde akà mɛ: ŋàbawà nde kan'tɔɔm ileer ande udu a mɛ ntɔn mulwom nswɛn amɛ u mii a baar banswà. »<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'kyeey mwɛy kan'kyään mböör a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>U ngɔn wàsyaam, Nzam kàtöm un'kyeey Ngàbàlye u bul mwɛy là Ngalilɛ ikɔb a la Nasàlɛr, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>akà mwan un'kaar unkɔr awà kàtɛ Yɔsefi mbuur a mbil a David ntüüm, ikɔb ande Màlye. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Un'kyeey kàbilà u ndwà ande waa kàtɛn naa: « Mbɔr angye, Mwol kan'swaŋ ubwaŋ ande mbɔɔn akà ngye, nde wà anà ngye. » <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Màlye kàmɛn ndaa yubem, waa kàyayweerà naa mbɔr ayi ikaswaŋà aben. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Apan, Un'kyeey kàtɛn a nde naa: « Màlye, twon an'man bɔɔmà, ntɔn Nzam kàmaswaŋ ukwen ande banswà. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Le, ngye ayàkal yöm, ngye ayàbɔr mwan baal, ngye ayun'pà ikɔb a Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Nde asàkal mbuur a kölàköl, bàsun'beelà Mwan a Nzam a Dudu. Mwol Nzam asun'sà u kir a imfum a nkaa ande David. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Nde asàyaal ipepey u ndwà a Yakɔb, imwol ande sye isàtsü anki. » <verse eid="LUK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Màlye waa kàtɛn a un'kyeey naa: « Ya abwɛy iyàkal aben ntɔn mɛ ŋàtàkal anki anà baal? » <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Un'kyeey kun'fuur naa: « Dweelà In'kyɛɛl ayàkal udu angye, ngwal a Nzam a Dudu ikyer ayafwee asànaa kilàpib. Lalan mwan in'kyɛɛl ayàbɔr ngye bàsun'beelà Mwan a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Le, un'tɔŋ angye Làsàbɛr sye we anà yöm a mwan baal unsà inün ande. Bàfatɛɛnà naa nde wà ikɔb, wɛɛ ŋàbawà yöm ande là u ngɔn wàsyaam. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Ntɔn undiir kan'kwo mukɔ̈ɔ̈n Nzam watɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Apan Màlye kàfuur naa: « Mɛ in'wà un'tsüüŋ a Mwol. Wɛy ndaa yanswà an'tɛn ngye ikäl abwɛy. » Un'kyeey waa kàsun'wɛy.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Màlye kan'kàler Làsàbɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Ungö apan, Màlye kàkyen agyägyä u bul mwɛy udu a mɔŋ u mɛɛn a Yuday. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Nde kàbilà u ndwà a Zakàlye, waa kàpɛ Làsàbɛr mbɔr. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Kyekà, umpal kàwem Làsàbɛr mbɔr a Màlye, mwan kànini uboo a an'bäl ande. Làsàbɛr kàyöl a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>waa kàsi in'kwɛŋ: « Nzam kàkyapà làpɛɛm aŋàsöönà akaar banswà, mwan ayàbɔr ngye we anà làpɛɛm a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Làkoo alà lan'fà ken naa ngwän a Mwol amɛ uyi akà mɛ? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Ler, umpal kan'wem mɛ mbɔr angye, mwan awà kan'bäl amɛ kan'nini ntɔn un'sak mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Ngye awà un'kaar aŋun'sak, ngye kàsi làkyän naa Mwol ayàkyer ndaa kakyään nde. »<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Diim a Màlye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Waa Màlye kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">« U mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ wanswà mɛ in'kwen usyäŋà Mwol,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>mpem amɛ yan'yɔl a un'sak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">ntɔn Nzam, Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>ntɔn nde kàtɔɔm ileer ande udu a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n a un'tsüüŋ ande.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Lalan, sɛmà apanà ngyääl yanswà isatɛɛnà a mɛ naa un'kaar aŋun'sak,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>ntɔn Ŋangwal kàkyer indiir a kölàköl ntɔn mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Ikɔb ande kyà in'kyɛɛl,<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>U mbul a intye nde wàŋàyɔl a ngyɛb</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">ntɔn baar bàfun'kyɛɛl.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Nde kàswɛŋ ikɔ̈b ande musyääl ngwal a kɔɔ ande:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">nde kàpay baar aŋàyɔl a uyɔl u mpem aba,<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>nde kàtyeey amfum kà an'kir aba mà imfum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">anà kàsɛɛn baar a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Nde kàyööl aŋangyal a indiir mbɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">wɛɛ nde aŋin'naaŋ kafuur an'kɔɔ a ipɔl.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Nde kàbay un'tsüüŋ ande Isàlɛl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">nde kàyɔbà ngyɛb ande asànaa kàswɛŋ nde bànkaa abi,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>akà Abàlam anà ikyee ande kyà mbul a in'tye. »<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Màlye kàkäl isii a ngɔɔn tär akà Làsàbɛr, apan waa kàfurà ndwà ande.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mböör a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Taaŋ a Làsàbɛr mubɔr làkwe la, nde kàbör mwan baal. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Baar a tsütsü anà baar a mbil ande bàwem ba naa Mwol kan'swaŋ ngyɛb ande mbɔɔn akà nde, ba bàsäŋà anà nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Ilä kyànaan ungö a mböör ande, ba bàyi mutsul mwan. Ba bàkweenà mukun'pà ikɔb a taarànde Zakàlye. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Wɛɛ ngwän kàtɛn naa: « Aay, bàyun'beelà Ywan! » <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Aa, u ndwà abɛ mbuur awe anà ikɔb akyɛy watɛy! » <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Abun, ba waa bàfuul taarànde muswaŋà mpin ntɔn muyöb naa ikɔb nà nde ukwen mupà mwan ande. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakàlye kàlɔ̈m kilàbää, waa kàsɔ̈n abà: « Ndandaa ikɔb ande Ywan. » Baar banswà bàkyer abem. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Apan sye, ndaa a Zakàlye waa yàsabà, waa kàsɛmà musà Nzam làkoo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Abun, baar a tsütsü bàmɛn bɔɔmà. Ndaa ayi baar bàsaamà ya u myɔŋ a Yuday myanswà. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Baar banswà bàweemà ya bàkäl muyweerà anà mutɛn naa: « Kimwan aki ayàkal aben? » Ndandaa kɔɔ a Mwol làkäl anà nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Diim a ngɔɔm a Zakàlye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Taarànde Zakàlye kàkäl aŋàyɔl a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, waa kàbulà mutà ngɔɔm anà mutɛn naa:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>« Wɛy Mwol uwɛl nsaak, Nzam a un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">ntɔn nde kàyàler anà kàtsuuŋ wa kà isɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Nde kàtwey Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ngwal ntɔn bi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">uboo a ndwà a un'tsüüŋ ande mfum David.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Ayi ndaa kàkyään nde itaan u mun a aŋangɔɔm ande bà in'kyɛɛl:<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>ntsuuŋ abi kà an'kɔɔ a aŋankir abi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">anà kà an'kɔɔ a baar bàfàkyer bi ube.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Nde kàswɛŋ ubwaŋ ande akà bànkaa abi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">Nde sye kàdiimà anki kyän ande là in'kyɛɛl.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Ndandaa, Nzam kàdi kyän akà nkaa abi Abàlam,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>mukà itsuuŋ kà ikɔ̈b a aŋankir abi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">anà mukà ipà mbwo mukun'syääl ukɔɔn bɔɔmà,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>ntɔn bi ikälà baar a in'kyɛɛl anà bàbalàbal kusà ande</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">kà ilä a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi byanswà.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Wɛɛ ngye mwan amɛ, bàsabeelà ŋangɔɔm a Nzam a dudu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">ntɔn ngye asàfwel kusà a Mwol ntɔn muyilà mbwo ande<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>anà mulɔŋ un'sɛŋ ande naa nde akyer ayà mutswà nde mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">ntɔn nde ayun'dwääl nkul a man'be ande.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Nzam abi wàŋàyɔl a ngyɛb, lalan kà itööm nde pɛɛlà làfü du asànaa taaŋ làfàsɛnà la,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>ntɔn mupɛɛlà baar abà uboo a làpib anà u mbwo a ukwà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ntɔn musyen bi u mbwo a duu. »<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwan wa kàkäl muyɛl u ndür anà u dweelà. Nde kàkälà u nsye a ipɔl tii mpal kàyàmɛnà nde u mii a un'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mböör a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Màt 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Mpal ayin, Sɛzar Angus kàtöm un'kaan ntɔn mutaŋ baar banswà u mɛɛn a Lɔmà. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Ntääŋ a baar atàtwɛb ayi yàkäl mpal kàkäl Kirinüs mfum a Siri. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Baar banswà bàkyeenà mukàsɔn ikɔb aba mbuur mbuur u bul kàfü nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yɔsefi sye kàmbarà u Nasàlɛr bul a Ngalilɛ ntɔn mukyà Bɛtɛlɛm bul a Yuday ntɔn nde kàkäl mbuur a ywar anà mbil a David, <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>ntɔn mukàsɔn ikɔb ande anà kyà un'kyay ande Màlye awà kàkäl anà yöm. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Mpal bàkäl ba u Yɛlusàlɛm, taaŋ a Màlye mubɔr làkyer akwo, <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>nde kàbör mwan baal ande wàtàtwɛb. Nde kun'läl ipfɛy, waa kun'byee uboo a unkwak ntɔn ba bàmɛn anki ikal u ndwà a angyey.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'kyeey mwɛy kan'kàmɛnà akà aseey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>U ntsü ayin sye aseey bàfabɔ̈ɔ̈nà u nsà uboo a an'ywaŋ muyiler in'kɔk aba u mpib. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Wɛɛ, le, un'kyeey a Mwol mwɛy kàyàmɛnà akà ba, làkoo a Mwol sye làswɛŋ pɛɛlà a la. Ba bàwɛn bɔɔmà mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Wɛɛ un'kyeey kàtɛn a ba naa: « Twon lan'wem bɔɔmà, ntɔn mɛ amàlatwääl làsaŋ aŋàbwaŋ làyàpà un'sak akà baar banswà: <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>U mpib aŋàbà, u bul a David, bàmàlaböör Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ mwɛy, nde wà Klistɔ, wà Mwol.<verse eid="LUK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>« Bɛ làyun'man unsà idiim ki: mwan aŋàlal ipfɛy, wàŋàbyee uboo a unkwak. »<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Kà imbürà, akyeey a du mbɔɔn waa bàyun'taan, bàmusà Nzam làkoo, bàmutɛn naa:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>« Làkoo akà Nzam kà ikal a dudu, duu u mɛɛn uboo a baar bàfun'kwen! »<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aseey ban'kyà Bɛtɛlɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Mpal bàsawɛy akyeey ntɔn mufurà du, aseey bàtɛn ba a ba naa: « Tsweenà Bɛtelɛm bà, bi ikàman ndaa yan'bwà kwo, ndaa kàmisam Mwol. » <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Ba bàkyen agyägyä, waa bàmɛn Màlye anà Yɔsefi, anà mwan akɔɔ wàŋàbyee uboo a unkwak. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Mpal bun'mɛn ba, ba bàsam ndaa kakyään un'kyeey ntɔn mwan akɔɔ awun. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Baar banswà bàweemà indiir bàtɛɛnà aseey, bàmɛn ndaa yubem. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Ndaa ayi yanswà Màlye ya kàkäärà u mpem, waa kàfayɔbà ya taaŋ lanswà. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Aseey waa bàfurà, bàmuyisà làkoo anà muyisyäŋà Nzam, ntɔn indiir byanswà bàwem ba anà bàmɛn ba, byàbü balàbal asànaa kakyään un'kyeey.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'wal ikɔb ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Ilä kyànaan ungö a mböör, taaŋ mutsul mwan làkwe la, ba bun'pɛ ikɔb a Yɛsu, ikɔb kakyään un'kyeey kusà ngwän mukal yöm.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmàkun'swaŋ u ndwà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Apan, taaŋ mupöŋ ndür làkwe la ntɔn Yɔsefi anà Màlye asànaa kàswɛŋà un'kɔɔn a Mɔsɛ, ba bàsyen mwan u ndwà a Nzam a Yɛlusàlɛm ntɔn mukun'swaŋ akà Mwol, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>ntɔn bàsön uboo a un'kɔɔn a Mwol abà: « Mwan baal a nswɛm wanswà bun'sà ukɔl ntɔn Mwol. » <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Yàlɔ̈m sye naa ba bàpɛ ibɔɔn asànaa ukalɔɔmà un'kɔɔn nsil awà, « nkokà un'kyay anà un'dim, itàkal in'tö a an'yem myeel. »<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>U Yɛlusàlɛm kàkäl anà mbuur mwɛy ikɔb ande Simɛyɔ. Mbuur awà kàkäl wàbalàbal anà inzaam, nde kàfadilà mbuur ayàlwom ngyɛb a Isàlɛl. Dweelà In'kyɛɛl kàkäl anà nde, <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>waa kun'kyään naa nde usàkwà anki kusà muman Klistɔ a Mwol. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Dweelà kun'syen u ndwà a Nzam. Umpal bàyàtwaal aböör a Yɛsu mwan aba ntɔn mukyer ndaa kàlɔ̈ɔ̈mà un'kɔɔn, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simɛyɔ kun'wɛl kà an'kɔɔ ande, waa kàsyäŋà Nzam, waa kàtɛn naa:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>« Mwol, mpalàbà ngye an'kwey ilää angye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">ngye an'kwo awɛy un'tsüüŋ angye ukü a duu.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ntɔn mɛ an'man Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ u mii,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n ngye ntɔn in'sɛŋ myanswà,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Nde wà pɛɛlà ntɔn mupà kyɛɛy akà in'sɛŋ a mɛɛn anà nde asàkal làkoo ntɔn un'sɛŋ angye Isàlɛl. »<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngɔɔm a Simɛyɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Taarànde anà ngwän bàkäl mubem indiir kàtɛɛnà Simɛyɔ ntɔn Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simɛyɔ kun'si kɔɔ, waa kàtɛn a Màlye ngwän a Yɛsu naa: « Le! Mwan wà ayàkal mbuur ayàtyeey, taaŋ lumwɛy ayàmbaar baar mbɔɔn kà Isàlɛl. Nde ayàkal isi a Nzam iyàtwaal nkaabà, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>abun an'kyän aŋàyee u mpem a baar mbɔɔn màsàmɛnà u leŋ. Wɛɛ akà ngye ŋakwo Màlye, usaay bàsapfuul mpem asànaa kɔm. »<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anà, ŋangɔɔm un'kaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kàkäl sye anà ŋangɔɔm un'kaar ikɔb ande Anà, mwan a Fanwel, mbuur a un'sɛŋ a Asɛr. Nde kàkäl un'nün. Nde kàkäl mbul nsambwaar anà un'dim kàbääl nde kà isyee ande, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>ungö, nde kàbulà un'kweel un'dim. Nde kàkäl ayà mbul an'kwem naan aŋinà. U mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande wanswà nde kàbwaayà u ndwà a Nzam musyäälà Nzam mpib anà mwäänà: nde kàkälà mukin mbɔr anà muyamà. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Nde kàyàkɔlà sye taaŋ nsil alan, wàmuyisyäŋà Nzam. Nde kàkäl mukyään ndaa a Yɛsu akà baar banswà bàkälà mudilà naa Nzam ukɔɔr Yɛlusàlɛm.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfuurà Nasàlɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Mpal bàmay ba mukyer ndaa yanswà kàlɔ̈ɔ̈mà un'kɔɔn a Mwol, Yɔsefi anà Màlye bàfurà bul aba Nasàlɛr u Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwan kàkäl muyɛl anà mubulà ngwal. Nde kàkäl aŋàyɔl a an'yeerà, kɔɔ a Nzam làkäl anà nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu u ndwà a Nzam u mbul kwem aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Aböör a Yɛsu bàfakyeenà Yɛlusàlɛm mbul wanswà mukàdyà Pak.<verse eid="LUK 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Mpal kàkäl Yɛsu mbul kwen aŋiyweel, ba bun'syen Yɛlusàlɛm asànaa ikääl aba. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Mpal yàwü nköŋ, ba waa bàfurà, wɛɛ mwan Yɛsu kàsàsal u Yɛlusàlɛm, aböör ande bàyöb anki. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Ba bàsii naa nde wa anà atɔŋ aba bàtüüb ba mbwo, ba bàkyer mwäänà mwɛy muyikyà, waa bàsɛmà muyun'leŋ uboo a atɔŋ aba anà uboo a asam aba. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Wɛɛ ba bun'mɛn anki. Apan ba bàfurà Yɛlusàlɛm mukun'leŋ. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Ungö ilä itär ba bun'mɛn u ndwà a Nzam kàkyàbwaay uboboo a alɔɔŋ a un'kɔɔn. Nde kàkäl muweemà ba anà musà ba mfuul. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Baar banswà bàweemà ndaa ande bàkäl mubem ntɔn un'yɛnà ande anà mfuur a ndaa ande. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Mpal bun'mɛn aböör ande, ba bàkyer abem, lalan ngwän kàtɛn nde a nde naa: « Mwan amɛ, ntɔn nkye amà ikyer ngye abà? Ler, taaràŋà anà mɛ, bi kan'kyɛɛr mbɔɔn muyaleŋ. » <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Nde waa kafuur naa: « Ntɔn nkye làyan'leŋ bɛ? Bɛ làyöb anki naa mɛ in'kyer akyer isal a taaràmɛ? » <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Wɛɛ ba bàsàyöb anki ndaa kàtɛɛnà nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Apan Yɛsu kàfurà Nasàlɛr anà ba. Nde kàkyer afalabà ndaa aba. Ndaa ayi yanswà ngwän ya kàkäärà u mpem ande. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yɛsu kàkäl muyɛl unsà ndür anà unsà an'yeerà. Nde sye kàpɛɛ un'sak akà Nzam anà akà baar.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mbul wàkwem aŋityeen wà imfum a Mfum Tibɛr Sɛzar, umpal kàkäl Pɔnsɔ Pilatu kuvɛrnɔ̈ɔ̈r u Yuday, Ɛlɔdi u Ngalilɛ, un'tɔŋ ande Filipo u Itürɛ anà u Trakɔnit, Lizanyas u Abilɛn, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>anà umpal a andwer a angaŋ Anà anà Kayifa, ndaa a Nzam yàyi akà Ywan mwan a Zakàlye, u nsye a ipɔl. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Nde kàyilyaaŋà u nsi yanswà yà tsütsü a ngyäl a Yɔrdan muyilɔŋ baar mubuul mpem anà mukadümà ntɔn badwääl nkul a man'be aba <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>asànaa bàsön ya uboo a un'kaan a ndaa a ŋangɔɔm Yɛsay naa: « Yi ndaa a mbuur akasaa in'kwɛŋ u nsye a ipɔl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">"Làlɔ̈ɔ̈n mbwo a Mwol, làsuub myäy ande. <verse eid="LUK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Un'baan wanswà akyer ayàyɔl, mɔŋ wanswà anà iköl kyanswà ikyer ayàtye, mbwo aŋàkwàkwarà ikyer ayàsubà, mbwo aŋàkwà bàkyer ayàlɔn." <verse eid="LUK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Mbuur wanswà ayàman mɔ̈ɔ̈ kàpɛ Nzam. »<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>In'sɛŋ a baar myàyee akà Ywan ntɔn nde kadümà. Nde kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Mbil a iyäy, nà kàlaswɛŋ mutiin nkyɛl iyà ungö? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Làswɛŋ u nsyääl abɛ naa bɛ lan'buul mpem, wɛɛ twon lan'tɛn u mpem abɛ naa: "Abàlam wà nkaa abi." Ntɔn mɛ alàkyään naa Nzam kan'kwo utwey ikyee a Abàlam unsà nkɔŋ yi. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Làler, fà itaan nkwar ya tsütsü mutsul in'te kà in'swɛy a mya: un'te wanswà mpa afàbɔr mbɛŋ aŋàbwaŋ bàkyer ayun'tsul, waa bàyun'tɔɔm u mbaa. » <verse eid="LUK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Baar bun'fuulà naa: « Apɛy bi waa ikyer aben? » <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Nde waa kàfuur naa: « Wɛy mbuur awe abyà inkur byeel upɛ imwɛy akà mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n a kya, wɛɛ mbuur awe anà isaa adyà ukyer sye abà. » <verse eid="LUK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Afüür a itɛr sye bàyi ntɔn badümà, waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi ikyer aben? » <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Nde waa kafuur naa: « Twon lan'kwɛy undiir udu a indiir bàlaswɛŋ mukyer. » <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Aŋità sye bàfuul naa: « Atöl bi ikyer aben? » Nde waa kafuur naa: « Twon lan'gyɔɔr undiir a mbuur, twon lan'yib, làkyey làfur abɛ mpɛl. » <verse eid="LUK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Baar bàkäl anà ngyal muyöb naa nkye Ywan wà Klistɔ bàdilà ba. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Nde kàtɛn a baar banswà naa: « Mɛ, mɛ in'kàladümà kà an'dà, wɛɛ mbuur ayàyà ungö amɛ kàman'söön u ngwal, mɛ in'kwe anki musɔɔl in'siŋ a sàbar ande. Nde bɛ ayàladümà u Dweelà In'kyɛɛl anà u mbaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Nde we anà impye ande u kɔɔ ntɔn mukaab mbɛŋ anà un'lɛŋ. Nde mbɛŋ ayàsà uboo a ikɔr ande, wɛɛ nde un'lɛŋ ayàtɔɔm u mbaa mpa ifàdim. » <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Abun Ywan kàswɛŋà ndaa asin mbɔɔn akà un'sɛŋ mukyer anà kun'kyäänà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Apan sye Ywan kàtɛɛnà a Ɛlodi, mbuur kàfayaalà u Ngalilɛ, ntɔn kàbääl nde Ɛlɔdyas, un'kyay a un'tɔŋ ande, anà ntɔn nde kàkyer ube asin bà ifà ifà, <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>nde kàfàkwɛy ube asin musà Ywan u bɔlokà.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndüümà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Màt 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Yàmɛnà naa baar banswà bàkyeenà mukàwal ndüümà. Yɛsu sye kàkàwal ndüümà. Mpal kàkäl nde muyamà, du waa làdubà, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Dweelà In'kyɛɛl kàyi udu ande kà imbuur imbuur asànaa yem. Ndaa yan'fà du yan'tɛn naa: « Ngye, ngye awà Mwan in'kwen mɛ, mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ wanswà we amu ngye. »<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyääl a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Màt 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yɛsu kàkäl ayà tsütsü mbul an'kwem an'tär taaŋ kàsɛmà nde isal ande asànaa bàsii baar naa nde wà mwan a Yɔsɛfi, mwan a Ɛli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>mwan a Matat, mwan a Lɛvi, mwan a Mɛlshi, mwan a Zanayi, mwan a Yɔsɛfi, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>mwan a Matatyas, mwan a Amɔs, mwan a Nawum, mwan a Ɛsli, mwan a Nangay, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>mwan a Maat, mwan a Matatyas, mwan a Sɛmɛy, mwan a Yɔsɛk, mwan a Yɔda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>mwan a Ywanan, mwan a Yɛsa, mwan a Zɔrɔbabɛl, mwan a Salatyɛl, mwan a Nɛri <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>mwan a Mɛlki, mwan a Adi, mwan a Kɔsam, mwan a Ɛlmadam, mwan a Ɛr, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>mwan a Yɛsu, mwan a Ɛlyɛzɛr, mwan a Yɔrim, mwan a Matat, mwan a Lɛvi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>mwan a Simɛyɔ, mwan a Yudà, mwan a Yɔsɛfi, mwan a Yɔnam, mwan a Ɛlyakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>mwan a Mɛlɛya, mwan a Mɛna, mwan a Matatar, mwan a Natan, mwan a David, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>mwan a Isayi, mwan a Yɔbɛd, mwan a Booz, mwan a Salà, mwan a Nasɔn, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>mwan a Aminadab, mwan a Admin mwan a Arni, mwan a Ɛsrɔm, mwan a Farɛs, mwan a Yudà, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>mwan a Yakɔb, mwan a Isak, mwan a Abàlam, mwan a Tara, mwan a Nashɔr, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>mwan a Sɛrush, mwan a Ragɔ, mwan a Falɛk, mwan a Ɛbɛr, mwan a Salà, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>mwan a Kaynam, mwan a Alàpakàsad, mwan a Sɛm, mwan a Nɔwà, mwan a Lamɛk, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>mwan a Matusala, mwan a Ɛnɔk, mwan a Yɛred, mwan a Màlalɛyɛl, mwan a Kɛnan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>mwan a Ɛnɔs, mwan a Sɛt, mwan a Adam, mwan a Nzam.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndɛb a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Màt 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yɛsu kàkäl aŋàyɔl a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl mpal kàfü nde Yɔrdan, Dweelà kun'syen u nsye a ipɔl, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>ikal kun'lɛb Satanà ilä an'kwem an'nà. Ilä abin byanswà nde akundiir kàdi anki. Mpal byàwü ilä abi, nde kàwem ngyal. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Satanà kàtɛn a nde naa: « Isàkal naa ngye awà Mwan a Nzam, swaŋ nkɔŋ yi ibulà nsɔ. » <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Bàsön naa: "Mbuur usàkal anki anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ntɔn nsɔ mpɛl." »<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Satanà kun'syen ududu, kun'swɛŋ imfum a mɛɛn byanswà, <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mɛ in'yapà ikɔ̈b ki kyanswà, un'naaŋ anà làkoo a imfum bi byanswà, ntɔn bya mɛ bàpɛ, mɛ sye in'fàpà akà mbuur wanswà in'kwen mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Isàkal naa ngye an'bwà an'köm kusà a mɛ, ayi yanswà iyàkal yà ngye. » <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Bàsön naa: "Ngye asàbwà an'köm kusà a Mwol, Nzam angye, ngye sye ayàsyääl nde mpɛl." »<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Satanà kàfun'syen u Yɛlusàlɛm, kun'si udu a ndwà a Nzam, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Isàkal naa ngye awà Mwan a Nzam, tɔɔmà sɛmà pà tii u nsi, ntɔn bàsön naa: <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>"Nde ayàswaŋ in'kyeey ande ntɔn ngye, ntɔn ba batii, <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>anà ba sye bàsawal kan'kɔɔ aba ntɔn làkɔl angye làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abööl u nkɔŋ." » <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Bàsön naa: "Ngye asun'kur anki Mwol, Nzam angye". » <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Pa kàmay nde ndɛb yanswà, Satanà waa kàlwomà tsütsü apà Yɛsu tii utaaŋ asin.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'sɛmà isal ande u Ngalilɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Màt 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yɛsu kàkäl aŋàyɔl a ngwal a Dweelà mpal kàfurà nde Ngalilɛ. Làsaŋ ande làpää kà itiir a nsi aki kyanswà. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Nde kàyilɔŋà uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Baar banswà bàkyer un'sà làkoo.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmutɔn u Nasàlɛr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Màt 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàkyen Nasàlɛr ikal kàyɛl nde. Asànaa ifà ande, nde kàbilà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà ilä a saba. Nde kàmbarà ntɔn mutaŋ, <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>ba bun'pɛ un'kaan a ŋangɔɔm Yɛsay. Nde kàduub wa, waa kàmɛn ikal bàsön naa:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>« Dweelà a Mwol là udu amɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ntɔn nde kan'si an'kɔɔ ntɔn mukyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ akà aŋàlàmbwà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">nde kan'töm mukyään ntsuuŋà akà baar aŋàkwɛlà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">anà akà ikwàmii muman, mutsuuŋ baar bàŋàmɛɛy nkwaaŋ,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>mukyään mbul usàswaŋ Mwol kab angway ande. » <verse eid="LUK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Ungö apan nde kàdübà un'kaan awun, kàpɛ wa akà un'syääl, waa kàbwaay. Uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, mii myanswà myàkäl muler nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Apan nde kàsɛmà mutɛn a ba naa: « Itiir a Ndaa a Nzam an'taŋ mɛ yi, akà bɛ baar làweemà ya, ya yan'kwo ŋàbawà. » <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Baar banswà bun'tɛɛlà imbäl: ba bàkäl mubem ntɔn ndaa aŋàbwaŋ iyatoo u mun ande, wɛɛ ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Wà mà mwan a Yɔsɛfi! » <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Apan Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ inkyàyöb naa bɛ làyan'tɛɛl itim ki: "Ungaŋ, kɔɔr ngye ŋakwo, bɛ làyàtɛn naa kyer u bul angye asànaa kàkyer ngye u Kapɛrnawum." <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ alàkyään ndandaa naa akà ŋangɔɔm mwɛy ufun'wal u nsi ande watɛy. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Mɛ alàkyään ndandaa, akweel adim bàkäl mbɔɔn u taaŋ a Ɛli kà Isàlɛl mpal mbul mpa kànɔ̈ wa mbul tär a ngɔn syaam. Ngyal yàkyer abilà u mɛɛn manswà, <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>wɛɛ Ɛli bun'töm anki akà umwɛy uboo a ba, bun'töm akà un'kweel un'dim mwɛy u Sarɛpta, u mɛɛn a Sidɔn. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Baar a ukyal a bay sye bàkäl mbɔɔn kà Isàlɛl utaaŋ a ŋangɔɔm Ɛlisya, ba banswà bàkɔɔrà anki, Naaman un'nsi Siri mpɛl. »<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Baar banswà uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà bàwem nkyɛl mbɔɔn mpal bàwem ba indiir abi byanswà. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Waa bàmbarà, bun'böŋ u bul aba, bun'syen udu a mɔŋ bàtöŋ bul aba ntɔn mukun'siinà waa nde ukàbwà u ngyɛl. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàlyaaŋ uboo aba, waa kàkyen.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtyà Kapɛrnawum, bul a Ngalilɛ. Nde kàlɔɔŋà ilä a saba. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Baar bàmɛn ndaa yubem ntɔn nde kàlɔɔŋà a ikɔ̈b. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>U ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà kàkäl anà mbuur mwɛy kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe. Mpal kàmɛn nde Yɛsu, nde kàsi in'kwɛŋ: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>« Aa! Yɛsu un'nsi Nasàlɛr, ngye ininà akwen ntɔn bi? Ngye ayi ntɔn muböŋ bi? Mɛ in'kyàyöb naa ngye awà nà, ngye awà Ŋun'kyɛɛl a Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yɛsu waa kun'ŋän, waa kàtɛn naa: « Kal a duu, too uboo a mbuur wà. » Dweelà a làbe lun'bwiy u nsi, waa làtoo ukɔɔn akun'kyer ube. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Baar banswà bàkäl u bɔɔmà, waa bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Ndaa nà ayi? Nde wà mutɛɛnà a ngwal anà ikɔ̈b a an'dweelà an'be, ma sye màmutoo! » <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Làsaŋ ande làpää kà itiir a nsi akin.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr abɛy mbɔɔn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Màt 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yɛsu kàtoo u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, waa kàkyen ndwà a Simɔn. Ukwà a Simɔn kàkäl anà làbwey a mpye mbɔɔn. Ba bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n mukun'kɔɔr. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yɛsu waa kànyee udu ande, waa kàböŋ ukyal aban. Umpal bàtoo ba u ndür ande, nde waa kàsubà, waa kàsɛmà mukasyääl.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>U làbwàmpib, baar bàkäl anà baar a an'kyal mà ifà ifà batwäl akà Yɛsu. Nde kasi an'kɔɔ, ba waa bàkɔɔrà. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>An'dweelà an'be sye màtoo anà in'kwɛŋ anà màtɛn naa: « Ngye awà Mwan a Nzam. » Wɛɛ Yɛsu katsüŋ a ngwal ntɔn ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n afàtɛn, ntɔn ba bàkyer ayöbà naa nde kàkäl Klistɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ a Yɛsu u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Taaŋtyà ututu, Yɛsu kàkyer atoo, waa kàkyen kikal a mpey. Baar mbɔɔn bàkyer ayun'leŋà. Mpal bun'mɛn ba, ba bàkwen mukun'tà mpi ntɔn nde ukɔɔn asawɛy. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ in'kyer akàpay Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là imwol a Nzam kà an'bul mumwɛy, ntɔn ndaa kan'töm Nzam yayi. » <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Nde kàlɔɔŋà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà u Yuday.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'bel alɔŋki ande bàtàtwɛb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Màt 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy Yɛsu kàkäl tsütsü a ɛwà a Ngɛnàsàlɛr, baar mbɔɔn bàkyer un'diŋà ntɔn muwem ndaa a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Nde kàmɛn an'bwaar an'mɔ̈ɔ̈l mà ipɔl kà un'kɔɔl a an'dà ntɔn aŋama bàkäl musɔŋ an'kwen aba. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Nde kàlär uboo a bwaar làmwɛy, la làkäl là Simɔn, waa kun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m naa nde usiinà la ikyee uboo a an'dà. Nde waa kàbwaay, kàlɔɔŋà baar uboo a bwaar.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Mpal kàmay nde mulɔŋ, nde kàtɛn a Simɔn naa: « Làkyen uboboo a an'dà, làtɔɔm an'kwen abɛ kan'dà ntɔn mulwab nsö. » <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simɔn kun'fuur naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi kan'kyer mpib aŋun'kiinà, wɛɛ bi akà undiir imɛn anki. Ntɔn ngye aman'swaŋ, mɛ in'kyer atɔɔm an'kwen. » <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Ungö mutɔɔm ma, ba bàsiim nsö mbɔɔn, an'kwen màkäl tsütsü mukaamà. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Ba bàbel atɔŋ aba bàkäl uboo a bwaar lumwɛy ntɔn ba babay. Ba waa bàyi, bàyööl an'bwaar màmɔ̈ɔ̈l: ma màkäl tsütsü muminà ntɔn buur a nsö. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Mpal kàmɛn Simɔn abun, nde kàbü kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu, waa kàtɛn naa: « Mwol, lwomà tsütsü apà mɛ, ntɔn mɛ in'wà mbuur a man'be. » <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Ntɔn nde anà atɔŋ ande matɛɛr màkyer awal ntɔn bàsiim ba nsö mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Atɔŋ ande Zyak anà Ywan, baan a Zebàday, bàkäl sye asànaa nde. Apan, Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a Simɔn naa: « Twon an'man bɔɔmà, sɛmà apanà ngye an'bulà un'lɔ̈ɔ̈b a baar. » <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Ungö bàmay ba mutwey an'bwaar u nkankyel, ba bàsàwɛy ma, waa bàläb Yɛsu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr ŋun'kyal a bay</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Màt 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4-45">Mlk 1.4-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yàmɛnà naa Yɛsu kàkäl u bul mwɛy, ŋun'kyal a bay kun'mɛn nde, nde kàbü kusà ande, waa kun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n naa: « Mwol, kya ngye asàkwen, mpööŋ. » <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yɛsu kàsilà kɔɔ ande, waa kun'bä, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mɛ an'kwen, pɔŋà! » Taaŋ nsil alan bay waa làlwomà. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Ungö apan nde kun'tsüŋ naa: « Twon an'kyään mbuur asin ndaa ayi. Wɛɛ, kyen akà ngaŋ ntɔn nde kaler, ungö waa ngye apà an'kab kàswɛŋ Mɔsɛ ntɔn mpööŋà angye, waa kya ikal imbäl ntɔn ba. » <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Apan, làkoo ande làkyer apää ntsü yanswà, baar mbɔɔn bàyee ntɔn muwem ndaa ande anà muleŋ nkɔɔr unsà an'kyal aba. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Wɛɛ nde kàkyeenà kà ikal a mpey ntɔn mukàyamà Nzam.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr mbuur aŋàkwɛkà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Màt 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy Yɛsu kàkäl mulɔŋ. Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàkäl paa sye ban'bwaay. Ba bàfü an'bul manswà mà Ngalilɛ, mà Yuday anà Yɛlusàlɛm. Ngwal a Mwol yàkäl a Yɛsu ntɔn mukɔɔr abɛy. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Apan sye, baar amwɛy bàtwäl mbuur mwɛy aŋàkwɛkà udu a ipɔy. Ba bàleŋà mukun'biil uboo a ndwà anà bun'tɔɔl kusà a Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Abà bàmɛn ba naa mbwo abilà yatɛy ntɔn baar bàkäl mbɔɔn, ba bàpfuul mun u mpaan a ndwà, waa bun'tɔɔl kusà a Yɛsu u mii a baar banswà. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Mpal kàmɛn nde làkwikilà aba, Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Mbuur wà, mɛ amadwääl nkul a man'be angye. » <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn waa bàyweerà u mpem aba naa: « Nà mbuur awà? Nde wàmubɛy Nzam. Nà kan'kwo mudwa nkul a man'be isàkal naa kà Nzam anki? » <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàyöb nde ankyän aba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « An'kyän nà bɛ làwe amà u mpem abɛ? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Undiir nà akɔ̈ɔ̈n mpay mutɛn: Bàmadwääl nkul angye, lɛɛ mutɛn naa: Mbarà, kyen? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Apanà, yubwaŋ bɛ làyöb naa Mwan a mbuur we anà ikɔ̈b mudwääl baar nkul a man'be aba u mɛɛn pà. » Nde kàswɛŋ mbuur aŋàkwɛkà naa: « Mɛ amaswaŋ, mbarà, sɛn ipɔy angye, furà ndwà angye. » <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Taaŋ nsil alan, u mii a baar banswà, laa kàmbarà nde, kàsɛn nde ipɔy ande, waa kàfurà ndwà ande wàmuyisà Nzam làkoo. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Baar banswà bàkäl mubem, waa bàsyäŋà Nzam. Unsà bɔɔmà ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Bi kan'man indiir ibaŋ ŋàbawà. »<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'bel Lɛvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Ungö apan Yɛsu kàtoo nde, nde kàmɛn un'füür a itɛr mwɛy ikɔb ande Lɛvi kan'bwaay kà ikal a isal ande. Nde kàtɛn a nde naa: « Yan'läb. » <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Nde sye laa kàsàwɛy nde indiir byanswà, waa kun'läb. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Lɛvi kàwɛl Yɛsu unsà ubwaŋ banswà u ndwà ande. Afüür a itɛr mbɔɔn anà baar asin bàkäl mudyà anà nde u mɛsà. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn bàkyer aŋüŋün, waa bàtɛn a alɔŋki a Yɛsu naa: « Ntɔn nkye làkadyaa bɛ ikal imwɛy anà afüür a itɛr anà baar a man'be? » <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Kà baar abye anà ngwal u ndür anki bye anà mfun a un'ngaŋ, wɛɛ aŋukyal. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Mɛ kàyi anki muleŋ mbuul a mpem a baar a balàbal, wɛɛ mbuul a mpem a baar a man'be. »<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà nkin a mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Amfarisi bàtɛn ande naa: « Alɔŋki a Ywan anà alɔŋki abi bàfàkin mbɔr mbalà mbɔɔn anà muyamà Nzam, wɛ alɔŋki angye isal aba udyà anà unwà. » <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Nde kafuur naa: « Nkye asam a mbuur kan'tà bɔr ban'kwo bàkin mbɔr isàkal naa nde wà paa anà ba? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Ilä kyà paa bàsàlwom ba un'tɛɛl a bɔr, apan ba waa bàsàkin mbɔr. »<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Nde kàfatɛɛl nsim yi: « Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki muwal itɛɛnà a ipfɛy akün ntɔn mubaay ipfɛy aŋànün. Ntɔn itɛɛnà akin iyàpà anki ubwaŋ unsà ipfɛy aŋànün. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy sye ukwe anki musà man akün uboo a mbeen itaan: naa tɛy, man akün iyàpfuul mbeen itaan, waa ipää, mbeen sye waa ikyà bwà. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Yubwaŋ musà man akün u mbeen akün. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mukwen man akün isàkal naa nde akyàfuràtànwà man itaan, ntɔn nde ayàtɛn naa: "Man a itaan mà ntsà." »<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Màt 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä a saba mwey, Yɛsu kàkäl mulyaaŋ uboo a an'ywaŋ a blɛ. Alɔŋki ande bàbwee imfà, ungö mupfipfiy bya kà an'kɔɔ aba, waa bàdyee mbɛŋ a bya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Amfarisi amwɛy bàkäl paa bàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye làkyerà bɛ ndaa mpa bàfàkyer kà ilä a saba? » <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Nkye bɛ làtäŋ anki ndaa kàkyer David mpal kàwem nde ngyal anà baar bàkäl anà nde? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Nde kàbilà u ndwà a Nzam, kàwɛl mampà ufàpà ibɔɔn akà Nzam laa kàdi nde, mumwɛy nde kàpɛ akà baar bàkäl anà nde, itàkal naa ma angaŋ mpɛl bàfàdyà. » <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Nde waa kàfàkwɛy abà: « Mwan a mbuur wà mfum a saba. »<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur aŋàkwɛkà kɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Màt 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Yàmɛnà sye naa ilä a saba kyumwɛy Yɛsu kàbilà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, waa kàlɔɔŋà. Uboo kwo kàkäl anà mbuur kàkäl anà kɔɔ ibaal làŋàkwɛkà. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà Amfarisi bàkäl musyebà Yɛsu a duu ntɔn muyöb naa nkye nde akyer akɔɔr mbuur ilä a saba, ntɔn ba bun'bämà ndaa. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Wɛɛ nde kàkyer ayöb an'kyän aba, waa kàbel mbuur kàkäl anà kɔɔ aŋàkwɛkà: « Mbarà, mbar uboboo pà. » Mbuur awà waa kàmbarà, waa kàmbär uboboo a baar. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yɛsu waa kafuul naa: « Mɛ in'kwen muyöb: Nkye yubwaŋ mukyer ubwaŋ lɛɛ mukyer ube ilä a saba? Mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbuur lɛɛ mukɔɔn atswà wa ilä a saba? » <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàler ba banswà, waa kàtɛn a mbuur awun naa: « Sen kɔɔ angye. » Nde sye waa kàsen la, laa làkɔɔrà la. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn anà Amfarisi bàwem nkyɛl, waa bàsɛmà mutɛn ba a ba naa ba ininà bàkyer akà Yɛsu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'sɔɔl antööm kwem aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Màt 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Mpal ayin Yɛsu kàlär udu a mɔŋ ntɔn mukàyamà. Nde kwo kàkyer mpib aŋun'kiinà muyamà Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Taaŋtyà, nde kàbel alɔŋki ande, waa kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l kwem aŋiyweel uboo a ba, nde kapɛ ikɔb naa antööm: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simɔn, nde kun'pɛ ikɔb a Petɔlà, un'tɔŋ ande Andrɛ, Zyak, Ywan, Filipo, Bàtelàmay, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Màtay, Tuma, Zyak mwan a Alfɛ, Simɔn mbuur a mankay, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yudà mwan a Zyak, anà Yudas Iskaryɔt, mbuur ayun'yälà.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wàmulɔŋ anà mukɔɔr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Màt 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Ungö apan nde kàyàtyà anà ba, waa bàmbär kà ikal mwɛy kyà ibär, ikal bàkäl alɔŋki ande mbɔɔn anà un'kàbɔ a baar: baar a Yuday lanswà, bà Yɛlusàlɛm, anà baar bàfü un'kɔɔl a an'dà, a Tir anà Sidɔn. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Ba bàyi ntɔn mukun'wem anà ba bàkɔɔrà unsà an'kyal aba. Baar bàkäl anà an'dweelà an'be, bàkyer akɔɔrà. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Baar banswà bàleŋà muba nde u ndür, ntɔn ngwal mbɔɔn yàkatoo u ndür ande, ya yàkɔɔrà ba banswà.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'sak anà ngyɛb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Màt 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Apan Yɛsu kàler alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛn naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">« Un'sak akà bɛ aŋàlàmbwà, ntɔn imwol a Nzam kye anà bɛ!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Un'sak akà bɛ baar làwe anà ngyal mpalàbà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">ntɔn bɛ làkyer asàyuur!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Un'sak akà bɛ baar làlelà ŋàbawà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">ntɔn bɛ làkyer asàsɛ!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>« Un'sak asàkal akà bɛ isàkal naa ba bàmàlàyiiŋ, bàmàlàböŋ, bàmàlato, bàmàlapiy asànaa undiir a ŋingyäy ntɔn Mwan a mbuur! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Làkäl unsà un'sak mpal isàkwo ndaa ayin ntɔn bweel abɛ làsàkal mbɔɔn u du, ntɔn bànkaa aba bàkyerà abà akà aŋangɔɔm. »<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>« Wɛɛ ngyɛb akà bɛ, aŋun'naaŋ, ntɔn bɛ ndɛɛl abɛ lan'wal nsil apà.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Ngyɛb akà bɛ baar lan'yuur mpalàbà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">ntɔn bɛ làsàwem ngyal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ngyɛb akà bɛ baar làsɛɛ mpalàyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">ntɔn bɛ làsàkal kun'saabà anà uboo a ilel.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Ngyɛb, isàkal naa baar bàfàtɛn ndaa aŋàbwaŋ mpɛl akà bɛ, ntɔn bànkaa aba bàkyerà abà akà aŋangɔɔm a loor.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwen ntɔn ayiiŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Màt 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>« Wɛɛ bɛ baar banswà làweemà mɛ, mɛɛ alàkyään abà: Lakwen ayiiŋ abɛ, làkyer ubwaŋ akà baar bàfàlakyer ube, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>làfuum làpɛɛm akà baar bàfàlaküül anà làyamà ntɔn baar bàfàlatwee. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kàmapà mbar u twam, fàlɛɛ twam lumwɛy. Isàkal naa mbuur kan'gyɔɔr inkur angye, twon amun'tsuŋ muwal kàzak angye. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Pà akà mbuur wanswà kan'lɔm, wɛɛ twon an'lɔm undiir angye akà mbuur kan'gyɔɔr wa. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Undiir wanswà akwen ngye naa baar bàkyer akà ngye, kyer abun sye akà baar bumwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Isàkal naa ngye afàkwen baar bàfakwen, ngye bweel nà an'wal uboo kwo? Baar abɛ sye bàfàkwen baar bàfakwen. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Isàkal naa ngye ubwaŋ afàkyer akà baar bàfakyer ubwaŋ, ngye bweel nà an'wal uboo kwo? Baar abɛ sye bàfàkyer abun. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Isàkal naa ngye afàsɔɔm baar an'sà ngye làkyän naa ba bàkyer asafuur, bweel nà ngye an'wal? Ntɔn baar abɛ sye bàfàpà akà baar abɛ ntɔn ba sye bàfàwal asànaa ban'pà ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Làkwen ayiiŋ abɛ, làkyer ubwaŋ, làpɛ ukɔɔn adil bweel. Waa bweel abɛ làsàkal làkölàköl, bɛ sye làsàkal baan a Mwol a du, ntɔn nde afàswaŋ ubwaŋ ande akà baar bàfàfuur ube kà ikal a ubwaŋ anà akà baar abɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Làkäl baar aŋàyɔl a ukwen ntɔn Taaràbɛ wàŋàyɔl a ukwen. »<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Twon lan'tsul nsaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Màt 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>« Twon lan'tsüül baar nsaŋ, waa bɛ sye mpa bàsàlatsüül nsaŋ. Twon lan'pà baar ikwàndwà, waa bɛ sye mpa bàsàlapà ikwàndwà. Làdwääl nkul, waa bɛ sye bàsàladwääl nkul. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Làpɛ, waa bɛ bàsàlapà: bàsàyööl mpàkɔr a kölàköl a ipfɛy abɛ a mbäl aŋàbwaŋ, yàŋàkinà, yàŋàndyeer, yàŋàpää. Ntɔn Nzam an'kab ande akà bɛ nde asàsi unsà isii làfàsyääl bɛ ntɔn baar bumwɛy. »<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a ba u itim naa: « Nkye ikwàmii kan'kwo musyen ikwàmii wumwɛy? Nkye ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkàbwà anki u fu? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Un'lɔŋki ukwe anki mulyaaŋ un'lɔɔŋ ande. Wɛɛ un'lɔŋki afàsyääl ndaa a un'lɔɔŋ ande afàbulà asànaa un'lɔɔŋ ande. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ntɔn nkye amanà ngye isɛrà a un'lɛŋ akyà u dii a un'tɔŋ angye, wɛ ngye amanà anki kyɔɔl là u dii angye? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ngye an'kwo aben mutɛn a un'tɔŋ angye naa: "Un'tɔŋ, yà mɛ alwom isɛrà a un'lɛŋ ki u dii angye", ngye mbuur mpa akamanà kyɔɔl alà u dii angye? Mbuur a mpem yweel, twab atàlwom kyɔɔl là u dii angye, ungö apan ngye waa ayàman ubwaŋàbwaŋ ntɔn ngye alwom isɛrà a un'lɛŋ ki u dii a un'tɔŋ angye. »<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'te anà mbɛŋ awa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Màt 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:33-35">Mlk 12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn naa: « Un'te aŋàbwaŋ ufàbɔr anki mbɛŋ ambe, un'te un'be sye ufàbɔr anki mbɛŋ aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Ntɔn un'te wanswà bàfàyöb unsà mbɛŋ a wa. Fige bàfàkwol anki unsà ibwiy a nsyeenà, rɛzɛ sye bàfàbwo anki u mikyɛl. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mbuur aŋàbwaŋ afàwal ndaa aŋàbwaŋ unsà an'kyän aŋàbwaŋ màfàtoo u mpem ande, wɛɛ mbuur un'be afàwal ndaa a mbe unsà an'kyän ande mube. Ntɔn ndaa yanswà ufàtɛn mbuur ifàfà u mpem ande. »<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndwà yweel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Màt 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>« Wɛɛ Ntɔn nkye lan'beelà bɛ naa Mwol, Mwol, wɛɛ bɛ ndaa amɛ làfàlab anki? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Mɛ in'kyer ayàlàswaŋ naa mbuur afàwem ndaa amɛ anà afàsyääl ya, nde wà nà: <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Nde wà asànaa mbuur kàkwen mutoŋ ndwà ande, kàkyer atim, ufàtim, waa kàmɛn nkɔŋ ntɔn musà un'bään a ntööŋ udu a nkɔŋ ayi. Mbul a ngwal kànɔ̈ wa, un'pöb a ngwal kàni wa ndwà ayin, wɛɛ ndwà ayin yàbü anki ntɔn ya bàtɔ̈ŋ udu a nkɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Wɛɛ mbuur afàwem ndaa amɛ wɛɛ nde ya ufàsyääl anki, wà asànaa mbuur kàtɔ̈ŋ ndwà ande udu a ansɛŋ ukɔɔn un'bään, ibɔɔ a an'dà laa byà ni bya ndwà ayin, laa yàbwabà ya. »<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr un'syääl a mfum a aŋità a Lɔmà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Màt 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Ungö mutɛn a baar ndaa yanswà kàkwen nde mutɛn, Yɛsu kàkyen Kapɛrnawum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Un'tsüüŋ a kaptɛn mwɛy aŋità a Lɔmà kàfakweenà nde mbɔɔn kàkäl anà ukyal, tsütsü mukwà. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Mpal kàwem nde làsaŋ a Yɛsu, nde kàtöm abyääl a Ayudà ntɔn ba bàkun'bɔɔn naa nde uyàkɔɔr un'tsüüŋ ande. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Ba waa bàyi akà Yɛsu, bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n, waa bàtɛn naa: « Mbuur wà kan'kwo muwal bweel aŋàkwo, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>ntɔn nde afàkwen nsi abi, nde sye kàtöŋ ndwà a nköŋ abi a ngim ande ŋakwo. » <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yɛsu kàkyen anà ba. Mpal kàkäl nde tsütsü a ndwà a mbuur awun, mbuur wa kàtɔ̈m asam ande ntɔn mutɛn naa: « Mwol, twon an'pà ndür ngye mpay. Mɛ in'wà mbuur a man'be, mɛ in'kwe anki muwal ngye u ndwà amɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Lalan mpa in'yi mɛ, mɛ ŋakwo. Tɛn ngɔk mwɛy ntɔn un'tsüüŋ amɛ ukɔɔrà. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ntɔn mɛ ŋakwo in'wà mfum u ngyɛl, wɛɛ mɛ in'we anà aŋità in'fàler mɛ, mɛ in'sàtɛn a umwɛy naa: "Kyen", laa ukyà nde. Mɛ in'sàtɛn a wàsin naa: "Yà", laa uyà nde. Mɛ in'sàtɛn a un'tsüüŋ amɛ naa: "Kyer abà", laa ukyer nde. » <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Mpal kàwem Yɛsu ndaa ayi, nde kàkyey kaptɛn awà, waa ubulà, uler baar banswà bàyun'labà, waa kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ, mɛ alàkyään, itàkal kà Isàlɛl mɛ ŋàtàman anki làkwikilà a mbɔɔn abà. » <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Baar kàtöm kaptɛn, bàfurà ba ndwà ande, ba bàmɛn un'tsüüŋ ande wàŋàkɔɔrà.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'wiy mwan a un'kweel a un'dim mwɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Yàkäl naa ilä kyàlääb pa, Yɛsu kàkyen bul mwey ikɔb a la Nayin. Alɔŋki ande anà un'sɛŋ a baar bàkäl mukyà anà nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Mpal kàkäl nde tsütsü a bul alan, iköŋ a baar kyàkäl mukàdyee ndom, mwan baal mwɛy mpɛl wà un'kweel a un'dim mwɛy. Baar a bul alan mbɔɔn bàkäl anà nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Mpal kun'mɛn Mwol, ngyɛb yàkyer un'käär, waa kun'kyään naa: « Twon an'lel! » <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Nde kàsin tsütsü a un'böl, waa kàbä wa. Baar bàyisyeenà wa laa bàmbär ba. Nde waa kàtɛn naa: « Mwan baal, mɛ amaswaŋ, wiyà! » <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Ndom waa ubwaay, waa usɛmà muyäm. Yɛsu waa kun'fuur akà ngwän. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Baar banswà bàkäl u bɔɔmà anà musyäŋà Nzam, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Ŋangɔɔm a kölàköl kan'too uboo a bi, Nzam kan'yàbay baar ande. » <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Làsaŋ a Yɛsu alà làkyer apää u Yuday lanswà anà kà an'bul a tsütsü manswà.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akyeey a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Màt 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Alɔŋki a Ywan bàkyer un'kyäänà ndaa ayi. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Nde kàbel abɔ̈ɔ̈l uboo a ba, waa katöm akà Mwol ntɔn ba bun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye awà Klistɔ awà ayàyà, lɛɛ bi ikyer adil wàsin? » <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Mpal bàkɔlà ba apà Yɛsu, ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Ywan Un'düümà kàmitɔm akà ngye ntɔn muyöb naa nkye ngye awà mbuur awayàyà, lɛɛ bi ikyer adil wàsin? » <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Taaŋ nsil alan, Yɛsu waa ukɔɔr baar a an'kyal mbɔɔn, baar bàkäl anà an'too anà baar bàkäl anà an'dweelà an'be, waa uduub mii a ikwàmii mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Nde kafuur abà: « Kàlun'kyään Ywan ndaa yanswà lan'man anà lan'wem bɛ: Ikwàmii bàmuman, ikar bàmumbarà, baar a ukyal a bay bàmupɔŋà, ikwan'tsü bàmuwem, ndom yàmuwiyà, ndaa a Nzam bàmulɔŋ akà aŋàlàmbwà. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Un'sak akà mbuur mpa asàpiy làkwikilà ande amu mɛ. »<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Ungö a nkyeen a alɔŋki a Ywan, Yɛsu kàsɛmà mutà imbäl a Ywan: « Bɛ ininà làkàler u nsye a ipɔl? Kite a iful kànini un'pöb? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Wɛɛ bɛ ininà làkàler? Mbuur kàbwäärà a ntwɛn? Làler, baar bàfàbwaar ipfɛy a ntal anà bàfàkal unsà un'naaŋ, bàfàkal uboo a ndwà a amfum. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Bɛ ininà làkàler? Ŋangɔɔm mwɛy? Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, nde kan'söön ŋangɔɔm. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Nde wà mbuur awà bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">"Le, mɛ an'tɔm un'kyeey amɛ kusà angye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">ntɔn muyilà mbwo angye kusà a ngye."<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>« Mɛ alàkyään naa uboo a baar banswà kàbör un'kaar, akà umwɛy kàmusöön watɛy. Wɛɛ kimbuur ikikye uboo a Imwol a Nzam kàmun'söön. » <verse eid="LUK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Baar banswà bàweemà ndaa ande, itàkal afüür a itɛr, bàkyer akyey naa Nzam wà balàbal, lalan bàkyeenà ba mukàwal ndüümà a Ywan. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Wɛɛ amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn bàtön ndaa kàkwen Nzam ntɔn ba anà ndüümà a Ywan. <verse eid="LUK 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn naa: « Mɛ baar a taaŋ alà an'kwo mukasi anà nà? Ba bà asànaa bànà? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Ba bà asànaa baan bàfàmbàmbar u balàbal anà bàfàtɛn ba a ba naa: Bi kàlabɛɛrà mfuŋ, wɛɛ bɛ làkyen anki, bi kàlàtɔ̈ɔ̈l an'diim a ilel, wɛɛ bɛ làlel anki. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Ntɔn Ywan Un'düümà kàkyer ayà, kàdyee anki nsɔ, kànwee anki man, wɛɛ bɛ làtɛɛnà naa: Nde we anà dweelà a làbe. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Mwan a mbuur kan'yà, akyer adyà, akyer anwà, wɛɛ bɛ làtɛn naa: "Awà wà ndyeel anà un'nweel a man, un'sam a afüür a itɛr anà baar a man'be." <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Wɛɛ an'yeerà a Nzam, baar bàfàman naa ma màbalàbal bà baar bàfàkyey ma. »<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu u ndwà a umfarisi Simɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Yàmɛnà naa umfarisi mwɛy kàbel Yɛsu mukàdyà u ndwà ande. Yɛsu kàbilà nde u ndwà a mbuur awun, waa kàsɛmà mudyà u mɛsà. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>U bul alan kàkäl anà un'kaar a pasàsɛ mwɛy. Mpal kàwem nde naa Yɛsu wàmudyà u ndwà a mbuur awun, nde kàyàbilà anà làbuuŋ a pɛɛl làŋàyɔl a may a usɔŋ, <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>nde kàbü ungö a Yɛsu kà in'kɔl ande. Nde kàkäl mulel, nsaaŋ ande yàbwee kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu, waa kàkɔɔmà ya a ntswe ande, kàndüürà mya, waa kàkiirà mya may a usɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Un'mfarisi awà kàbel Yɛsu u ndwà ande kàmɛn nde abun, laa kàyweerà nde u mpem naa: « Mbuur wà ulàkal ŋangɔɔm a ndandaa, nde akyer alàyöb naa un'kaar awà wà nà, nde akyer alàyöb naa nde wà un'kaar a pasàsɛ. » <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur u ndaa a dudu naa: « Simɔn, mɛ in'we anà kindaa muyäm anà ngye. » Nde kàfuur naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, yäm. » <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yɛsu naa: « Ilä mwɛy un'pɛɛl a nkul mwɛy kàkäl anà asɔ̈ɔ̈m abɔ̈ɔ̈l. Wàtàtwɛb kàlun'fuur an'falà nkam tyeen, wàyweel an'falà an'kwem an'tyeen. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Baar abà bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkäl anki anà ngim mukun'fuur. Nde waa kadwääl nkul. Uboo a baar abà bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l, nà ayun'kwen aŋàsöön? » <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simɔn kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ in'kasii naa mbuur awà kàdwääl nde nkul a mbɔɔn. » Yɛsu naa: « An'man, ngye an'yweer ubwaŋ. »<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu waa uler un'kaar awun, waa utɛn a Simɔn naa: « Ngye akyun'manà un'kaar wà? In'bilà mɛ u ndwà angye, ngye an'dà an'pɛ anki muywɛy in'kɔl, wɛɛ nde, nde mya kan'ywɛy a nsaaŋ ande anà kan'kɔɔm mya a ntswe ande. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ngye mɛ andüür anki, wɛɛ nde, sɛmà in'bilà mɛ nde uyɔ̈n anki mundüür in'kɔl amɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Ngye mɛ may a usɔŋ an'tsüül anki kun'tswe, wɛɛ nde, nde kan'tsuul may a usɔŋ kà in'kɔl amɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Lalan mɛ akyään naa bàkyun'dwääl nkul a man'be ande manswà, ntɔn nde kan'kwen mbɔɔn. Wɛɛ mbuur akwà bàmun'dwääl nkul a man'be ikikye, nde akwen sye ikikye. » <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Waa nde kàtɛn a un'kaar awun naa: « Mɛ amadwääl nkul a man'be angye. » <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Baar bumwɛy bàkäl anà nde bàtɛɛnà u mpem naa: « Mbuur awà wà nà, nde mudwääl baar nkul a man'be aba? » <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Waa Yɛsu kàtɛn a un'kaar awun naa: « Làkwikilà angye làmatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈, kyen unsà duu. »<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Akaar bàyikyeenà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Yàkäl naa ungö a an'taaŋ, Yɛsu kàkyen uboo a an'bul a kölàköl anà an'bul ikikye ntɔn mulɔŋ anà mupay làsaŋ a Ndaa Aŋàbwaŋ yà Imwol a Nzam, alɔŋki bàkwem aŋiyweel bàkäl anà nde <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>anà akaar amwɛy kàkɔɔr nde unsà an'dweelà an'be anà an'kyal mà ifà ifà: Màlye bàfabeelà un'nsi Magàdala, uboo ande insɔŋà nsambwaar myàtoo, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Zyan, un'kyay a Shuzà mbuur a isal a Ɛlɔdi, Suzan, anà akaar asin bàyibayà Yɛsu anà alɔŋki ande unsà indiir aba.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a un'köön</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Màt 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Baar mbɔɔn bàfü an'bul a kölàköl bàyàköŋ apà Yɛsu. Nde katɛɛl nsim yi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>« Un'köön mwɛy kàtoo mukàkɔn mbɛŋ ande. Umpal kàmwɛŋ nde ya, yar làmwɛy làbü u mbwo: baar bàndyaar ya, nɛn a du waa yàdi ya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Yar lumwɛy làbü udu a nkɔŋ: mpal yàmɛn ya, bite laa byàyöm bya, ntɔn mɛɛn màkäl màŋàyɔm. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Yar lumwɛy làbü uboo a nsyeenà: nsyeenà yàyɛl mbwo mwɛy anà in'te, waa yàfwee mya. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Yar lumwɛy làbü u mɛn aŋàbwaŋ: mpal làyɛl la, la làbör mbɛŋ mbɔɔn: imbɛŋ mwɛy kyàbör mbɛŋ nkam anà nkam. » Yɛsu waa kàkwɛy abà: « Wɛy mbuur awe anà an'tsü awem uwem. »<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntɔn nkye Yɛsu ufàsyääl nde nsim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Màt 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Alɔŋki ande bun'fuul naa nsim ayi iswaŋà aben. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Nde kafuur naa: « Bweel a bɛ là naa bɛ làkyàyöb ngyee a imwol a Nzam, wɛ akà baar bumwɛy, ndaa ayi bàfakyään unsà nsim. Ntɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">"itàkal naa ba bàkyer aleerà, ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n aman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">"itàkal naa ba bàkyer aweemà, ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayöb." »<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wàmubuul nsim a un'köön</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Màt 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>« Mpalàbà làwem mbuul a nsim ayi: Mbɛŋ yà ndaa a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Kɔl a mbwo, là baar bàfàwem ndaa a Nzam, wɛɛ Satanà waa uyàlwom ya u mpem aba ntɔn ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n asà làkwikilà anà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n awà möö. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Udu a nkɔŋ yà baar bàfàwem ndaa a Nzam anà bàfàwal ya unsà un'sak, wɛɛ ba ya bàfàkaar anki u mpem aba, làkwikilà aba bwɛl latɛy. La in'swɛy myatɛy, isàkal naa mpay yan'yà, ba ban'piy làkwikilà aba. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Mbɛŋ yàbü u nsyeenà yà baar bàfàwem ndaa a Nzam, wɛɛ ba ya bàfàküünà a mpay anà ngyal a indiir a mɛɛn. Abun ya ifàbɔr anki mbɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Mbɛŋ yàbü u mɛn aŋàbwaŋ yà baar bàfàwem ndaa a Nzam anà bàfàwal ya unsà un'sak, bàfàkaar ya u mpem aba anà bàfàsyääl ya. Ya ifàbɔr mbɛŋ. »<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a mwinà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>Yɛsu kàläb abà: « Akà mbuur mwey ukwe anki mukyä mwinà waa ukümà wa kantin, itàkal usi wa ungyɛl a itäb. Wɛɛ nde wa asà udu a ikɔlà a un'te ntɔn baar bàbilà u ndwà bàmɛn pɛɛlà. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Undiir wanswà wàŋàyee ŋàbawà, akyer asàmɛnà u pɛɛlà. Undiir wanswà wà unku, baar bàkyer asàyöb wa, wa sye asàmɛnà u leŋ. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Làlɛɛ an'tsü abɛ ntɔn muwem ubwaŋàbwaŋ, ntɔn bàsàkwɛy akà mbuur awe anà undiir, wɛ akà mbuur mpa awe anà undiir bàsàlwom undiir ufàsi nde naa nde we anà wa. »<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwän anà atɔŋ a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Màt 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Yàmɛnà naa ngwän anà atɔŋ a Yɛsu bàyi muyàbwey anà nde, wɛɛ yàkäl mpay ba mukun'man ntɔn baar bàkäl mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Baar bun'kyään naa: « Ngwa anà atɔŋ angye bà unsà, ba bàkwen mukaman. » <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Nde kafuur naa: « Maa anà atɔŋ amɛ bà baar bàfàwem ndaa a Nzam anà bàfàsyääl ya. »<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kwaam un'pöb</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Màt 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Yàlɔ̈m naa ilä mwɛy, Yɛsu kàbilà u bwaar a kölàköl anà alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Tsweenà bi isabà sim a ɛwà. » Ba waa bàkyen. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Mpal bàkäl ba mubweel, Yɛsu waa kàbɔ̈ɔ̈n. Kà imbürà, un'pöb a ngwal kàyi udu a ɛwà. An'dà waa màsɛmà mubilà u bwaar, ba bàkäl u mpay a ukwà. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Alɔŋki bàsin tsütsü apà Yɛsu, waa bun'wiy anà in'kwɛŋ u mun: « Un'lɔɔŋ, Un'lɔɔŋ, bi abà ikwà! » Nde waa usubà, waa uŋän un'pöb anà ibɔ a kölàköl byà an'dà: bya waa byàkwamà, duu waa làbilà. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Làkwikilà abɛ làken? » Wɛɛ ba bàkäl u bɔɔmà anà unsà ubem, ba bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Baal awà wà nà? Nde wàmuŋän un'pöb anà ibɔ a an'dà, bya sye byàmukun'weemà. »<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr baal kàkäl anà an'dweelà an'be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Màt 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Ba bàkɔlà u mɛɛn a Ngɛlàsà u sim a Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Pa kàtɔ̈l Yɛsu làkɔl u mɛɛn, mbuur mwɛy wà bul alan kàkäl anà insɔŋà mbɔɔn, nde kàyi akà Yɛsu. Sɛmà itaan nde kàkälà nsàpɔl. Nde kàkweenà anki mukal u ndwà, nde kàfabwaayà uboboo a an'dii. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Mpal kàmɛn nde Yɛsu, nde kabü kà in'kɔl ande, waa kàlal in'kwɛŋ mutɛn u ndaa a ngwal naa: « Yɛsu, Mwan a Nzam a Dudu, mɛ anà ngye un'tüüb nà? Mɛ amabɔɔn, twon aman'pà mpay. » <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Yɛsu waa kàböŋ insɔŋà myàkäl uboo a mbuur awà. Ntɔn mya myun'bilà itaan. Ba bàfun'bäämà an'dwaaŋ anà impaaŋ a in'te kà an'kɔɔ anà kà in'kɔl ntɔn nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n atiin. Wɛɛ nde kàkyer afatsuulà mya myanswà, insɔŋà myun'syeenà u nsye a ipɔl. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuul naa: « Ikɔb angye nà? » Nde kàfuur naa: « Un'kàbɔ. » Ntɔn insɔŋà mbɔɔn myàbilà amu ande.<verse eid="LUK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Insɔŋà amin myàbɔ̈ɔ̈n Yɛsu naa nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akatɔm uboo a un'baan. <verse eid="LUK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Wɛɛ tsütsü apan làkäl anà làböl a ngul làmuyidyà udu a mɔŋ, lalan myàlɔ̈m mya akà Yɛsu naa mya myàbilà uboo a ngul. Nde waa kapɛ mbwo. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Apan, insɔŋà myàtoo mya unsà mbuur awun, mya myàbilà u ngul ayin, làböl a ngul waa làparà ntiin fà iköl a mɔŋ, laa làkàbwà la kà an'dà, waa làminà. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Aseey bàmɛn ba abun, laa bàtiin ba, bàkyen ba mukàpay làsaŋ kà an'bul anà kà itsuŋ a ndwà. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Baar bàyi ntɔn muyöb naa ya yàlyaaŋ aben. Mpal bàyàtol ba tsütsü apà Yɛsu, bàmɛn ba ŋukɔŋ akyàbwaay kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu, akyàbwaar, akyàkal a duu, ba bàmɛn bɔɔmà. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Baar bàkäl paa mpal kàkɔɔr nde ŋukɔŋ, bàkyäänà baar naa nde kun'kɔɔr aben. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Kyakin baar a Ngɛlàsa banswà bàkäl ba u bɔɔmà, waa bàlɔ̈m akà Yɛsu mulwomà apà ba. Nde kàbilà u bwaar ntɔn mufurà. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mbuur awà kàkɔɔrà unsà an'dweelà an'be kàlɔ̈m akà Yɛsu naa nde uyilyaaŋ anà nde, wɛɛ Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>« Furà ndwà angye, kyen kakyään ndaa yanswà kan'kyer Nzam akà ngye. » Lalan mbuur awà kàkàpay nde làsaŋ a ndaa yanswà kàkyer Yɛsu akà nde u bul lanswà.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwan a Zayirɔs wà un'kaar anà un'kaar kàbä Yɛsu kà ipfɛy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Màt 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Mpal kàfurà Yɛsu Ngalilɛ, baar banswà bun'wɛl unsà ubwaŋ banswà, ntɔn ba bàkäl mukun'dilà. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Apan mbuur mwɛy ikɔb ande Zayirɔs laa kàyi nde. Nde kàkäl mfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Nde kàbü kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu, waa kun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n naa nde ukyen ndwà ande: <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>mwan ande mwɛy mpɛl wà un'kaar wà tsütsü mbul kwem aŋiyweel kàkäl musyäämà mɔ̈ɔ̈.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yɛsu waa kàkyen ndwà a mbuur awun. Apan, baar mbɔɔn bàyibääbà u mbil a ndür ande. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Uboo a baar aban kàkäl anà un'kaar mwɛy kàyimanà an'kil mbul kwem aŋiyweel. Nde kàdwä ngim mbɔɔn akà angaŋ, wɛɛ nde kàkɔɔra anki. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Nde kàsin tsütsü ungö a Yɛsu, waa kun'bä u làpan a ipfɛy ande. Taaŋ nsil alan an'kil laa màtsü ma mutoo. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yɛsu waa kàfuul naa: « Nà kàman'ba? » Wɛɛ akà mbuur mwɛy kàkyey anki. Petɔlà waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ambà Un'lɔɔŋ, baar bàmasà uboboo, bà mbɔɔn bà imbäm'dir anà ngye. » <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Nde waa kàtɛn naa: « Mbuur akyer an'ba: mɛ in'kyer awem naa dweelà a ngwal mwɛy lan'too u ndür amɛ. » <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Un'kaar awun kàmɛn nde naa undiir kàkyer nde kan'mɛnà u mii a baar, laa kàsin nde tsütsü apà Yɛsu, kàbü nde kà inkɔl ande, waa kàtɛn u mii a baar ntɔn nkye kun'bä nde anà muswaŋ naa taaŋ nsil alan nde waa kàkɔɔrà.<verse eid="LUK 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mangwa, làkwikilà angye làmatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈, kyen unsà duu. »<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Nde kàkäl anki aŋàtàmay mutɛn mpal kàyi mbuur kàfü ndwà a mfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Waa kun'kyään naa: « Mwan angye wà unkaar kan'kwà, twon afun'twääl Un'lɔɔŋ nkwom. » <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Mpal kàwem Yɛsu abwɛy, nde kàtɛn a Zayirɔs naa: « Twon an'man bɔɔmà, sà làkwikilà mpɛl, mwan angye akyer akɔɔrà. » <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Mpal kàkɔlà nde, Yɛsu kàkwen anki naa baar asin bàbilà u ndwà, wɛ Petɔlà, Ywan, Zyak, taar anà ngwän a mwan mpɛl. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ntsü yanswà baar bàkäl mulel. Yɛsu waa kàtɛn naa: « Twon lan'lel, nde ukü anki, nde kan'bɔ̈ɔ̈n twaal. » <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Wɛɛ ba bàkyer un'sɛɛ, ntɔn ba bàkyer ayöbà naa nde kàkäl aŋàkwà. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛ kɔɔ a kimwan un'kaar awun mpi, waa kàtɛn a nde u ndaa a ngwal naa: « Mwan amɛ, wiyà! » <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Laa kàwiyà nde, waa kàmbarà. Yɛsu kàswɛŋ naa ba bun'pɛ udyà. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Aböör a mwan un'kaar awun matɛɛr màkyer awal. Wɛɛ Yɛsu katsüŋ mukyään mbuur asin ndaa ayin.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Isal a antööm bàkwem aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Màt 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yɛsu kàtüüb antööm bàkwem aŋiyweel, waa kapɛ ngwal anà ikɔ̈b muböŋ insɔŋà myanswà anà mukɔɔr an'kyal. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Ungö apan, waa katöm mukàpay làsaŋ a Imwol a Nzam anà mukɔɔr an'kyal. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Twon lan'wal undiir ntɔn mbwo: itàkal unsɔk, itàkal ngɔɔr, itàkal isaa, itàkal ngim. Twon lan'syen inkur byeel. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Isàkal naa bàmàlawal u ndwà mwɛy, làbwaay apan tii taaŋ làsàlwomà bɛ kà ikal akin. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kàlawɛl anki, làlwomà u bul alan, sàlàkɔɔb un'twà a in'kɔl abɛ: kya isàkal imbäl ibe ntɔn ba. » <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Apan, alɔŋki bàkyen ba, ba bàyilyaaŋà bul a bul muyikyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ anà muyikɔɔr abɛy.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'kyän a Ɛlɔdi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Màt 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Mfum Ɛlɔdi kàwem nde ndaa ayi yanswà, nde kàyweerà naa nde akyer aben. Ntɔn baar mbɔɔn bàtɛɛnà naa Ywan kan'wiyà, <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>bumwɛy naa Ԑlya kan'fàmɛnà, wɛɛ bumwɛy naa umwɛy uboo a aŋangɔɔm bà itaan kan'wiyà. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Wɛɛ Ɛlɔdi kàtɛɛnà naa: « Mɛ Ywan kàkyun'tsul un'tswe: nà mbuur wa in'fiweemà mɛ làsaŋ a tub lalɛy? » Nde kàleŋà mukun'man.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'dii abaal nsaab tyeen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Màt 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ywn 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Mpal bàyàfurà antööm, ba bàkyäänà Yɛsu indiir byanswà bàkyer ba. Nde kawɛl, waa kasyen ukɔl, u bul mwɛy ikɔb a la Bɛtesayidà. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Baar mbɔɔn bàyöb ba naa Yɛsu anà alɔŋki ande bà u bul alan, laa baläb ba. Yɛsu kawɛl nde, laa kakyäänà nde ndaa a imwol a Nzam. Nde kàkɔɔr sye baar bàkäl anà ngyal akɔɔrà. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Mpal bàmɛn antööm bàkwem aŋiyweel naa taaŋ lan'sɛmà muminà, ba bàsin tsütsü apà Yɛsu, waa bun'kyään naa: « Apay baar, ba bàkyen kà an'bul anà u bitsuŋ a ndwà byà tsütsü ntɔn ba bàkàleŋ ikal abɔ̈ɔ̈n anà isaa adyà ntɔn bi apà ibà u nsye a ipɔl. » <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yɛsu waa kafuur naa: « La pɛ udyà bɛ ŋakwo. » Ba waa bun'fuur naa: « Bi iwe amà mampà tyeen anà nsö yweel, tɛn naa bi ŋakwo ikàsom isaa ntɔn mbul a baar wà. » <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Abaal bàkäl isii a nsaab tyeen. Yɛsu naa: « Làswɛŋ baar bàbwaay an'kwem an'tyeen, an'kwem an'tyeen. » <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Ba bàkyer abun, bàpɛ baar banswà ikal abwaay. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yɛsu kàwɛl mampà mà an'tyeen anà nsö yàyweel, waa kàler u du, kàfuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam. Ungö apan waa kàtsül mampà anà nsö, waa kàpɛ alɔŋki ande ntɔn mupà akà baar banswà. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Baar banswà waa bàdi, bàyüür. Itiir a mampà byàsäl mbɔↄn, bya byàyööl in'lwaŋ kwem aŋiyweel.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petɔlà kan'tɛn naa Yɛsu wà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Màt 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Ilä mwɛy Yɛsu kàkäl muyamà u mpey anà alɔŋki ande, waa kafuul naa: « Baar bàfàtɛn naa mɛ in'wà nà? » <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Ba bàfuur naa: « Ywan Un'düümà, bumwɛy, Ԑlya, bumwɛy, umwɛy uboo a aŋangɔɔm kan'wiyà. » <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Nde waa kafuul naa: « Wɛɛ bɛ ŋakwo làtɛn naa mɛ in'wà nà? » Petɔlà waa kàfuur naa: « Ngye awà Klistɔ a Nzam. »<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään nkweel ande anà ngwiiyà ande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Màt 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yɛsu katsüŋ mukyään mbuur akà ikikye. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Nde waa kàfàkwɛy naa: « Mwan a mbuur akyer aman mpay mbɔɔn. Andweer, amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàkyer un'tɔn, bàkyer un'dwa, waa ilä kyàtär nde akyer awiyà. »<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Ungö, nde waa kàtɛn akà baar banswà: « Isàkal naa mbuur akwen mukan'lab, wɛy nde ukɔɔb ndür ande, usɛn buur ande ilä byanswà, wɛy nde kan'läb. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Ntɔn mbuur usàkwen muyee möö ande, wa asàkyà bwà. Wɛɛ mbuur usàpiy möö ande ntɔn mɛ, nde asàtswà wa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Bweel nà mbuur kan'kwo muwal isàkal naa nde kan'wal mɛɛn manswà, wɛɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ukyà bwà? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Mbuur usàwem mɛ nswɛn anà ndaa amɛ, Mwan a mbuur sye asun'wem nswɛn mpal usàyà nde unsà làkoo ande anà là Taa anà là akyeey in'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, bàmbɔɔn uboo abɛ bàyàkal aŋàtàkwà anki kusà muman Imwol a Nzam. »<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyoolà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Màt 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Kà isii a ilä naan ungö a ndaa ayi, Yɛsu kàwɛl Petɔlà, Ywan anà Zyak, nde kàlär udu a mɔŋ ntɔn mukàyamà. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Mpal kàkäl nde muyamà, ntabwey ande waa yàsɔɔmà, ipfɛy ande kyàbulà kyà in'ŋyäŋ a pɛɛl. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Apan, baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkäl muyääm anà nde, ba bàkäl Mɔsɛ anà Ԑlya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>ban'yàmɛnà uboo a làkoo, bàmuyäämà ndaa ukàmay Yɛsu isal ande u Yɛlusàlɛm u mbwo a nkweel ande. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petɔlà anà bumwɛy bàkäl anà nde bàbɔ̈ɔ̈n twaal aŋàkir. Umpal bàsubà ba, ba bàmɛn làkoo a Yɛsu anà baar bööl bàkäl anà nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Umpal bàkaabà baar aban anà Yɛsu, Petɔlà kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, yà ubwaŋ naa bi ikäl apà, bi imbaar ntɛn, ntɛn tär: mwɛy ntɔn ngye, mwɛy ntɔn Mɔsɛ anà mwɛy ntɔn Ԑlya. » Kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ nde kàyöb anki undiir kàtɛɛnà nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Umpal kàkäl nde mutɛn, un'böŋ mwɛy waa kafwee. Alɔŋki bàkäl u bɔɔmà mpal bàmɛn ba naa ba ban'bilà uboo a un'böŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Uboo a un'böŋ ndaa waa itoo, waa itɛn naa: « Awà mwan amɛ, mwan kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l mɛ. Lun'wem! » <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Ungö a ndaa ayi, ba bàsàman Yɛsu aŋàyen mpɛl. Wɛɛ mpal ayin, ndaa ayi yanswà ba bàkäärà u mpem, ba akà mbuur mwɛy bàkyään anki.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr mwan kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Màt 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Taaŋtyà, ba bàkäl muyàtyà u mɔŋ, baar mbɔɔn bàyi mubwey a Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Waa le, uboo a baar abà, mbuur mwɛy kàlal in'kwɛŋ: « Un'lɔɔŋ, mɛ amabɔɔn, un'ler mwan baal amɛ! Mwan baal mwɛy awà mpɛl. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Dweelà a làbe làsun'bilà, kà imbürà nde asà in'kwɛŋ, laa lun'bwiy la, waa ugyɔrà an'te. La làfun'wɛy anki agyä, nde afàkwà lɛy. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Mɛ an'bɔɔn alɔŋki angye naa ba bun'böŋ, wɛɛ ba bàsàkwo anki. » <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yɛsu waa kaŋän: « Bɛ làbà baar làkɔ̈ɔ̈n làkwikilà, baar abe! mɛ anà bɛ ilä ikwɛ in'yàfàkal anà mukàlakaar? » Waa ubulà akà mbuur awun: « Un'twääl mwan angye! » <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Umpal kàkäl mwan musin tsütsü apà Yɛsu, dweelà a làbe lun'bwiy u mɛɛn, lun'ni a ngwal. Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàŋän dweelà a làbe, waa kàkɔɔr mwan awun, kun'fuur akà taarànde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Baar banswà bàkäl unsà ubem muman ibaŋ a Nzam.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yɛsu an'fàkyään nkweel ande</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Màt 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mbuur wanswà kàkäl mubem ndaa kàkyerà Yɛsu, nde kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>« Làkäär ndaa alàkyään mɛ yi apanà: Mwan a mbuur bàkyer ayun'yälà kà an'kɔɔ a baar. » <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Wɛ alɔŋki ande bàyöb anki ndaa ayi. Mbuul a ya bàkyer ayee ntɔn ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayöb. Ba bàmɛn bɔɔmà mufuul Yɛsu mbuul a ya.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nà awà mbuur a kölàköl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Màt 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Isür kyàkyer abilà uboo a antööm: ba bàkwen muyöb naa nà kan'söön uboo a ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yɛsu kàyöb nde an'kyän aba, nde kàtɛ mwan umbɛy mpi u kɔɔ, kun'si tsütsü apà nde, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mbuur awal mwan wà kà ikɔb amɛ, nde kan'wal mɛ ŋakwo, waa mbuur kàman'wal, nde kan'wal mbuur kan'töm. Ntɔn mbuur awà ikikye uboo abɛ, nde awun awà mbuur a kölàköl. »<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur mpa afàkyer bɛ ube wà anà bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Ywan waa kàsɛmà mutɛn naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi kàmɛn mbuur mwɛy wàmuböŋ an'dweelà an'be kà ikɔb angye, wɛɛ bi kun'tsüŋ mukyer abun ntɔn nde ngye ufalab anki anà bi. » <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yɛsu waa kàfuur naa: « Twon làmutsuŋ, ntɔn mbuur mpa afàtɔn bɛ, nde wà anà bɛ. »<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bul mwɛy là Samalya lan'tɔn muwal Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Taaŋ a Yɛsu mulwomà u mɛɛn làkäl tsütsü mukwo, nde kàsi ukwen mbɔɔn mukyà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Nde kàtöm akyeey kusà ande. Mpal bàkäl ba u mbwo, ba bàbilà u bul mwɛy là Samalya ntɔn mukun'yiil ikal. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Wɛɛ baar a Samalya bàtön mukun'wal ntɔn nde kàkäl mukyà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Mpal bàmɛn ba abun, alɔŋki ande Zyak anà Ywan bun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m naa: « Mwol, ipɛ mbwo bi iswɛŋ ipar a mbaa ifi du, kyabweel, waa ba bàkuŋà. » <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàbulà nde ntsü bàkäl ba, waa kaŋän. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Waa ba bàkyen bul asin.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bun'lab aben</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Màt 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Mpal bàkäl ba u mbwo, mbuur mwɛy kàyi nde, kàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Mɛ in'kyer ayalab ntsü yanswà ayàkyà ngye. » <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « In'kyɛŋ mye anà an'fu, nɛn a du ye anà an'yaab, wɛ Mwan a mbuur ikal musà un'tswe kyatɛy. »<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a mbuur mwɛy naa: « Yan'läb! » Mbuur awà waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, an'pɛ mbwo mɛ in'tàkàdyee taa. » <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Wɛy akü bàdyee akü aba. Wɛɛ ngye, kyen kapay làsaŋ a Imwol a Nzam! »<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Mbuur asin waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mɛ in'kyer ayalab, wɛɛ ngye tan'pà mbwo mɛ in'kàpà atɔŋ amɛ mbɔr a ntsüü. » <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Mbuur kan'sà kɔɔ ande mulem ywaŋ ande anà kan'wɛy la ntɔn mukyer undiir asin, nde ukwe anki uboo a Imwol a Nzam. »<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Isal a alɔŋki an'kwem nsambwaar aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàfàsɔɔl alɔŋki bumwɛy an'kwem nsambwaar aŋiyweel, waa katöm abɔ̈ɔ̈l abɔ̈ɔ̈l, ntɔn ba bàkyen kusà ande uboo a an'bul anà ntsü yanswà kàkwe nde mubilà. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Isaa uboo a ywaŋ byà mbɔɔn, wɛɛ baar abwo bya bà ikikye. Làlɔ̈m akà Mwol ŋaywaŋ mutɔm baar a isal mbɔɔn ntɔn ba bàbwe bya. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Làkyen: mɛ amàlatɔm asànaa baan a in'kɔk uboo a nkwee. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Twon lan'syen ngim, itàkal ngɔɔr, itàkal an'sàbar, wɛɛ twon lan'mbar u mbwo ntɔn muyipà baar mbɔr. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>U ndwà yanswà làbilà bɛ, tàlatɛɛnà naa: "Wɛy duu làkäl udu a ndwà yi." <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Isàkal naa we anà mbuur a duu u ndwà ayin, duu abɛ làyàbwaay udu ande, naa tɛy, duu làyàfurà akà bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Làkäl u ndwà ayin, làdi, lànü undiir wanswà bàlapà ba, ntɔn mbuur a isal afàwal làfur ande. Twon lan'kyà ndwà a ndwà. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>U bul lanswà làbilà bɛ isàkal naa bàmàlawal, làdi undiir wanswà bàlapà ba, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>làkɔɔr abɛy, lakyään naa: "Imwol a Nzam kyan'sin tsütsü apà bɛ." <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Wɛɛ u bul lanswà làbilà bɛ, isàkal naa bàlawɛl anki, làkyen unsà an'balàbal ala, làtɛn naa: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>"Bi kan'kɔɔb un'twà a bul abɛ kan'dyaar bi kà in'kɔl, wɛɛ làyöb naa Imwol a Nzam kyà tsütsü." <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Mɛ alàkyään naa ilä a nsaŋ, Sɔdɔm bàsun'pa anki mpay aŋàsöönà mpay a baar a bul alan. »<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'bul man'tɔn musà làkwikilà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Màt 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>« Ngyɛb akà ngye Kɔrazin! Ngyɛb akà ngye Bɛtesayidà! Ntɔn, ilàkal naa impà bàkyer akà bɛ, bàkyer u Tir anà u Sidɔn, abà itaan baar aba bàkyàbuul mpem, bàkyàbwaar ngɔɔr anà bàkyàkübà un'twà. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Lalan ilä a nsaŋ, Tir anà Sidɔn mpay a mbɔɔn bàsapà anki asànaa bàsàpà ba bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Waa ngye, ngye Kapɛrnawum, ngye akasii naa ngye asàlaar du? Ngye asàtyà an'lɔŋ! <verse eid="LUK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Mbuur usàwem bɛ, nde mɛ kan'wem, mbuur usàlapiy, nde mɛ kan'piy. Wɛɛ mbuur apiy mɛ, nde kan'piy mbuur kan'töm. »<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfurà a alɔŋki an'kwem nsambwaar aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Alɔŋki an'kwem nsambwaar aŋiyweel bàyàfurà unsà un'sak, waa bàtɛn naa: « Mwol, kà ikɔb angye itàkal insɔŋà bàkyer akà iweemà. » <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yɛsu waa kafuur naa: « Mɛ kàkimanà Satanà kàbwee nde fà du asànaa munyä. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Le, Mɛ akyàlapà ikɔ̈b mundyaar udu a ntäy anà nye, anà udu a imfum a Satanà, wɛɛ akà undiir mwɛy ukwe anki mukyer bɛ ube. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Wɛɛ bɛ twon lan'man un'sak naa insɔŋà myàkyer alàwem, wɛɛ bɛ làmɛn un'sak naa ikɔb abɛ ban'sɔn u du. »<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'man un'sak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Màt 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Taaŋ nsil alan, u mbwo a Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, Yɛsu kàyöl a un'sak, waa kàtɛn naa: « Taa, Mwol a du anà mɛɛn, mɛ amasyäŋà, ntɔn kàyee ngye indiir abi akà aŋayeerà anà akà aŋuyɛnà, wɛɛ ngye bya kàswɛŋ akà baan ambɛy. Ɛɛ, Taa, ngye kàkwen naa ya ikäl abà. »<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>« Taaràmɛ kàkyan'pà indiir byanswà, wɛɛ akà mbuur mwɛy tɛy uyöb Mwan, isàkal naa kà Taa anki, anà mbuur mwɛy tɛy uyöb Taa, isàkal naa kà Mwan anki anà mbuur kan'kwen Mwan mukyään ndaa ayi. » <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Ungö apan, waa kàbulà ntsü bàkäl alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛn a ba mpɛl naa: « Un'sak mbɔɔn akà mii ikamanà ndaa làmanà bɛ yi! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Ntɔn mɛ alàkyään naa aŋangɔɔm anà amfum mbɔɔn bàkwen muman ndaa làmanà bɛ yi, wɛɛ ba ya bàsàman anki, muwem ndaa làweemà bɛ yi, wɛɛ ba ya bàsàwem anki. »<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a un'samàlya aŋàbwaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Un'lɔɔŋ a un'kɔɔn mwɛy kàmbarà ntɔn mulwab Yɛsu ndaa, waa kàtɛn naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, ininà mɛ in'kyer ntɔn muwal möö a mbul a in'tye? » <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Uboo a un'kɔɔn ininà bàsön? Ngye akataŋà aben? » <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Nde kàfuur naa: « Ngye ayàkwen Mwol, Nzam angye, unsà mpem angye yanswà, unsà mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye wanswà, unsà ngwal angye yanswà, unsà an'kyän angye manswà, anà un'tɔŋ angye asànaa ngye ŋakwo. » <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye an'fuur ubwaŋ. Kyer abun, waa ngye ayàkal anà möö. » <verse eid="LUK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Wɛɛ nde kàkwen muwal iböŋ anà mufuul Yɛsu naa: « Un'tɔŋ amɛ nà? » <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yɛsu waa kàfuur naa: « Mbuur mwɛy kàfü Yɛlusàlɛm mutyà Yɛlikɔ. Baar abɛ laa bun'käär ba, bàgyɔɔr ba indiir ande byanswà, bun'düb ba, bàkyen ba anà bàsun'wɛy ba tsütsü a ukwà. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Ngaŋ mwɛy kàkäl mutyà u mbwo ayin. Mpal kàmɛn nde mbuur awun, nde kàlyaaŋ ukɔl. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Un'lɛvi mwɛy sye kàkɔlà kà ikal akin, kun'mɛn nde, waa kàköl. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Wɛɛ un'samàlya mwɛy kàkäl u mbwo ande mulyaaŋ. Mpal kàmɛn nde mbuur awà, ngyɛb laa yun'käär yà. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Nde kàsin tsütsü, kun'bäm ipfɛy kà iwà ande, kun'tyaŋ may anà man, waa kun'si udu a mpoonà ande, kun'syen u ndwà a angyey, waa kun'bay. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Taaŋtyà nde kàwɛl ndiim yweel, laa kàpɛ nde ya akà ŋandwà a angyey, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: "Sun'bay mbuur wà, isàkal naa ngye an'sàtwey ngim mbɔɔn yan'söön yi, mɛ in'yafuur umpal in'yàfurà mɛ."<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>« Uboo a baar abà batär, nà awà un'tɔŋ a mbuur kàbü wà kà an'kɔɔ a baar abe? » <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Un'lɔɔŋ a un'kɔɔn waa kun'fuur naa: « Mbuur akwà kun'wem ngyɛb. » Yɛsu naa: « Kyen, ngye sye kakyer abun. »<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu akà Màtà anà Màlye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Umpal kàkäl Yɛsu u mbwo anà alɔŋki ande, nde kàbilà u bul mwɛy, un'kaar mwɛy ikɔb ande Màtà kawɛl u ndwà ande. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Nde kàkäl anà un'tɔŋ ande wà un'kaar ikɔb ande Màlye. Mwan un'kaar awà kàbwaay kà in'kɔl a Mwol ntɔn muweemà ndaa ande. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>An'kyän a Màtà manswà màkäl mukyer isal a ifà ifà, laa kàyàmɛnà nde kà ikal kàkäl Yɛsu, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, ngye ube akamanà anki naa un'tɔŋ amɛ kàman'sööl isal byanswà aŋayen? Un'swɛŋ nde uyan'bay. » <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Mwol waa kun'fuur naa: « Màtà, Màtà, ngye akamanà mpay anà akayoolàyoolà ntɔn indiir mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Wɛɛ, undiir mwɛy awà ndöŋ. Kyakin Màlye kan'sɔɔl kab aŋàbwaŋ mpa bàsun'lwom. »<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ ntɔn ngyamàkà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Màt 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy Yɛsu kàkäl muyamà kà ikal mwɛy. Umpal kàmay nde, un'lɔŋki ande mwɛy kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, ilɔŋ muyamà asànaa Ywan kàlɔŋ nde alɔŋki ande. » <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mpal làyamà bɛ, làtɛn abà: "Taa! Wɛy ikɔb angye ikäl kyà in'kyɛɛl, wɛy imwol angye iyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Ipɛ ŋàbà isaa abi byà ilä a ilä. <verse eid="LUK 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Idwääl nkul asànaa ifàdwääl bi nkul akà baar bàfikyer ube. Twon an'pà mbwo naa bi ibilà u ndɛb." » <verse eid="LUK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Nde waa kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Isàkal naa umwɛy uboo a bɛ we anà un'sam, waa nde ukyen akà nde uboboo a mpib ntɔn mulɔm akà nde naa. "Un'sam, nsɔɔm nsɔ tär, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>ntɔn un'sam amɛ mwɛy kan'fà kwɛl, kan'yàkɔlà apanà u ndwà amɛ, wɛɛ mɛ undiir un'pà watɛy." <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa uboo a ndwà ande un'sam ande awun kan'fuur naa: "Twon aman'sà lingyoomà, ibeenà kyàŋàbäm, baan amɛ anà mɛ ŋakwo ibaŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n, mɛ in'fàsubà anki ntɔn mupà ngye nsɔ." <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, isàkal naa nde usubà anki mukun'pà ya ntɔn nde wà un'sam ande, nde akyer ayàsubà mukun'pà undiir wanswà awe nde awà mfun ntɔn un'sam ande wàmusà muküünà. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ alàkyään naa: Làlɔ̈m, waa bàlapà. Làleŋ, waa bɛ làyàman. Làbɛɛrà, waa bàyàladuub. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Ntɔn mbuur wanswà afàlɔm akyer afàwal, mbuur afàleŋ akyer afàman, anà bàfàduub akà mbuur afàbɛɛrà. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Isàkal naa umwɛy uboo a bɛ wà taa, nkye nde kan'kwo mupà mwan ande ntäy isàkal naa nde kàmulɔ̈ɔ̈m nsö? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Itàkal naa nde kan'lɔm kyà, waa nde kun'pà lànye? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Isàkal naa bɛ baar abe làkyàyöb mupà baan abɛ indiir aŋàbwaŋ, wɛɛ Taa u du waa mpa upà Dweelà In'kyɛɛl akà baar bàmulɔ̈ɔ̈m? »<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkye Yɛsu wà un'syääl a Bɛlzebul?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Màt 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mlk 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Yàlɔ̈m naa ilä mwɛy Yɛsu kàböŋ unsɔŋà mwɛy kàbuulà mbuur mwɛy nkiin. Ungö a ntoo a unsɔŋà awun, nkiin waa kàsɛmà musà ndaa, baar banswà bàkäl unsà ubem. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Wɛɛ baar bumwɛy uboo a ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde ayisyääl ikɔ̈b a Bɛlzebul, mfum a insɔŋà, ntɔn muböŋ insɔŋà. » <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Baar bumwɛy waa bàlɔ̈m naa nde ukyer impà kyan'fà du ntɔn mukun'si. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Yɛsu abà kàyöb nde an'kyän aba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Imwol kyanswà kye anà nkaabà uboo a kya, kya ikyer afàpää: Ndwà ibwà udu a ndwà yumwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Isàkal naa Satanà wà un'yiiŋ ande ŋakwo, imwol ande iyàtsim aben? Ntɔn bɛ làtɛɛnà naa mɛ in'kaböŋà insɔŋà kà ikɔ̈b a Bɛlzebul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Isàkal naa mɛ insɔŋà in'kaböŋà kikɔ̈b a Bɛlzebul, baan abɛ insɔŋà bàfàböŋ kà ikɔ̈b a nà? Lalan ba ŋakwo bàsàkal atsüül a nsaŋ abɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa mɛ insɔŋà in'yiböŋ a làpin a Nzam, iswaŋà naa imwol a Nzam kyàkyàtol akà bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Uman naa mbuur a ngwal awe anà an'tà màŋàkwo wàmuler ndwà ande, indiir ande mbuur uyàba anki. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa mbuur asin kàmun'söön u ngwal kan'yà, kan'wal iböŋ udu ande, nde kun'gyɔɔr an'tà ande manswà kàsyee nde làkyän, waa ukab indiir byanswà kàmun'gyɔɔr nde.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>« Mbuur mpa awà anà mɛ nde wà un'yiiŋ amɛ, wɛɛ mbuur mpa ayàtüüb anà mɛ ntɔn muböbà, nde wàmupay.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfurà a dweelà a làbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Màt 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>« Isàkal naa dweelà a làbe lan'too uboo a mbuur, la làfàkyà nsye a ipɔl muleŋ ikal akàyöör. La usàkɔɔn aman ikal ayöör laa làtɛn la naa: "Mɛ in'furà ndwà amɛ kàfü mɛ." <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Mpal làyàfurà la, la làsàman ya yàŋàkɔɔm, indiir byanswà byàŋayöŋà ubwaŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>laa ukyà nde, ukàwal nde an'dweelà nsambwaar mà mun'söön u nkyɛl, ma màbilà u ndwà, waa màbwaay. Apan mpay a mbuur awà laa isöönà ya mpay yàtàtwɛb. »<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwaŋ aŋàkwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yàmɛnà naa mpal kàkäl Yɛsu mutɛɛnà abwɛy, un'kaar mwɛy kàmbarà uboo a baar, waa kàtɛn u ndaa a ngwal naa: « Un'sak akà un'kaar kakäär kà an'bäl ande anà kanüü an'bɛɛl ande! » <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Nde waa kàfuur naa: « Aay, un'sak aŋasöönà akà baar bàweemà ndaa a Nzam anà bàsyäälà ya. »<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baar ban'lɔm idiim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Màt 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Umpal ban'yàköŋ baar apà Yɛsu, nde kàsɛmà mutɛn naa: « Baar a mpalàbà bà baar abe: ba bàlɔɔmà idiim, wɛɛ ba idiim asin bàman anki, idiim nsil kyà Yɔnas. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Lalan, asànaa Yɔnas kàkäl nde idiim ntɔn baar a Ninive, abun sye Mwan a mbuur uyàkal nde idiim ntɔn baar a mpalàbà. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Kà ilä a nsaŋ, mfum a ngyɛl wà un'kaar akyer asàmbarà kusà a baar a mpalàbà ntɔn mukapà ikwàndwà, ntɔn nde kàfü ntsü a kwɛl muyàwem an'yeerà a Salɔmun. Wɛɛ apà we anà mbuur kan'söön Salɔmun. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Kà ilä a nsaŋ, baar a Ninive bàkyer asàmbarà kusà a baar a mpalàbà ntɔn mukapà ikwàndwà, ntɔn baar a Ninive bàbuul mpem umpal bàwem ba an'lɔɔŋ a Yɔnas. Wɛɛ apà we anà mbuur kan'söön Yɔnas!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwinà a ndür</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Màt 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>« Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mukyä mwinà waa nde uyee wa, itàkal naa nde usi wa u ngyɛl a kantin. Wɛɛ nde wa asà udu a un'te bàfàsà mwinà ntɔn baar bàbilà u ndwà bàmɛn pɛɛlà. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Mii angye myà mwinà a ndür angye: isàkal naa mii angye myà ubwaŋ, ndür angye yanswà ikal uboo a pɛɛlà, wɛɛ mii angye isàkal anà ukyal, ndür angye yanswà ikal uboo a làpib. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Duub mii angye ubwaŋàbwaŋ, wɛy pɛɛlà a ndür angye làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà làpib. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Abun, isàkal naa ndür angye yanswà yà uboo a pɛɛlà, akà ikal mwɛy kyatɛy uboo a làpib, ya yanswà iyàkal uboo a pɛɛlà, asànaa mwinà ufàpà wa ngye ŋakwo pɛɛlà a in'ŋyäŋ ande. »<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'pà ikwàndwà akà Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Màt 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yàmɛnà naa mpal kàmay Yɛsu mutɛn, umfarisi mwɛy kun'bel ntɔn mukàdyà u ndwà ande. Yɛsu kàbilà nde, waa kàbwaay u mɛsà. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Umfarisi awun kàkyer abem muman naa Yɛsu kàtàywab anki kusà mudyà. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Wɛɛ Mwol waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Le ndaa abɛ Amfarisi: Bɛ làfàsɔŋ nsà a an'kɔɔb anà an'lɔŋà, wɛɛ uboo bɛ làbà aŋàyɔl a làmfɛɛl anà nkyɛl mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Angwöy Mbuur akwà kàkyer nsà, nde boo kàkyer anki? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Làpɛ akà aŋàlàmbwà indiir abyà uboo a an'kɔɔb anà uboo a an'lɔŋà abɛ, waa indiir byanswà byàyàkal byà in'kyɛɛl ntɔn bɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>« Wɛɛ ngyɛb akà bɛ Amfarisi! Bɛ làfàpà mwɛy uboo a kwem wà nkay ifàsà indiir ntsà asànaa un'dül anà köb anà nkay adyà asin yà ifà ifà, wɛɛ bɛ làfàkyer anki ndaa a balàbal anà ukwen a Nzam: undiir làlàkyer bɛ ukɔɔn adiimà indiir byumwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Ngyɛb akà bɛ Amfarisi, ntɔn bɛ làfàkwen an'kir a làkoo u ndwà a nköŋ. Bɛ làfàkwen naa baar bàlapɛ mbɔr kà ikal a nköŋ. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Ngyɛb akà bɛ! Bɛ làbà asànaa an'dii mpa bàfàman baar anà bàfàndyaar ba ukɔɔn ayöb. »<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Umwɛy uboo a alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn, kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, akatɛɛnà ngye abwɛy, ngye bi akatoo sye! » <verse eid="LUK 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yɛsu waa kàfuur naa: « Ngyɛb akà bɛ sye, alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn! Ntɔn bɛ làfàtɔɔl buur a mpay musɛn akà baar, wɛɛ bɛ la làfàba anki akà u làpin làmwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Ngyɛb akà bɛ, ntɔn bɛ làfàtɔŋ an'dii a aŋangɔɔm bàdwä bàtaaràbɛ! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Abun iswaŋà ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa bɛ lan'kyey ndaa bàkyer bàtaaràbɛ: ba bàdwä aŋangɔɔm, wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làtɔŋà an'dii aba! <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Lalan Nzam kàtɛn nde unsà an'yweerà ande naa: "mɛ ba in'satööm aŋangɔɔm anà antööm, ba bàsàdwa bumwɛy anà bàsàmɛɛy bumwɛy nkwaaŋ." <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Lalan an'kil a aŋangɔɔm màpää fà nsɛmà a mɛɛn bàsàtälà udu a un'tswe a baar a mpalàyi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>sɛmà an'kil a Abɛl tii an'kil a Zakàlye awà bàdwä uboboo a mɛsà a ibɔɔn anà idwà. Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, buur a an'kil a baar abà banswà bàsàtälà udu a un'tswe a baar a mpalàyi!<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>« Ngyɛb akà bɛ alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn, bɛ làkyàduum nsab ufàduub ndaa a un'yɛnà. Bɛ ŋakwo làfàbilà anki, bɛ sye làfàtsuŋ baar bumwɛy bàfàkwen mubilà kwo. »<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yàmɛnà naa umpal kàtoo Yɛsu u ndwà, alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà Amfarisi bàkun'nüün ntɔn mukun'fuul ndaa yà ifà ifà: <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>ba bàkäl mukun'lwab ndaa, ntɔn ba bàwɛl ndaa ayifà u mun ande ntɔn ba bun'füün.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Igyɛɛŋ ntɔn ukwen a loor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Màt 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa utaaŋ nsil alan, baar nsaab bàkyer ayàköŋ, ba bàndyàndyaar ba a ba kà in'kɔl. Yɛsu kàtàsɛmà mutɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Làduub mii abɛ ntɔn ful a Amfarisi, iswaŋà naa ukwen a loor. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Ndaa yanswà yàŋàyee ikyer asàmɛnà u mii, ndaa a unku ikyer asàtoo. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Lalan ndaa yanswà làsàtɛn bɛ u làpib, bàkyer asàwem u mwäänà answà, wɛɛ ndaa yanswà làsàŋüŋün bɛ u mun a tsü uboo a suk aŋàdübà, isàbulà ndaa a kuub in'kwɛŋ udu a nsyä a ndwà.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur ban'kwo muman bɔɔmà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Màt 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>« Asam amɛ, mɛ alàkyään naa: twon lan'man bɔɔmà a baar bàfàlɔ ndür mpɛl, wɛɛ mpa bàkwe mufàkyer undiir asin. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Mɛ in'kyer alàswaŋ nà bɛ lan'kwo mutiin bɔɔmà: làtiin mbuur awe anà ikɔ̈b mukàlàtɔɔm u yaaŋ a mbaa ungö a nkweel. Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, bɛ bɔɔmà làtiin nde! »<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>« nkye Insɔɔr ityeen bàfàyälà anki ndiim yweel? Wɛɛ Nzam ufàdiimà anki akà umwɛy uboo a bya. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Yumwɛy ayi: Itàkal ntswee abɛ yanswà yàŋàtaŋ. Twon lan'man bɔɔmà, ntɔn bɛ lan'söön insɔɔr mbɔɔn u ntal.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Màt 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>« Wɛɛ mɛ alàkyään naa mbuur wanswà asàtà imbäl amɛ u mii a baar, Mwan a mbuur sye asun'tɛɛl imbäl u mii a akyeey a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Wɛɛ mbuur wanswà asàswaŋ ngaal u mii a baar naa nde mɛ kan'yöb anki, nde sye bàsun'yöb anki u mii a akyeey a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kan'twe Mwan a mbuur, nde bàsun'dwääl nkul, wɛ mbuur asàto Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, usàwal anki ndwääl a nkul.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>« Mpal bàsàlasyen ba u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà ntɔn mukàlatsüül nsaŋ, itàkal kusà a amfum, itàkal kusà a an'yɔl, twon lan'man mpay naa bɛ un'lɔn làkàsà aben, bɛ ndaa nà làkàtɛn. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ntɔn Dweelà In'kyɛɛl akyer asàlalɔŋ taaŋ nsil alan ndaa lan'kwo bɛ mutɛn. »<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a ŋun'naaŋ insil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Yàmɛnà naa uboo a un'sɛŋ a baar mbuur mwɛy kàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, un'swɛŋ un'tɔŋ amɛ mukab anà m un'naaŋ abi. » <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Un'sam amɛ, nà kan'si ntɛɛn abɛ, itàkal nkalsà mukab un'naaŋ abɛ? » <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làwem ubwaŋàbwaŋ: twon lan'kal anà ngyal mukal anà indiir mbɔɔn, ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbuur kà wà uboo a indiir ande anki, itàkal naa nde wà ŋun'naaŋ. »<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Apan nde katɛɛl nsim yi: « An'ywaŋ a ŋun'naaŋ mwɛy màtwey isaa mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Nde kàsɛmà muyweer: "Mɛ in'kyer aben? Ntɔn mɛ ikal musà isaa amɛ abi byanswà kyatɛy." <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Apan nde kàtɛn naa: "Mɛ in'yàkyer abà: Mɛ in'kyer ayàpay ikɔr amɛ byanswà ntɔn mutɔŋ byàkölàköl, waa in'yàsà mbɛŋ amɛ yanswà anà isaa amɛ byumwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Ungö apan mɛ in'yàtɛn a mɛ ŋakwo naa: Mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ, ngye awe anà isaa mbɔɔn ntɔn mbul mbɔɔn. Yweer, dyà, nwà, man un'sak." <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Wɛɛ Nzam waa kàtɛn a nde naa: "Insil! U mpib a ŋàbà nsil awà ngye akyer akwà. Ayi yanswà an'lɔn ngye ntɔn ngye, nà asàman ubwaŋ a ya?" » <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Yɛsu kàkwɛy naa: « Abun, ya yabwɛy sye ntɔn mbuur afàköŋà un'naaŋ mbɔɔn ntɔn nde ŋakwo, wɛɛ nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akal ŋun'naaŋ ntɔn Nzam. »<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwal a Nzam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Màt 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Apan Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Lalan m alàkyään naa: Twon lan'man mpay ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ abɛ anà mutɛɛn naa bɛ ininà làyàdyà, itàkal naa ntɔn ndür abɛ naa bɛ ininà làyàbwaar. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ kan'söön isaa anà ndür yan'söön ipfɛy. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Làler inkaak, bya ifàkɔn anki, ifàbwo anki, bya ikɔr byatɛy, wɛɛ Nzam akyer afadii. Bɛ lan'söön nɛn! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nà uboo a bɛ, ntɔn ngyɛb ande, kan'kwo mukwɛy akà ilä mwɛy u mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Isàkal naa bɛ làkwe anki mukyer undiir ikikye, ntɔn nkye làmanà bɛ mpay ntɔn indiir byumwɛy? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Làler iful a an'ywaŋ ifàyɛl bya: bya byàfàsal anki, byàfàtɔŋ anki, wɛɛ mɛ alàkyään naa itàkal Salɔmun unsà un'naaŋ ande wanswà kàsàbwaar anki asànaa bya. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Isàkal naa Nzam afàbwää iteerà abyà u ywaŋ ŋàbà wɛɛ nkàswo bya bàyàtɔɔm u mbaa, waa Nzam mpa uyàlabwää, bɛ aŋàlàkwikilà ikikye. <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, twon lan'man mpay ntɔn udyà anà unwà abɛ, twon lan'kal u ngyɛb. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Ntɔn indiir abi byanswà baar mpa bàyöb Nzam u mɛɛn mà bàfàleŋ bya taaŋ lanswà. Wɛɛ bɛ, Taaràbɛ akyàyöb naa bɛ làbye anà mfun a bya. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, tàlaleŋà imwol a Nzam, waa bàsàlakwɛy indiir abi byanswà. »<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'naaŋ a du</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Màt 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>« Twon an'man bɔɔmà, ngye làböl ikikye! Ntɔn Taaràbɛ kàkwen mukàlapà imwol. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Làyälà indiir abɛ, làpɛ ngim akà aŋàlàmbwà. Làkyer in'di a ngim mpa ifàbwà an'tär. Làyee in'naaŋ abɛ u du, waa mya mpa myàtäy. Mbüüb bàyàkwo anki muwal mya, anà nsɛɛl sye idyà anki mya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Ntɔn ikal awà in'naaŋ abɛ, ikal sye iwà mpem abɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ musal anà indiir a isal abɛ u kɔɔ. Làwɛy minà abɛ myàkäl myàŋàlɛɛmà. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Làkäl asànaa asyääl bàkadilà nkum aba kàkyen mukàbäl un'kyay, ntɔn ba bun'duub ndwà isàkal naa nde kan'yàfura anà kan'bɛɛrà. Mpal uyàfurà nde, ubɛɛrà nde, waa ba bun'duub ndwà. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Un'sak akà asyääl usyetaan nde bàmuleerà mpal uyàfurà nde! Mɛ ndandaa alàkyään, nde ŋakwo asàbwaar ipfɛy a isal, asàpà ba ikal abwaay anà isaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Isàkal naa nde kan'yà uboboo a mpib, itàkal naa u nkɔɔ atàtwɛb, un'sak akà asyääl akwà usàtaan nde bàŋàleer! »<verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>« Làyöb ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa isàkal naa ŋandwà akyàyöb taaŋ uyà mbüüb, nde uyun'wɛy anki mubilà u ndwà ande. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Bɛ sye, làduub mii abɛ, ntɔn bɛ làyöb anki taaŋ usàyà Mwan a mbuur. »<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'syääl aŋàbwaŋ anà un'syääl un'be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Màt 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Apan Petɔlà waa kun'fuul naa: « Mwol, nsim ayi yà ntɔn bi mpɛl lɛɛ ntɔn baar banswà? »<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Mwol waa ufuur naa: « Nà un'syääl a balàbal anà ŋun'yɛnà awà kan'kwo nkum ande mupà buur muler asyääl anà mupà umwɛy umwɛy isaa ande u taaŋ a taaŋ? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Un'sak akà un'syääl awà, isàkal naa nkum ande amàyun'taan mukyer isal akin! <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Mɛ alàkyään ndandaa, nde asun'sà mfum udu a un'naaŋ ande wanswà. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa un'syääl kan'yweer u mpem ande naa: "Nkum amɛ kan'kyer itaan muyàfurà." Nde usɛmà mudüb baar a isal abaal anà bakaar, isal ande udyà, unwà anà uyɔr man, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>apan nkum ande asyefurà ilä mpa kun'dilà nde anà u taaŋ mpa uyöb nde. Apan nkum ande asun'pà ntaaŋàmbar aŋàsöönà, nde asun'sà uboo a un'lwaaŋ a atsüüŋ mpa bàfàlab nswɛɛŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Un'syääl akwà awà ayöb naa nkum ande ininà ufàkwen, wɛɛ nde ufàkwen anki mukyer ya anà mulɔ̈ɔ̈n ya kusà, nde asàwal an'füm mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Wɛɛ un'syääl akwà mpa uyöb naa nkum ande inina ukwen ntɔn nde, isàkal naa nde an'kyer ube, ntaaŋàmbar ande isàkal ikikye. Isàkal naa mbuur kàwɛl mbɔɔn, bàsun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m sye mbɔɔn. Isàkal naa bàmapà mbɔɔn, bàsalɔ̈ɔ̈m sye mbɔɔn. »<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkaabà ntɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Màt 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>« Mɛ kàyi muyàtɔɔm mbaa u mɛɛn. Wɛɛ mɛ in'kwen naa ya ikäl yàŋàlɛɛmà. <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Ye anà ndüümà mwɛy mɛ in'wal, mɛ waa in'wà u ngyɛb mbɔɔn tii umpal isàkwo ya! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Nkye bɛ làsii naa mɛ kàyi ntɔn mutwaal duu u mɛɛn? Ŋaa, mɛ alàkyään naa nkaabà. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Yan'mɛnà naa sɛmà ŋàbawà, u ywar a baar atyeen nkaabà yan'bilà, atär bàkwen anki abɔ̈ɔ̈l, aböɔ̈l bàkwen anki atär, <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>taa ukwen anki mwan ande wà baal, mwan baal ukwen anki taarànde, maa ukwen anki mwan ande wà un'kaar, mwan un'kaar ukwen anki ngwän, maa ukwen anki un'kyay a mwan ande, un'kyay a mwan ukwen anki ukwà ande wà un'kaar. »<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyööb a mbuul a an'taaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Màt 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu waa kàtɛn sye a baar banswà naa: « Umpal làfàman bɛ itööm ntsü làfàmina taaŋ, bɛ làfàtɛn naa: "Mbul akyer anɔ", wa sye afàkyer anɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Isàkal naa un'pöb an'fà ngyɛl, bɛ làfàtɛn naa: "Ŋàbà mwäänà akal mbɔɔn", wa sye afàkal mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Baar a mpem yweel! Bɛ làkyàyöb ndaa yan'kwo mulyaaŋ u mɛɛn anà u du, wɛɛ ntɔn nkye mpa làyöb bɛ ndaa a mpalàyi? »<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyöŋà anà ibör ande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Màt 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>« Ntɔn nkye bɛ ŋakwo mpa làyöb bɛ musɔɔl ndaa a ndandaa? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Isàkal naa we anà mbur kàmafüün, wɛɛ bɛ làwàmukyà làbay a nsaŋ, leŋ ipöl muyöŋà anà nde mpal làbà bɛ u mbwo. Abun nde ngye uyàfasyen anki akà ntɛɛn, ntɛɛn ayàfapà anki akà un'kyɛɛŋ, un'kyɛɛŋ uyàfabiil anki u bɔlokà. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Kya naa tɛy, mɛ akyään ndandaa, ngye kwo asàtoo anki isàkal naa ngye ngim ande yanswà ŋàtàfur anki. »<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuul a mpem lɛɛ ukwà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Umpal ayin, baar amwɛy bàyi mukyään Yɛsu naa Pilatu kàdwä aben Angalilɛ taaŋ bàkäl ba mupà ibɔɔn akà Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Bɛ làsii naa Angalilɛ abà bàsöön Angalilɛ bumwɛy unsà man'be, lalan bàmɛn ba mpay a tub ayi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Mɛ in'tɛn a bɛ naa ŋaa. Wɛɛ bɛ làsàkɔɔn asɔɔmà, bɛ banswà sye làsàkwà asànaa ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Itàkal baar kwem aŋinaan bàkü mpal yabweel ndwà a bwɛlàbwɛl a Silɔwɛ, bɛ làsii naa ba bàkäl anà man'be màŋasöönà baar a Yɛlusàlɛm banswà? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Mɛ in'tɛn a bɛ naa ŋaa. Isàkal naa bɛ mpem làbuul anki, bɛ banswà làkyer asàkwà. » <verse eid="LUK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Apan nde katɛɛl nsim yi: « Mbuur mwɛy kàkäl anà un'te adyà wàŋàkɔn uboo a làpaŋ ande. Ilä mwɛy nde kàkwen mubwo mbɛŋ, wɛɛ nde kàmɛn anki akà mwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Abun nde kàtɛn a mbuur kàfalerà làpaŋ a in'te adyà ande naa: "Le, abà mbul tär in'yaa mɛ muyàbwo mbɛŋ kà un'te awà, wɛɛ mɛ akà imwɛy in'manà anki. Tsul wa: mɛ in'manà anki isin usaa nde làpib a bunàbun uboo a làpaŋ amɛ." <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Mbuur awun naa: "Un'lɔɔŋ, tàfun'wɛy mbul awà! Mɛ in'yàbuun mɛɛn u mbil a wa, mɛ in'yàsà nkay: <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>taaŋ lumwɛy ilä iyà ungö wa akyer ayàbɔr. Kya naa tɛy, ngye waa asun'tsul." »<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr un'kaar aŋatoo ilä a saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Yàmenà naa ilä a saba mwɛy Yɛsu kàkäl mulɔŋ u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Wɛɛ le, uboo kwo kàkäl anà un'kaar mwɛy dweelà a làbe lun'buulà aŋàkwɛkà abà mbul kwem aŋinaan: nde kàkäl aŋàtöör, kàkwee anki mumbar aŋàsubà alää. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Mpal kun'mɛn Yɛsu, nde waa kun'bel, kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'kaar, ngye an'kɔɔrà unsà nkwɛkà angye! » <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Nde kàsi an'kɔɔ ande udu a un'kaar awà, taaŋ nsil alan un'kaar waa kàsubà, laa kàsɛmà nde musyäŋà Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Wɛɛ mfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà kàwem nkyɛl ntɔn Yɛsu kàkɔɔr nde mbuur ilä a saba. Apan nde kàtɛn a baar banswà naa: « Ilä mukyer isal byà isyaam, làyi kà ilä abin ntɔn bàlakɔɔr, wɛɛ kà ilä a saba anki! » <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Mwol waa kun'fuur naa: « Bɛ làbà baar a loor! Mbuur wanswà uboo abɛ afàbäm ngɔɔmà ande itàkal ntab ande kà ikal ufàdyà wa anà mukun'nüü ilä a saba. Kabwɛy anki? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Wɛɛ un'kaar wà, mwan a Abàlam kàkör Satanà wà mbul kwem aŋinaan, bàlun'kɔɔr anki in'siŋ ande ntɔn ŋàbà ilä a saba? » <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Mfuur a Yɛsu ayi yàpɛ nswɛn akà ayiiŋ ande, wɛɛ baar banswà bàmɛn un'sak ntɔn ndaa aŋàbwaŋ kàkyerà nde.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a imbɛŋ ikikye bàkön</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Màt 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn naa: « Imwol a Nzam kyà asànaa ininà? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Kya kyà asànaa imbɛŋ ikikye kan'wal mbuur mwɛy anà kan'tɔɔm nde uboo a làpaŋ ande: kya waa imɛn, iyɛl, ibulà un'te, nɛn a du waa itöŋ an'yaab kà an'kɔkà a wa. »<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a ful</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Màt 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Nde kàkwɛy naa: « Mɛ imwol a Nzam in'sii anà ininà? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kya kyà asànaa ful kàwɛl un'kaar mwɛy waa kàtüüb la anà an'kɔɔb an'tär mà mfufu a mampà. Ungö apan mfar yanswà laa yàfül ya. »<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mun a mbwo a ikikye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Màt 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yɛsu kàyilyaaŋà uboo a an'bul a kölàköl anà mà ikikye muyilɔŋ anà muyisin tsütsü a Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Mbuur mwɛy kun'fuul naa: « Mwol, nkye baar ikikye mpɛl bàsàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈? » Nde waa kàfuur naa: <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>« Làkyer ngwal mubilà u kimunàmbwo, ntɔn mɛ alàkyään naa baar mbɔɔn bàsàleŋ mubilà wɛɛ ba bàsàkwo anki. »<verse eid="LUK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>« Mpal usàsubà ŋandwà anà usàbäm nde ndwà, isàkal naa bɛ lan'sàsal u nsà, bɛ làtàbɛɛrà ibeenà unsà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n lanswà: "Mwol, iduub!" Nde bɛ asàlafuur naa: "Bɛ làbà baar a ken?" <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Apan, bɛ làsàtɛn a nde naa: "Wɛɛ bi laa kàdi anà kànü u mii angye, ngye kàlɔɔŋà kà an'balàbal anà bi." <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Nde afàsàlafuur naa: "Bɛ làbà baar a ken. Làlwomà apà mɛ, bɛ baar làfàkyer man'be." <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Akun isàkal ilel anà nkwoor a an'din mpal làsàman bɛ Abàlam, Isak anà Yakɔb anà aŋangɔɔm banswà uboo a Imwol a Nzam, wɛɛ bɛ ŋakwo bàkyàlapiy unsà. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Apan, baar bàsàfà ntsü làfàsɛnà taaŋ, ntsü làfàminà la, ntaal anà ngyɛl, ba bàsàwal ikal u mɛsà kà Imwol a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Lalan baar a ngöngö bàsàbulà baar atàtwɛb, wɛɛ baar atàtwɛb bàsàbulà baar a ngöngö. »<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Màt 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Umpal ayin, Amfarisi amwɛy bàyi ba, ba bàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Lwomà pabà, kyen ntsü asin, ntɔn Ɛlɔdi akwen mukadwa. » <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yɛsu waa kafuur naa: « Làkyen kàlun'kyään un'kyɛŋ awun: ŋàbà anà nkàswo mɛ in'wà muböŋ insɔŋà anà mukɔɔr aŋakyal, nkàswo wunà isal amɛ iyàkal aŋàwà. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Wɛɛ mɛ in'kyer alab mbwo amɛ ŋàbà, nkàswo anà nkàswo wunà, ntɔn ŋangɔɔm ukwe anki mukwà kà ikal asin mpa akyà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Aa, Yɛlusàlɛm! Yɛlusàlɛm! Ngye an'may aŋangɔɔm, ngye an'dwa baar ufàtɔm Nzam a in'kul. Mbalà kwe mɛ kàkwen muböbà baan angye tsütsü apà mɛ asànaa nkɔɔ ufàfwee wa an'tsül u ngyɛl a an'paab ande. Wɛɛ bɛ ya làsàkwen anki! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Isàkal abun ndwà abɛ bàkyer apiy bwà. Ɛɛ, sɛmà ŋàbawà bɛ mɛ làfàsan'man anki tii mpal làsàtɛn bɛ naa: "Wɛy un'sak ukäl akà mbuur kan'yà kà ikɔb a Mwol." »<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr ŋun'kyal mwɛy ilä a saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä a saba mwɛy mfum a Amfarisi mwɛy kàbel Yɛsu mukàdyà u ndwà ande. Baar bàkäl paa bàkäl musey nde ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Wɛɛ le, mbuur aŋàyàyam u ndür kàkäl aŋàmbar kusà a nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yɛsu kàsi ndaa, waa kàtɛn a alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà Amfarisi naa: « Nkye bàkyàpà mbwo lɛɛ tɛy mukɔɔr mbuur ilä a saba? » <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Wɛɛ ba ndaa bàsi anki. Apan Yɛsu laa kàbä nde mbuur awun, waa kun'kɔɔr, kun'sweŋ mufurà ndwà ande. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Ungö apan, nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nà uboo abɛ, isàkal naa mwan ande itàkal ngɔɔmà ande kan'bwà uboo a fu, mpa kun'twey nde a agyägyä, ilä a saba? » <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Wɛɛ ba sye bàsàkwo anki mufuur.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'lwɛŋ ntɔn làbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà nkyeer a ndaa aŋàbwaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Mpal kàmɛn nde naa baar bàbel bàkäl musɔɔl ikal atàtwɛb, nde kàtɛ nsim yi: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>« Isàkal naa mbuur kàmabel mukàdyà ilä atà bör ande, twon an'kàbwaay kà ikal a imfum. Taaŋ lumwɛy uboo abɛ we anà mbuur kan'söön ngye unsà imfum <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>anà mbuur kàlabel, ngye anà nde, uyàtɛn a ngye naa: "Sun'wɛy ikal ki." Uboo a nswɛn, ngye akàbwaay kà ikal a ngöngö. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Wɛɛ, manà bàmabel, kyen kabwaay kà ikal a ngöngö. Abun, mpal uyàbilà mbuur kabel, nde waa kakyään naa: "Un'sam amɛ, kye anà ikal aŋasöön ubwaŋ ntɔn ngye, yabwaay udu kà". Abun ngye ayàkal aŋasyäŋà u mii a baar bàkäl anà ngye u mɛsà. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Lalan, mbuur afàsɛɛn an'pɛy bàkyer afun'tyeey, mbuur afàtyà bàkyer afun'sɛn. » <verse eid="LUK 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Ungö Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a mbuur kun'bel naa: « Isàkal naa ngye apà baar udyà, twon an'bel asam angye, atɔŋ angye, baar a mbil angye, itàkal aŋun'naaŋ bàfàkal tsütsü apà ngye, ntɔn ba sye bàfàsabel mufuur ayi yanswà an'kyer ngye. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa ngye apà isaa akà baar, bel aŋàlàmbwà, baar aŋàyɔm in'kɔl, ikar, ikwàmii. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Waa ngye ayàkal kà un'sak ntɔn baar aban ndöŋ yatɛy musafuur asànaa an'kyer ngye. Waa Nzam usakwɛy mpal bàsàwiyà baar a balàbal kà ukwà. »<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a udyà a kölàköl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Màt 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Yàmɛnà naa ungö apan, umwɛy uboo a baar bàbel waa kàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Un'sak akà mbuur asàwal ikal mpal bàsàdii baar uboo a Imwol a Nzam! » <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Waa Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Ilä mwɛy, mbuur mwɛy kàwɛl baar u ndwà ande ntɔn udyà a kölàköl. Waa nde kàbel baar mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Taaŋ a udyà làkwe la, nde kàtöm un'syääl ande mukàswaŋ baar kàbel nde naa: "Làyi apanà, ntɔn ndaa yanswà yan'kwo." <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Wɛ ba banswà bàkal mun umwɛy wa, waa bàlɔ̈m ndwääl a nkul. Wàtàtwɛb kun'kyään naa: "Mɛ an'som ywanŋ làmwɛy, mɛ in'kyer akyà mukàler la. Mɛ amabɔɔn, ndwääl nkul." <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Wumwɛy naa: "Mɛ an'som adim atyeen anà akyay atyeen bà ngɔɔmà. Mɛ in'kyer akàsi ya. Mɛ amabɔɔn, ndwääl nkul." <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Wumwɛy sye naa: "Mɛ an'bääl làbenàben alà, mɛ in'kwe anki muyà." <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Taaŋ kàyàfurà un'syääl awun, nde kàkyään nkum ande ndaa ayi yanswà bàtɛn ba. Lalan ŋandwà kàwem nde nkyɛl, kàswɛŋ nde un'syääl ande naa: "Kyen agyägyä! Kyen u mbay anà kan'balàbal a bul, twaal pabà aŋàlàmbwà, baar aŋàkwɛkà, ikwàmii, ikar." <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Ungö a taaŋ, un'syääl waa kàyàkyään nkum ande naa: "Mwol, mɛ an'kyer asànaa an'swɛŋ ngye, wɛɛ ikal a ipɔl byà paa." <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Nkum ande naa: "Kyen u mbwo yanswà, u mbil a mpaŋ, siinà baar bàbilà, ntɔn ndwà amɛ iyöl abar. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ alàkyään ndandaa naa akà mbuur mwɛy uboo a baar kàbel mɛ ulɛr anki isaa amɛ!" »<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa a mfun mukal un'lɔŋki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Màt 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Yàmɛnà naa mbul a baar kàyikyeenà a Yɛsu, nde waa kàbulà, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>« Isàkal naa mbuur an'yà akà mɛ, wɛɛ nde udiimà anki taarànde, ngwän, un'kyay ande, baan ande, atɔŋ ande babaal anà bakaar, itàkal ndür ande ŋakwo, nde ukwe anki mukal un'lɔŋki amɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Mbuur mpa usɛn buur ande anà mpa ulab mɛ, nde ukwe anki mukal un'lɔŋki amɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Abà, nà uboo abɛ akwen mutɔŋ ndwà a bwɛlàbwɛl, nde uwal anki taaŋ muyweer ntɔn muyöb naa nde kwe uyàtwey, nkye nde ayàkwo mumay ndwà ande? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Naa tɛy, nde uyàmay anki mutɔŋ ungö musà un'bään, baar banswà bàsamanà ya bàkyer asun'sɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Ba bàsàtɛn naa: "Làler mbuur kàsɛmà mutɔŋ, wɛ nde kàkwe anki mumay." <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Itàkal naa mfum mwɛy wà tsütsü muleŋ ngwiy a mfum asin. Nde uwal anki taaŋ mubwaay anà muyweer naa nkye nde akyàkwo muwal iböŋ kusà a mbuur awe abà baar nsaab an'kwem mööl isàkal naa nde ŋakwo we abà baar nsaab kwem? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Nde usàman naa nde ukwo anki, nde atɔm in'kyeey mpal awà un'yiiŋ ande u kwɛlàkwɛl ntɔn muyöŋà duu. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Ya ye abun sye ntɔn bɛ: uboo abɛ, mbuur mpa ukwen mukɔɔb ubwaŋ ande banswà ukwe anki mukal un'lɔŋki amɛ. »<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muŋ akɔ̈ɔ̈n ntsà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Màt 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>« Muŋ wà undiir aŋàbwaŋ, wɛɛ ntsà awa isàwà, ya bàyun'fuur a nkye? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Wa bàfàsàsyääl anki itàkal ntɔn mɛɛn, itàkal ntɔn mudii ndon. Undiir kan'saal: upiy wa bwà u nsà. Wɛy mbuur awe anà an'tsü awem uwem. »<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a un'kɔk kàdiimà anà kàfàmɛnà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Màt 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa afüür a itɛr anà baar asin babe, ba banswà bàsin tsütsü apà Yɛsu ntɔn mukun'wem. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàŋüŋün anà bàtɛn naa: « Mbuur wà ayiwal baar abɛ anà ayidyà ikal imwɛy anà ba. » <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu katɛɛl nsim yi: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>« Nà uboo abɛ we amyà in'kɔk nkam, wɛ umwɛy udiimà, nkye nde usàwɛy anki in'kɔk an'kwem wà aŋiwà u nsye ntɔn mukàleŋ umwɛy kan'diimà wà tii mpal usàman nde wa? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Mpal usàman nde wa, unsà un'sak nde, nde wa asàsà kà an'pɛy. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Mpal uyàfurà nde ndwà ande, nde abel asam ande anà baar a tsütsü, waa utɛn naa: "Làsäŋ anà mɛ, ntɔn un'kɔk amɛ kàdiimà kan'mɛnà." <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Abun sye, mɛ ndandaa alàkyään, un'sak mbɔɔn asàkal u du isàkal naa mbuur un'be mwɛy kan'buul mpem, wɛɛ kà ntɔn an'kwen wà aŋiwà mpa bàwe anà mfun a mbuul a mpem. »<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɛr a ngim kyàdiimà anà kyàfàmɛnà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>« Itàkal naa, nà un'kaar mwɛy we abyà itɛr a ngim kwem, wɛɛ imwɛy kyan'diimà. Nkye nde ukyää anki mwinà, ukɔ̈ɔ̈m ndwà anà uyaal ntsü yanswà tii mpal uyàfàman nde kya? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Wɛɛ umpal uman nde kya, nde abel asam ande anà baar a tsütsü anà mutɛn naa: "Làsäŋ anà mɛ, ntɔn itɛr a ngim amɛ kyàdiimà kyan'mɛnà." <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Abun sye, mɛ alàkyään naa un'sak mbɔɔn afàkal akà akyeey a Nzam isàkal naa mbuur un'be mwɛy kan'buul mpem. »<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwan kàdiimà anà kàfàmɛnà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yɛsu waa kàfàtɛn naa: « Mbuur mwɛy kàkäl abà baan abaal bɔ̈ɔ̈l. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Mwan wà umbɛy kàtɛn a taarànde naa: "Taa, mpɛ kab a indiir làmɛ." Taaràba kakääb indiir ande. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Ungö a ilä, mwan umbɛy awun kàwɛl indiir ande byanswà, laa kàyälà nde bya, waa kàkyen nsi a kwɛl. Wɛɛ akun nde kàtay un'naaŋ ande uboo a lingyoomà. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Mpal kàmay nde indiir ande byanswà, ngyal a ngwal yàbilà u nsi ayin, laa kàsɛmà nde muleŋ udyà. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Apan, nde kàkàleŋ isal akà mbuur mwɛy wà nsi ayin. Mbuur awà kun'töm u nsye mukàdii ngul ande. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Wɛɛ an'kyän ande màkäl naa nde udi itàkal isaa a ngul, wɛɛ mbuur un'pà bya kàkäl anki. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Apan, nde kàfuur an'kyän, waa kàtɛn naa: "Asyääl a taa akwe bàfàdyà asànaa bàkwen ba, wɛɛ mɛ kà in'wà mukwà a ngyal. <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Mɛ in'kyer ambarà, in'kyer akyà akà taa, waa in'kàtɛn a nde naa: Taa, mɛ an'kyer man'be akà Nzam anà akà ngye. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Mɛ in'kwe anki mufàkal mwan angye. Ngwɛl asànaa umwɛy uboo a asyääl angye." <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Apan laa kambarà nde, kàfurà nde akà taarànde. Nde kàkäl anki ŋàtàtol, mpal kun'mɛn taarànde ukwɛl, laa kun'wem nde ngyɛb mbɔɔn, kàkyen nde ntiin, kun'bwirà nde, waa kundüür. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwan laa kàtɛn nde a taarànde naa: "Taa, mɛ kàkyer man'be akà Nzam anà akà ngye, mɛ in'kwe anki mufàkal mwan angye …" <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Wɛɛ taarànde kàswɛŋ asyääl ande: "Làkyen agyägyä, kàlaleŋ ipfɛy kyan'söön ntwɛn, lun'bwää, lun'si làpɛr u làpin, lun'bwää an'sàbar aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Wɛɛ làtwääl un'tö a ngɔɔmà a may, làdwä wa. Bi ikyer adyà, bi ikyer ataam <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>ntɔn mwan amɛ kàkäl awàŋàkwà, nde kan'wiyà, nde kàkyer adiimà, wɛɛ mɛ amun'man." Laa bàsɛmà ba mutaam. <verse eid="LUK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Taaŋ nsil alan, mwan wà nswɛm kàkäl kà an'ywaŋ. Mpal kàkäl nde u mbwo muyàfurà, kàkɔlà nde tsütsü a ndwà, laa kàwem nde an'diim anà an'kyen. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Nde kàbel umwɛy uboo a asyääl, waa kun'fuul naa ndaa nà ikalyaaŋà. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Un'syääl kun'fuur abà: "Un'kɔm angye an'yàfurà. Taaràŋà kan'dwa un'tö a ngɔɔmà a may ntɔn nde an'yàfurà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈." <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Lalan, mwan wà nswɛm kàwen nde nkyɛl, waa kàtön mubilà u ndwà. Taarànde laa kàyàtoo nde, waa kun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m mubilà. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a taarànde naa: "Le, mɛ an'kyer mbul anà mbul musyääl ngye: mɛ ndaa angye mwɛy akà ikikye in'fàbɛy anki. Wɛɛ, akà mbalà mwɛy ngye un'tö a ntab kan'pɛ anki ntɔn mutaam anà asam amɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Wɛɛ mwan angye, mbuur kan'kàtay indiir angye byanswà anà akaar a pasàsɛ kan'yàfurà, ntɔn nde, ngye an'dwa un'tö a ngɔɔmà a may!" <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Taarànde naa: "Mwan amɛ, ngye awà anà mɛ taaŋ lanswà, indiir amɛ byanswà byà byàngye. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Wɛɛ, yubwaŋ naa bi ikäl kà un'sak, ntɔn un'tɔŋ angye wà asànaa mbuur kàkü waa kan'wiyà, ntɔn nde kàkyer adiimà, waa kan'mɛnà." »<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Mfum a isal a mankay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa Yɛsu kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Ŋun'naaŋ mwɛy kàkäl anà mfum a isal ande. Baar laa bàyun'füün ba naa nde afàtaam anà indiir ande. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Ŋun'naaŋ waa kun'bel, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: "Ndaa nà mɛ in'weemà ntɔn ngye? Nswɛŋ nsyääl angye, ntɔn ngye ayàfàlab anki musyääl indiir amɛ." <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Mfum a isal kàsɛmà muyweer: "Mɛ in'kyer aben, ntɔn nkum amɛ kàman'lwom muler isal ande? In'bulà mulem an'ywaŋ? Mɛ ngwal yatɛy. In'sɛmà muyilɔm akà baar? Yà ndaa a nswɛn. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Aa, mɛ an'man naa mɛ ininà in'kyer ntɔn baar ban'wɛl u ndwà aba mpal bàyan'lwom kà isal amɛ." <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Ungö apan, nde kàbeelà umwɛy umwɛy aŋankul a nkum ande. Nde kàtɛn a mbuur wàtàtwɛb naa: "Ngye kwɛ apà akà nkum amɛ?" <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Nde kun'fuur naa: "Ngungulà nkam yà may." Nde waa kàtɛn naa: "Le un'kaan a nkul angye, bwaay pabà, kyer agyägyä, sɔn an'kwem an'tyeen." <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Ungö nde waa kàtɛn a wumwɛy naa: "Atöl ngye kwe?" Nde naa: "Ngɔɔr nkam mwɛy yà mbɛŋ a imbab." Mfum a isal naa: "Mà un'kaan a nkul angye, sɔn an'kwem naan." <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Abun, nkum kàkyer un'syäŋà un'be un'syääl awà ntɔn mankay ande. Iswaŋà naa baan a nsi yi ban'söön mankay kusà a atɔŋ aba akwà abà baan a pɛɛlà. <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Wɛɛ mɛ alàkyään naa: Làtɛ isaam a in'naaŋ a loor myà mɛɛn mà. Abun, umpal myàsàkɔɔn mya, waa mya isàlawal kà ikal a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Isàkal naa mbuur wà balàbal unsà indiir ikikye, nde asàkal sye wàbalàbal unsà indiir mbɔɔn. Wɛɛ isàkal naa mbuur wà ŋaloor unsà indiir ikikye, nde asàkal sye ŋaloor unsà indiir mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Lalan, isàkal naa bɛ balàbal batɛy musyääl un'naaŋ a loor a mɛɛn mà, nà kan'kwo mukàlapà un'naaŋ a ndandaa? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Isàkal naa bɛ balàbal batɛy unsà indiir a baar asin, nà ayàlapà indiir abɛ ŋakwo? <verse eid="LUK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>Akà un'syääl mwɛy tɛy kan'kwo musyääl ankum bɔ̈ɔ̈l. Ya iyàmɛnà naa nde ayàkyey umwɛy, nde ayàtɔn wumwɛy, itàkal naa nde ayàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande akà umwɛy, nde ayàyiiŋ wumwɛy. Bɛ làkwe anki musyääl Nzam anà ngim u taaŋ làmwɛy la. »<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa a ifà ifà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Màt 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Yàmɛnà naa Amfarisi bàwem ba ndaa ayi yanswà, ba bàsɛɛ Yɛsu, ntɔn ba bàkweenà ngim. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ làbà baar làfàswaŋ u mii a baar naa bɛ làbà balàbal, wɛɛ Nzam akiyöb boo a mpem abɛ. Undiir bàfàman baar naa wa wà làkoo, Nzam wa afàman wà ŋingyäy.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>« Taaŋ a Un'kɔɔn anà là in'kaan a aŋangɔɔm làtsü apà Ywan. Sɛmà taaŋ alan, Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Imwol a Nzam ban'kyään, anà mbuur mbuur wà mukyer ngwal ntɔn mubilà kwo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Du anà mɛɛn man'kwo isàdiimà, wɛɛ akà isɛrà mwɛy kyà Un'kɔɔn isàdiimà anki.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>« Baal wanswà kàkaabà anà un'kyay ande, usàkàwal un'kyay asin, nde kan'tà inswem, wɛɛ baal wanswà asàwal un'kaar kàkaabà anà un'dim ande, nde kan'tà inswem.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋun'naaŋ anà Lazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>« Taaŋ mwɛy kàkäl anà ŋun'naaŋ mwɛy kàfàbwaarà ubwaŋàbwaŋ ipfɛy a ntal. Ilä byanswà isal ande udyà anà utaam. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Ŋàlàmbwà mwɛy ikɔb ande Lazar kàfabɔ̈ɔ̈nà u mun a làpaŋ a ŋun'naaŋ awà, nde kàkäl anà inkyar u ndür ande. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Nde kàlàkwen mudyà mfür a mampà yàbwee u mɛsà a ŋun'naaŋ. Apan sye mbwà yàyee mulɛɛr inkyar ande. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Yàmɛnà naa ŋàlàmbwà waa ukü, akyeey a Nzam laa bun'syen ba akà Abàlam. Ŋun'naaŋ sye waa ukü, waa bun'dyee. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Kà an'lɔŋ, ŋun'naaŋ kàkäl uboo a mpay yà mbɔɔn. Mpal kàler nde u du laa kàmɛn nde ukwɛl Lazar tsütsü apà Abàlam. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Apan nde kàlaal in'kwɛŋ: "Taaràmɛ Abàlam, ngwem ngyɛb! Tɔm Lazar, nde udüma nswɛŋ a làpin ande kà an'dà, nde kan'nɔ̈ lànyaŋ a an'dà u làlem amɛ, ntɔn mɛ in'wà u mpay mbɔɔn uboo a mbaa yi." <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Wɛɛ Abàlam kun'fuur naa: "Mwan amɛ, yɔbà ubwaŋ banswà kàmɛn ngye u mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye taaŋ kàkäl ngye u mɛɛn, wɛɛ Lazar kàkäl u mpay taaŋ lanswà. Mpalabà, apà, Lazar wà kà un'sak, wɛɛ ngye awà u mpay aŋasöönà. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Yumwɛy ayi: Uboo a bi anà bɛ we anà un'baan a kölàköl. Ilàtàkal naa ukwen bàkäl, bi ikwe anki musoonà wa, itàkal naa mufà akà bi muyà akà bɛ, itàkal naa mufà akà bɛ muyà akà bi." <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Ŋun'naaŋ waa kàtɛn naa: "Isàkal abwɛy, mɛ amabɔɔn, taa, tɔm Lazar u ndwà a taaràmɛ, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>ntɔn mɛ in'we abà atɔŋ abaal atyeen, nde ukakyään, manà ba sye bàyàlab mbwo a mpay ayi." <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abàlam naa: "Atɔŋ angye bye anà Mɔsɛ anà aŋangɔɔm, wɛy ba bawem." <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Nde naa: "Ŋaa, taa Abàlam, manà mbuur kan'fà an'lɔŋ, kan'kyà akà ba, ba bàkyer ayàbuul mpem." <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Abàlam waa kun'fuur naa: "Isàkal naa ba bàkwe anki muwem Mɔsɛ anà aŋangɔɔm, ba sye bàyàkwo anki muwem akà ikikye mbuur kan'fà an'lɔŋ." »<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Man'be anà ndwääl a nkul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Màt 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Yà ndandaa naa taaŋ lanswà baar ban'kwo bàbü u man'be, wɛɛ ngyɛb akà mbuur awà mbwo ntɔn mbweel a un'tɔŋ ande. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Yubwaŋ akà nde naa bun'bäm nkɔŋ a kölàköl u bway anà bun'tɔɔm u ngyäl, akwà naa nde mubwiy umwɛy uboo a baan ambɛy bà. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn bɛ ŋakwo! Isàkal naa un'tɔŋ angye kan'kyer man'be, un'pɛ an'lwɛŋ. Nde usàsɔɔmà, un'dwääl nkul. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Itàkal naa nde kàmakyer ube mbalà nsambwaar kà ilä mwɛy wɛɛ nde akayaa akà ngye taaŋ lanswà naa nde akyer asɔɔmà, un'dwääl nkul. »<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy antööm bàtɛn a Mwol naa: « Kwɛy làkwikilà abi. » <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Mwol waa kàfuur naa: « Isàkal naa ndandaa bɛ làbye anà làkwikilà làtàkal ikikye asànaa imbɛŋ a làpɔ̈ɔ̈là, bɛ lan'kwo muswaŋ un'te a kölàköl naa: "Tsumà pà, kyen kambär uboo a ngyäl!" Wa akyer alàwem. »<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buur a un'syääl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Yɛsu kàkwɛy naa: « Bi itàwal naa umwɛy uboo abɛ ukäl anà un'tsüüŋ ande isal ande mulem, taaŋ lumwɛy mudii ntsür. Uman nde kan'fà an'ywaŋ kan'yàfurà, nkye nde ayàtɛn a nde naa: "Yà agyägyä, bwaay u mɛsà"? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Aay, nde ayàtɛn a nde naa: "Ndääm isaa, bwaar ubwaŋ, yà yan'pɛ udyà, manà mɛ an'may mudyà anà munwà, ungö ngye sye waa ayàdyà anà ayànwà." <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Nkye nkum kan'kwo mupà ndä akà un'tsüüŋ ande ntɔn nde kan'kyer isal kyanswà kun'swɛŋ nde? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Ya sye ye abwɛy ntɔn bɛ. Isàkal naa bɛ lan'kyer isal kyanswà bàlaswɛŋ, làtɛn naa: "Bi ibà atsüüŋ ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ: bi kan'kyer isal kan'kwo bi mukyer." »<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr aŋakyal a bay kwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yàmɛnà naa Yɛsu kàkäl mukyà Yɛlusàlɛm, nde kàsoonà ndel a Samalya anà Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Mpal kàkäl nde tsütsü mubilà u bul mwɛy, aŋakyal a bay kwem bàyi akà nde, ba bàmbär u kwɛl <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>waa bàsɛn ndaa: « Yɛsu, Un'lɔɔŋ, iwem ngyɛb! » <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Mpal kamɛn Yɛsu, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làkyen kàlamɛnà akà angaŋ. » Mpal bàkäl ba u mbwo, laa bàkɔɔrà ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Umwɛy uboo aba kàmɛn nde naa nde kan'kɔɔrà, waa kàyàfurà, wàmuyisyäŋà Nzam u ndaa a dudu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Apan, waa kàbü, ntabwey u mɛɛn, kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu, waa kun'kömà. Mbuur awà kàkäl un'nsi Samalya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Waa Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Ba bàkwem bàkyer akɔɔrà, wɛɛ bàken baar wà bumwɛy? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy ukäl anki anà an'kyän muyàfurà ntɔn mukömà Nzam, ilàkɔɔn akal ungyey abarankye wà? » <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mbarà, kyen, làkwikilà angye làmatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. »<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyeel a Imwol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Màt 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Ilä mwɛy Amfarisi bàfuul Yɛsu naa imwol a Nzam isàyà mpal yɛn. Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Imwol a Nzam iyà anki asànaa undiir a ubem. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Bàsàtɛn anki naa: "Làler, kya aki kà." Taaŋ lumwɛy naa: "Kya kyà kunà." Ntɔn, làyöb naa Imwol a Nzam kyà uboo a bɛ. » <verse eid="LUK 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Apan nde waa kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Taaŋ là paa làsàkwen bɛ muman Mwan a mbuur itàkal ilä mwɛy mpɛl, wɛɛ bɛ làsun'man anki. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Ba bàsàlakyäänà naa: "Làler kunà!", taaŋ lumwɛy naa: "Làler kà!" Wɛɛ twon lan'kyà, twon lan'kaamà ntiin. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Ilä a Mwan a mbuur isàkal asànaa muŋyä ufàparà wa udu, anà ufàpà wa kyɛɛy awa ntsü anà ntsü. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Wɛɛ kusà nde akyer atàman mpay mbɔɔn anà baar a mpalàbà bàkyer un'tɔn. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Lalan ndaa yàlyaaŋ utaaŋ a Nɔwa, isàkal sye kà ilä a Mwan a mbuur. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Baar bàkyer afadyaa, bàkyer afanwaa, bàkyer afataa an'bɔr, bàkyer afapaa baan aba an'bɔr, tii ilä kàbilà Nɔwà kà an'swà. An'dà màyööl ma mɛɛn, laa bàkü ba banswà. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Isàkal sye asànaa utaaŋ a Lɔti: baar bàkyer afadyaa, bàkyer afanwaa, bàkyer afasoomà, bàkyer afayälà, bàkyer afakɔnà, bàkyer afatɔŋà. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Wɛɛ ilä kàtoo Lɔti u Sɔdɔm, mbul a in'kul a mbaa laa kàfü wa du, kàdwä wa ba banswà. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Ya isàkal abà sye kà ilä a Mwan a mbuur usàmɛnà nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Ilä akin, mbuur asàkal udu a nsyä a ndwà ande, ufàsàbilà anki u ndwà ntɔn mukàwal indiir ande, ifà imwɛy sye akà mbuur asàkal kan'ywaŋ usàkwo anki mufurà ndwà ande. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Làyɔbà un'kyay a Lɔti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Mbuur asàkwen muyee mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande, wa asàkyà bwà, wɛɛ mbuur asàkɔɔb mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande, akyer asàwal wa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Mɛ alàkyään naa: u mpib ayin, baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l bàsàkal ibɔ̈ɔ̈n imwɛy: umwɛy bàkyer asun'syen, umwɛy bàkyer asun'wɛy. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Akaar bɔ̈ɔ̈l bàsàkal mutswà ikal imwɛy: un'mwɛy bàkyer asun'syen, un'mwɛy bàkyer asun'wɛy. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Abaal bɔ̈ɔ̈l bàsàkal kà ibɔr: umwɛy bàkyer asun'syen, un'mwɛy bàkyer asun'wɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Alɔŋki ande bun'fuul naa: « Mwol, ndaa ayi isàkal ken? » Waa nde kafuur naa: « Ntsü isàkal ndom, akun sye inkaak isàköŋ bya. »<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a un'kweel a un'dim anà ntɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Ilä mwɛy Yɛsu katɛɛl nsim yi ntɔn muswaŋ ba naa ba bàkyer ayamà taaŋ lanswà, bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayɔɔn: <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>« U bul mwɛy, kàkäl anà ntɛɛn mwɛy. Nde Nzam kàfun'weemà anki, nde mbuur wanswà kàfun'manà naa wa undiir a bunàbun. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>U bul nsil alan kàkäl sye anà un'kweel a un'dim mwɛy kàfayaa taaŋ lanswà akà nde ntɔn nde ulɔ̈ɔ̈n ndaa ande, nde kàtɛɛnà naa: "Mpɛ iböŋ udu a un'yiiŋ amɛ!" <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Taaŋ mbɔɔn ntɛɛn awà kàkyer atɔnà, wɛɛ mpal mwɛy nde kàtɛn u mpem ande naa: "Yà ndandaa naa mɛ Nzam bɔɔmà in'fun'man anki, mɛ sye akà mbuur mwɛy làkoo in'fun'sà anki, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>wɛɛ asànaa un'kweel a un'dim wà kàman'sà pfwopfwo, mɛ in'kyer un'lɔ̈ɔ̈n ndaa ande, naa tɛy, usinayaa nde abà, nde ayan'twääl lingyoomà." » <verse eid="LUK 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Apan Mwol waa ufàkwɛy naa: « Làwem ndaa kan'tɛn ntɛɛn un'be wà! <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Wɛ bɛ làsii naa Nzam uyàpà anki iböŋ agyägyä akà baar ande kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l nde, bàfun'bel mpib anà mwäänà? Nde ayàbwiy mpib mukyer abà? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Mɛ, mɛ alàkyään naa nde ba iböŋ ayapà agyägyä. Wɛɛ, nkye mpal usàyà Mwan a mbuur, nde akyer asàtaan làkwikilà u mɛɛn? »<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a Umfarisi anà un'füür a itɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Ungö apan Yɛsu kàfàtà nsim ntɔn baar bàfàkyey uyɔl naa ba bà baar a balàbal anà bàfàbɛy baar bumwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>Nde kàtɛn abà: « Baar bööl bàkaanà u ndwà a Nzam mukàyamà: umwɛy kàkäl Umfarisi, wumwɛy un'füür a itɛr. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Umfarisi kàkäl umbär anà muyamà u mpem ande naa: "Ɔɔ Nzam, mɛ amafuur an'tɔɔn ntɔn mukɔɔn akal asànaa baar bumwɛy, aŋunkaam, baar mpa abà balàbal, baar a inswem, itàkal asànaa un'füür a itɛr wà. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Mɛ in'fàkin mbɔr ilä byeel u mpɔsà mwɛy, in'fàpà kwen unsà indiir nkam amɛ byanswà." <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Un'füür a itɛr kàkäl ukɔl, nde kàkwen anki musuub ntabwey ande. Wɛɛ nde kàyabɛɛrà itɔl ande, waa kàtɛɛnà naa: "Ɔɔ Nzam, ngwem ngyɛb ntɔn mɛ in'wà mbuur a man'be!" <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, un'füür a itɛr Nzam kun'twey mbuur a balàbal mpal kàfurà nde ndwà ande, wɛɛ kà Umfarisi anki. Ntɔn mbuur wanswà afàsɛnà bàkyer afun'tyeey, wɛɛ mbuur afàtyà bàkyer afun'sɛɛn. »<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'saak baan ambɛy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Màt 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Umpal ayin yàmɛnà naa baar bàyàtwaal baan ambɛy akà Yɛsu ntɔn nde kasi an'kɔɔ. Alɔŋki bàmɛn ba abun, waa baŋän. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Yɛsu waa kabel, waa kàtɛn naa: « Lawɛy baan bàyi apà mɛ! Twon làmatsuŋ, ntɔn imwol a Nzam kye a baar abà asànaa ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Mɛ ndandaa alàkyään, mbuur mpa awal imwol a Nzam asànaa mwan, nde kya usàbilà anki. »<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋun'naaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Màt 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Mfum mwɛy kàfuul Yɛsu naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ aŋàbwaŋ, mɛ in'kyer aben muwal möö a mbul a in'tye? » <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ntɔn nkye aman'bel ngye aŋàbwaŋ? Akà mbuur mwɛy wàŋàbwaŋ watɛy, usàkɔɔn akal Nzam mpɛl. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Ngye akiyöb in'kɔɔn: "Twon an'tà inswem, twon an'lɔ, twon an'yib, twon an'tà imbäl a loor, sà làkoo akà taaràŋà anà ngwa." » <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Wɛɛ nde kun'fuur naa: « Ayin yanswà mɛ in'kyer afàlab sɛmà imbɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Ungö kàwem nde abwɛy, Yɛsu kun'fuur naa: « Undiir mwɛy mpɛl kàmasääl: Yälà indiir angye byanswà, waa akääb ngim ayin aŋàlàmbwà, waa ngye asàwal un'naaŋ u du. Ungö, yan'läb! » <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Umpal kàwem mbuur awà abwɛy, nde kàmɛn mpay mbɔɔn u mpem ande, ntɔn nde kàkäl ŋunaaŋ a kölàköl. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yɛsu kàmɛn nde naa ŋun'naaŋ kan'kwamà ndür, nde kàtɛn naa: « Yà mpay akà aŋin'naaŋ mubilà uboo a Imwol a Nzam! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Lalan mpay yatɛy akà mpoonà mubilà u mun a nsway akwà naa ŋun'naaŋ mubilà uboo a Imwol a Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Baar bun'weemà bàtɛn naa: « Woo, abwɛy nà kan'kwo muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈? » <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Indiir mpa bàfàkwo baar, akà Nzam bya mpay byatɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Apan Petɔlà waa kàtɛn naa: « Atöl bi, bi kàsàwɛy indiir abi ŋakwo ntɔn mulab ngye. » <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, isàkal naa ntɔn imwol a Nzam, mbuur an'sàwɛy ndwà ande, un'kyay ande, atɔŋ ande, aböör ande itàkal baan ande, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>nde asàwal mbɔɔn u mpalàyi, wɛɛ umpal isàyà nde asàwal mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. »<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu an'kyään nkweel anà ngwiiyà ande mbalà yàtär</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Màt 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yàmɛnà naa Yɛsu kàwɛl Bàkwen Aŋiyweel tsütsü apà nde, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làler, bi ibeenà Yɛlusàlɛm, ndaa yanswà bàsön aŋangɔɔm ntɔn Mwan a mbuur ikyer akàkwo. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Lalan ba bàyun'pà kà an'kɔɔ a baar mpa bàyöb Nzam, ba bàkyer ayun'sɛ, bàkyer ayun'to, bàkyer ayun'tsul an'te. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Ungö apan ba bàkyer ayun'kam an'füm, waa bàyun'dwa. Wɛɛ kà ilä kyàtär nde akyer ayàwiyà. » <verse eid="LUK 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Wɛɛ alɔŋki ande bàyöbà anki akà undiir unsà ndaa ayin, mbuul aya bàkyer ayee, ba bàyöb anki naa Yɛsu nkye kàkwen mutɛn.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr ikwàmii mwɛy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Màt 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Mpal kàkäl Yɛsu tsütsü a Yɛlikɔ, ikwàmii mwɛy kàkäl aŋàbwaay ukɔl a mbwo wàmulɔɔmà akà baar. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Mpal kàwem nde làso a baar bàkäl mulyaaŋ, nde kàfuul naa nkye ikalyaaŋà. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ba bun'kyään naa Yɛsu un'nsi Nazàlɛr wàmulyaaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Nde kàkuub in'lalà: « Yɛsu, Mwan a David, ngwem ngyɛb! » <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Baar bàyikyeenà kusà bun'tsüŋà musà làso, wɛɛ nde kàsöönà mukuub in'lalà: « Mwan a David, ngwem ngyɛb! » <verse eid="LUK 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yɛsu laa kàmbär nde, waa kàswɛŋ naa bun'twääl awà. Mpal kàtöl ikwàmii tsütsü apà nde, Yɛsu kun'fuul naa: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>« Ngye ininà akwen mɛ mukyer ntɔn ngye? » Ikwàmii kun'fuur naa: « Mwol, wɛy mɛ in'fàman. » <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Fàman! Làkwikilà angye làmakɔɔr. » <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Apan sye laa kàfàman nde, kàläb nde Yɛsu, wàmuyisyäŋà Nzam. Baar banswà bàmɛn ba abun laa bàsyäŋà ba Nzam.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Zakay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Ilä mwɛy Yɛsu kàbilà u Yɛlikɔ, nde kàlyaaŋ uboo a la. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Wɛɛ le, kwo kàkäl anà mbuur ikɔb ande Zakay. Nde kàkäl mfum a afüür a itɛr, nde kàkäl ŋun'naaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Nde kàkweenà muman naa Yɛsu kàkäl nà, wɛɛ nde kàkwe anki ntɔn baar bàkäl mbɔɔn, ntɔn nde kàkäl ikökö. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Nde kàkaamà ntiin kusà, waa kàlär udu a un'te ntɔn nde umɛn Yɛsu ntɔn nde ayàlyaaŋ paa. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Mpal kàkɔlà Yɛsu kà ikal akin, nde kàler u du, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Zakay, yatɔlà agyägyä, mɛ ŋàbà in'kàbɔ̈ɔ̈n u ndwà angye. » <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakay kàtɔlà agyägyä, waa kàwɛl Yɛsu unsà un'sak. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Mpal bàmɛn baar abun, ba banswà bàkyer aŋüŋün, waa bàtɛn naa: « Làler, nde akyer akàbɔ̈ɔ̈n u ndwà a mbuur a man'be wà! » <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Wɛɛ Zakay laa kàmbär nde, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, wem, mɛ in'pà boboo a indiir amɛ akà aŋàlàmbwà, isàkal naa mɛ kàgyɔɔr undiir a mbuur, mɛ un'fuur mbalà nà udu a wa. » <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn ntɔn nde naa: « Ŋabawà mɔ̈ɔ̈ kan'bilà u ndwà ayi, ntɔn nde sye wà mwan a Abàlam. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Ntɔn Mwan a mbuur kàyi muleŋ anà mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a baar bàdiimà mbwo. »<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itim a itɛr a wɔl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Màt 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Umpal bàkäl ba muweemà ndaa ayi, Yɛsu kàläb mutà nsim mwɛy. Ntɔn nde kàkäl tsütsü a Yɛlusàlɛm, wɛɛ ba bàsii naa Imwol a Nzam ikyer amɛnà apanà. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Làwem ndaa kàtɛn nde: « Mbuur mwɛy wà ywar a imwol kàkäl tsütsü mukyà nsi a kwɛl ntɔn bun'si mfum. Ungö nde waa kàyàfurà nsi ande. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Nde kàbel baar kwem uboo a asyääl ande, waa kàpɛ akà umwɛy umwɛy itɛr a wɔl. Ungö apan nde kaswɛŋ mutà yà a ngim ayin ntɔn ya ibör yàsin tii mpal usyefurà nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Wɛɛ mbuur awà, baar a nsi ande bàfun'kwenà anki. Lalan bàtöm ba akyeey ungö ande ntɔn mutɛn naa: "Bi ikwen anki naa mbuur awun uyaal u nsi abi!" <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Ungö bun'si ba mfum, nde kàfurà nsi ande. Nde kàbel asyääl akwà kàpɛ nde ngim ntɔn muyöb naa ya ininà yàbör. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Wàtàtwɛb kàyi nde, kàtɛn naa: "Un'lɔɔŋ, itɛr a wɔl angye kyan'bɔr itɛr kwem." <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Apan, Nkum ande naa: "Yubwaŋ mbɔɔn, ngye awà un'syääl aŋàbwaŋ! Ngye an'syääl balàbal unsà undiir ikikye, mɛ amasà mfum a an'bul a kölàköl kwem." <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Wàyweel waa kàyàsin, waa kàtɛn naa: "Un'lɔɔŋ, itɛr a wɔl a ngye kyan'bɔr ityeen asin." <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Nkum waa kàtɛn ande sye naa: "Yubwaŋ, mɛ amasà mfum a an'bul a kölàköl an'tyeen." <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Ungöngö, umwɛy waa kàyi, waa kàtɛn naa: "Mwol, itɛr a wɔl angye kyaki: mɛ kya kàyee uboo a itɛɛnà a ipfɛy. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Lalan mɛ kàmɛn bɔɔmà angye, ntɔn ngye awà mbuur a ndaa a ngwal, ngye afàwal ngim kà ikal mpa kàsi ngye, ngye afàbwo ywaŋ mpa kàkön ngye." <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a nde naa: "Un'syääl un'be! Mbar angye mɛ in'tsul unsà ndaa angye ŋakwo! Ngye kàkyer ayöb naa mɛ in'wà mbuur a ndaa a ngwal, in'fàwal ngim kà ikal mpa kàsi mɛ, in'fàbwo ywaŋ mpa kàkön mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Wɛɛ ntɔn nkye mpa kàsi ngye ngim amɛ u bank? U mfurà amɛ, mɛ in'làwal bweel!" <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Apan nde kàswɛŋ akà baar bàkäl paa: "Làduum itɛr a wɔl kin akà nde, làpɛ kya akà mbuur awe abyà kwem!" <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Ba waa bàtɛn a nde naa: "Un'lɔɔŋ, nde we abyà kwem!" <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Mɛ alàkyään naa: "mbuur awe anà bya bàkyer asun'kwɛy, wɛɛ mbuur mpa awe undiir bàkyer asun'lwom itàkal kindam awe nde akyà! <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Wɛɛ ayiiŋ amɛ akwà mpa bàkwen naa mɛ in'käl mfum, latwääl pà, ladwä u mii amɛ!" »<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyà Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Màt 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ywn 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Ungö mutɛn abà, Yɛsu kàkyen kusà a un'sɛŋ a baar kàkäl mubeenà Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Mpal kàsin nde tsütsü apà Bɛtfagɛ anà Bɛtani, tsütsü apà mɔŋ bàfàbel naa mɔŋ a in'te a ɔlivɛ, nde kàtöm alɔŋki bööl kusà, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>waa kàtɛn naa: « Làkyen u bul lanà u sim. Bɛ làsàkɔlà, bɛ làkàman mwan a anɛ wàŋabäm, udu awa mbuur ŋàtàlaar anki. Lun'tsuuŋ, lun'twääl pà. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa mbuur amàlafuul naa: "Ntɔn nkye làtsuuŋà bɛ wa?" Lun'fuur naa: "Mwol we anà mfun a wa." » <verse eid="LUK 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Umpal bàkyen antööm, ba bàmɛn asànaa kàtɛn Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Utaaŋ bàkäl ba mutsuuŋ mwan a anɛ wa, aŋawa bafuul naa: « Ntɔn nkye làtsuuŋà bɛ wa? » <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Ba bàfuur naa: « Mwol we anà mfun a wa. » <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Apan ba bàsyen mwan a anɛ akà Yɛsu. Ba bàyeel ipfɛy aba udu a ntsür, waa bàbay Yɛsu mulaar udu awa. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Mpal kàkäl nde muyikyà, baar bàyiyeelà ipfɛy aba u mbwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Utaaŋ kàkäl nde tsütsü a Yɛlusàlɛm, u mbumà a mɔŋ a in'te a ɔlive, un'kàbɔ a alɔŋki wanswà kàkäl mukömà Nzam unsà un'sak, u ndaa a ngwal, ntɔn impà byanswà bàmɛnà ba. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Wɛy Nzam usaak mfum kan'yà kà ikɔb a Mwol! Duu u dudu anà làkoo akà Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Uboo a un'kàbɔ awà bàkäl anà Amfarisi amwɛy, ba bàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, aswɛŋ alɔŋki angye bàwɛy musà làso. » <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yɛsu waa kafuur naa: « Mɛ alàkyään naa ba bàsàkal a duu, in'kul ikyer a kuub in'kwɛŋ. »<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'lel ntɔn Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Mpal kàkäl Yɛsu tsütsü a bul a kölàköl anà kàmɛn nde la, nde kàkyer alel ntɔn la, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>anà kàtɛn nde naa: « Ngye sye alàyöb ŋàbà naa ngye akyer aben muman duu! Wɛɛ apanà ndaa ayi yàŋayee u mii angye! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ntɔn ngye, ilä abyà iyà ungö ayiiŋ angye bàkyer asasà uboboo a ibä, bàkyer asadiŋà anà bàsaküünà ntsü yanswà. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Ba bàkyer asapay ipepey, ngye anà baar angye. Ba bàsàwɛy anki un'kul udu a un'kul wumwɛy, ntɔn ngye kàyöb anki taaŋ kàyi Nzam muyaler! »<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu u ndwà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Màt 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ywn 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Ungö apan Yɛsu kàbilà u ndwà a Nzam, waa kàsɛmà muböŋ ayääl, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bàsön naa: "Ndwà amɛ isàkal ndwà a ngyamàkà." Wɛɛ bɛ ya lan'buul mboo a mbüüb! »<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yɛsu kàlɔɔŋà ilä byanswà u ndwà a Nzam. Amfum a angaŋ, alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà abyääl a baar banswà bàleŋà mukun'dwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Wɛɛ ba bàyöbà anki naa ba bàkyer aben mukɔr nde, ntɔn baar banswà bàkäl muweemà nde ubwaŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Ikɔ̈b a Yɛsu kyan'fà ken?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Màt 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy, Yɛsu kàkäl mulɔŋ baar u ndwà a Nzam anà mupay Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ. Amfum a angaŋ, alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà andweer bàyi <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>mukun'fuul naa: « Ikyään, unsà ikɔ̈b nà akakyerà ngye indiir abi, nà kapɛ ikɔ̈b udu a bya? » <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Mɛ sye in'kwen mukàlafuul undiir mwɛy. Lan'kyään: <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Ywan nà kun'töm mudümà baar? Du lɛɛ baar? » <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Wɛɛ ba bàbulà muyweer ba a ba naa: « Bi isàfuur naa: "Du kun'töm", nde ayifuul naa: "Ntɔn nkye mpa lun'kyey bɛ?" <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Wɛɛ bi isàtɛn naa: "Baar bun'töm", baar banswà bàyilom in'kul, ntɔn ba bàkyàyöb naa Ywan kàkäl ŋangɔɔm. » <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Apan ba bun'fuur naa: « Bi iyöb anki naa nde kàfü ken. » <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Aay, mɛ sye alàkyään anki naa nà kan'pɛ mbwo mukyer indiir abi. »<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akyeer a man abe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Màt 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Apan nde kàfàtɛɛl un'sɛŋ nsim yi: « Mbuur mwɛy kàkön ywaŋ a vin. Nde kàsɔ̈ɔ̈m la akà baar bàfàkyer vin ntɔn ba bàkyer isal aba uboo kwo. Ungö nde kàkyen nsi a kwɛl. Nde kwo kàkyer taaŋ mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Taaŋ abwo mbɛŋ làkwe la, nde kàtöm un'syääl ande mwɛy akà baar aban ntɔn ba bun'pɛ kab lànde. Wɛɛ akyeer a man laa bàdüb ba un'syääl awun, waa kàfurà an'kɔɔ ipɔl. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Ŋaywaŋ kàtöm un'syääl asin. Nde awà sye bàkyer un'düb, bàkyer un'to, waa bun'fuur an'kɔɔ ipɔl. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Nde kàfàtɔm un'syääl wàtär. Awun sye bun'yɔ̈ɔ̈l, waa bun'böŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Ŋaywaŋ kàyweer naa: "Mɛ in'kyer aben? Mɛ in'tɔm mwan baal amɛ in'fàkwen mɛ, mɛ in'sii naa ba bàkyer akun'sà làkoo." <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Wɛɛ mpal bun'mɛn akyeer a vin, ba bàyweerà ba a ba naa: "Làler ikyee! Yää bi kun'dwä waa ywaŋ a vin làyàbulà làbi." <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Laa bun'böŋ ba, waa bun'dwä.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">« Apan ŋaywaŋ asàkyer aben ntɔn ba? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Nde ŋakwo akyer asàyà, nde asàdwa akyeer a man abà banswà, waa usàsɔɔm ywaŋ akà baar asin. » Mpal bàwem baar ndaa ayi yanswà, ba bàtɛn naa: « Ndaa a tub ayi isàbwà anki! » <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kaler nde, waa kàtɛn naa: « Ndaa bàsön yi iswaŋà aben:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">"Nkɔŋ bàpiy atööŋ a ndwà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">"yàbulà nkɔŋ a twɛrà."<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>« Mbuur wanswà asàbwà udu a nkɔŋ ayin akyer asàbɔɔ. Wɛɛ isàkal naa nkɔŋ ayi yan'bweel mbuur, nde akyer asàpää nwamnwam. »<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɛr bàfür akà Sɛzar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Màt 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Taaŋ nsil alan, alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà amfum a angaŋ bàkwen mukɔr Yɛsu, ntɔn ba bàkyer ayöb naa nde nsim yi ba kàtɛɛl, wɛɛ ba bàtiinà un'seŋ bɔɔmà. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Apan ba bàsɛmà musey Yɛsu. Lalan bun'tööm ba baar bàfakurà naa ba bà baar aŋàbwaŋ. Baar abà bàlàlwab Yɛsu ndaa unsà mfuul mwɛy ntɔn ba bàwɛl iböŋ mukun'yälà akà abyääl anà akà mfum a nsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Baar aban bàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi ikyàyöb naa ndaa afàtɛn ngye anà afàlɔŋ ngye yà ndandaa. Ngye afàler anki ntabwey a mbuur mupà nde ikwàndwà, wɛɛ ngye afàlɔŋ ndandaa mbwo a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Wɛɛ bi ikwen muyöb naa nkye un'kɔɔn abi kà ipaa mbwo bi mufur itɛr akà Sɛzar lɛɛ tɛy? » <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàyöb nkwɛɛr a ba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>« Lan'swɛŋ itɛr a ngim. Ntabwey anà ikɔb ki udu a kya byà nà? » Ba bàfuur naa: « Byà Sɛzar. » <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Abun, làpɛ yà Sɛzar akà Sɛzar, yà Nzam akà Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Lalan ba bàsàman anki ube unsà yinà yanswà kàtɛɛnà nde u mii a baar. Ba bàkäl mubem mfuur ande, ba ndaa bàfàsà anki.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfuul ntɔn ngwiiyà a akü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Màt 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Yàmɛnà naa Asadusu amwɛy bàyi akà Yɛsu. Ba baar bàfàtɛn naa akü bàfàwiyà anki. Ba bun'fuul, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, Mɔsɛ kà ipɛ un'kɔɔn aŋàsɔn: "Isàkal naa mbuur aŋàkwɛl kan'kwà ukɔɔn asàwɛy baan, un'tɔŋ ande asàwal un'kyay kàkäl wànde ntɔn mupà ikyee akà un'kü." <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Kyekà, bàkäl anà atɔŋ nsambwaar. Wàtàtwɛb kàkyer abääl, ungö waa kàkü ukɔɔn abɔr. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Wàyweel waa kàbääl un'kaar kàsàwɛy bweel ande, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>wàtär sye abun. Ya yàkäl abun ntɔn ba bànsambwaar: ba bàkü ukɔɔn abɔr. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Ungö apan un'kaar sye waa kàkü. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Abun, ilä bàsàwiyà akü, un'kaar awà asàkal un'kyay a nà? Ntɔn ba bànsambwaar bàkyer un'bääl. » <verse eid="LUK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Abaal anà akaar a nsi yi bàkyer afàbääl, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>wɛɛ abaal anà akaar bàsɔ̈ɔ̈l muwiyà kà ukwà anà mukal anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ taaŋ làsàyà, bàsàbääl anki. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Ba bàfàsàkwà anki, ba bà asànaa akyeey a du. Ba bà baan a Nzam, ntɔn ba baan a ngwiiyà. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Mɔsɛ ŋakwo kàtɛn ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa akü bàkyer asàwiyà. Uboo a nsim a ibwiy a mbaa, nde Mwol Nzam kun'bel Nzam a Abàlam, Nzam a Isak, Nzam a Yakɔb. » <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Yɛsu kàfàkwɛy naa: « Mwol wà Nzam a baar a möö, nde kà wà Nzam a akü anki, ntɔn akà nde baar banswà bye anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. » <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn amwɛy bàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, ngye an'tɛn ubwaŋ. » <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Abun ba nde ndaa bàfun'fuul anki.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Klistɔ anà David</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Màt 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ban'kwo mutɛn aben naa Klistɔ wà mwan a David? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Ntɔn David atɛɛnà nde ŋakwo uboo a un'kaan a an'diim naa: "Mwol kàtɛn akà Mwol amɛ: "Bwaay u kɔɔ amɛ là ibaal, <verse eid="LUK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>mɛ in'kwen mubwiy ayiiŋ angye ntɔn ba bàbulà ikal angye mutɔɔl in'kɔl." <verse eid="LUK 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>David kun'bel Mwol: Klistɔ kan'kwo mufàkal mwan a David? »<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wàmuswaŋ baar naa ba bàkäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Màt 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Ilä mwɛy, mpal kàkäl un'sɛŋ wanswà mulab an'lɔɔŋ ande, Yɛsu kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>« Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn: isal aba uyilyaaŋ anà mvwɛl anà bàfàkwɛn naa bàyapà mbɔr u balàbal. Ba bàfàsɔɔl an'kir amà kusà uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà anà ikal a làkoo u mɛsà adyà a kölàköl. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Ba bàfàduum indiir a akweel a adim byanswà, taaŋ nsil alan ba bàfàsà ngyamàkà a bwɛlàbwɛl ntɔn baar bamɛn: nsaŋ aba isàkal yà kölàköl. »<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">An'kab kàpɛ un'kweel un'dim wàŋàlàmbwà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy, mpal kàkäl Yɛsu muler, nde kàmɛn aŋin'naaŋ bàmusà an'kab aba uboo a insak a an'kab. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Nde kàmɛn sye un'kweel un'dim mwyɛ wàŋàlàmbwà wàmusà an'falà mɔ̈ɔ̈l. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Nde kàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään: un'kweel un'dim wàŋàlàmbwà wà kan'pà yàŋàsöön baar banswà. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Ntɔn baar bumwɛy banswà ban'pà ngim ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ akà ba, wɛɛ nde, unsà làmbwà ande, nde kan'pà yinà yanswà ikäl ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande. »<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään mpää a ndwà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Màt 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Ilä mwɛy, baar amwɛy bàkäl mukan in'kul anà indiir byàpɛɛ ntwɛn a ndwà a Nzam, wɛɛ Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>« Ilä byà paa mpa usàsaal akà un'kul mwɛy udu a un'kul wumwɛy uboo a bya làmanà bɛ bi: bya byanswà byàsàkyer apää. »<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyɛb anà nkwaaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Màt 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Apan ba waa bun'fuul naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, ndaa ayi isàlyaaŋ mpal nà? Undiir nà asàswaŋ ngyeel a ndaa ayi? » <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ, mbuur twon amàlakur. Ntɔn baar mbɔɔn bàsàyà kà ikɔb amɛ, waa bàsàtɛn naa: "Mɛ in'wà Klistɔ!" Anà: "Taaŋ lan'kwo!" Wɛɛ twon làmalab. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Mpal làsàwem bɛ naa ità anà lingyoomà byan'yà, twon lan'man bɔɔmà: yubwaŋ naa bya itàyà abun kusà, wɛɛ bya kà ntsüü anki. » <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Apan nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Isàmɛnà naa nsi mwɛy yàmunwan anà nsi yumwɛy, imwol mwɛy anà imwol kyumwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Mɛɛn ikyer asàtɛɛr ngwal. Kà ikal mbɔɔn ngyal mbɔɔn anà an'fway màkyer asàbilà, ndaa a bɔɔmà yà ifà ifà ikyer asàtoo, idiim a kölàköl byàkyer asàmɛnà u du. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Wɛɛ kusà a ndaa ayi yanswà, bàkyer asàlakɔr, bàkyer asàlamɛɛy nkwaaŋ, bàkyer asàlasyen u làbay a nsaŋ a amfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, waa bàsàlatɔɔm u bɔlokà. Ntɔn ikɔb amɛ, bàkyer asàlasyen akà amfum a nsi anà akà amfum a itiir a nsi. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Indiir abi byanswà isàlayeel ntɔn bɛ làkäl anà mbwo mutà imbäl. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Twon lan'yweer kusà naa bɛ làkyer aben musàsà un'lɔɔn abɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Mɛ ŋakwo in'kyer asàlapà ndaa anà an'yeerà mpa bàsàtɔn ayiiŋ abɛ itàkal musà mbaaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Baar bàsàlayälà bà aböör anà atɔŋ abɛ, baar a tsütsü a bɛ anà asam abɛ, ba bàsàdwa baar mbɔɔn uboo a bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Baar banswà bàkyer asàlayiiŋ ntɔn mɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Wɛɛ akà làtswe abɛ làmwɛy làsàdiimà anki. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Abun, ntɔn nkääŋ a mpem abɛ, bɛ làsàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään mpää a Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Màt 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>« Wɛɛ mpal làsàman bɛ naa aŋità ban'diŋà Yɛlusàlɛm, apan làyöb naa mpää a la yà tsütsü. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Apan, wɛy baar a Yuday bàtiin udu a myɔŋ. Wɛy baar abà u Yɛlusàlɛm bàtoo agyägyä. Wɛy baar abà u bitsuŋ a ndwà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n abilà u bul a kölàköl! <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Ntɔn ilä abin isàkal ilä a bweel, ntɔn Ndaa Aŋàsɔn yanswà ikwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Ngyɛb akà akaar bàsàkal anà an'yöm anà akaar bàsàkal munüü baan ilä abin! Ntɔn ntaan isàkal uboo a nsi yi, anà nkyɛl ntɔn un'sɛŋ wà. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Baar a nsi yi bàsadwa a kɔm, bumwɛy bàsasyen asɔ u nsi a ingyey, wɛ Yɛlusàlɛm làsàbulà là baar mpa bàyöb Nzam tii mpal isàwà isɔ.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyeel a Mwan a mbuur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Màt 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>« Idiim ikyer asàkal uboo a taaŋ, uboo a nsöŋ anà unsà mbwaar. U mɛɛn baar banswà bàsàkal mutɛɛr a bɔɔmà ntɔn làso anà ibɔ a an'dà a ngyäl. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Lalan baar mbɔɔn bàsàkwà a bɔɔmà muyweer ndaa isàbwà u mɛɛn manswà, ntɔn ngwal a du yanswà ikyer asàni. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Apan, baar bàsàman Mwan a mbuur wàmuyà uboo a itööm unsà ngwal anà làkoo mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Taaŋ isàlyaŋ ndaa ayi yanswà, làsuub un'tswe anà làsi un'kanà, ntɔn ntsuuŋ abɛ isàkal tsütsü. »<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndaa ulɔɔŋà un'te a maŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Màt 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Apan Yɛsu katɛɛl nsim yi: « Làler un'te a maŋ anà in'te myanswà: <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Bɛ làsàman naa mya myan'fulà, bɛ lan'yöb bɛ ŋakwo naa paŋà a mbul là tsütsü. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ya sye yabun mpal làsàman bɛ naa ndaa ayi yan'yà, làyöb naa Imwol a Nzam kyà tsütsü. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Mɛ ndandaa alàkyään, nkööl ayi isàlyaŋ anki kusà a ndaa ayi yanswà mukwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Du anà mɛɛn màkyer asàlyaaŋ, wɛɛ ndaa amɛ isàlyaaŋ anki akà ikikye.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfun mukal kà ikyɛɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>« Làkäl kà ikyɛɛŋ bɛ ŋakwo ntɔn an'kyän abɛ màkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà mpye ntɔn udyà mbɔɔn, unwà mbɔɔn anà ngyɛb ntɔn indiir a mɛɛn mà, naa tɛy, ilä aki isàyàlataan kà imbwirà imbwirà. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Ntɔn kya isàbwà asànaa an'tɛy udu a baar a mɛɛn banswà. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Làkäl kà ikyɛɛŋ, làyamà taaŋ lanswà, ntɔn bɛ làkäl anà ngwal mutiin ndaa iyà yi yanswà anà musàkal umbär kusà a Mwan a mbuur. » <verse eid="LUK 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>U mwäänà Yɛsu kàlɔɔŋà u ndwà a Nzam, wɛ sisye nde kàkyeenà mukàtyeey taaŋ u mɔŋ bàfàbel naa mɔŋ a in'te a ɔlive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ututu tutu, un'sɛŋ wanswà kàkyeenà akà nde u ndwà a Nzam ntɔn mukun'wem.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndiirà ntɔn mudwa Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Màt 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ywn 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Un'kyɔm a mampà màkɔ̈ɔ̈n ful bàfàbel Pak làsin tsütsü. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàleŋà mudwa Yɛsu, wɛɛ ba bàweemà bɔɔmà a un'sɛŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudas wà tsütsü muyälà Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Màt 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Apan, Satanà kàbilà u mpem a Yudas Iskaryɔt, umwɛy uboo a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yudas kàkyen akà amfum a angaŋ anà amfum a aleer a ndwà a Nzam ntɔn nde ukàyäm anà ba muyöb naa nde Yɛsu ayun'yälà aben. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Ba bàkäl kà un'sak, waa bàyilà naa ba bàyun'pà ngim. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Nde waa kàkyey. Sɛmà apan, nde kàleŋà ipöl aŋàbwaŋ muyälà Yɛsu kà unku, ntɔn baar banswà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ayöb.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'swaŋ muyilà isaa a Pak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Màt 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ywn 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä a mampà màkɔ̈ɔ̈n ful, ilä bàfàdwa in'tö a in'kɔk ntɔn Pak kyàkwe kya, <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yɛsu kàtöm Petɔlà anà Ywan, waa kaswɛŋ naa: « Làkyen kàlayilà ndyeel a Pak. » <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Ba bun'fuul naa: « Ngye akwen naa bi la ikàyilà ken? » <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Le, mpal làkàbilà bɛ u bul a kölàköl, bɛ làkàman mbuur mwɛy anà làbuuŋ a an'dà. Lun'läb tii u ndwà ukàbilà nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Bɛ làkàtɛn a ŋandwà abà: "Un'lɔɔŋ kan'tɛn a ngye naa: Làken suk in'dyà mɛ Pak anà alɔŋki amɛ?" <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Waa nde ukàlaswaŋ, u ndwà adu, suk a kölàköl làŋalɔɔn ubwaŋàbwaŋ, ikal làkàyilà bɛ Pak kyakin. » <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Ba waa bàkyen, bàmɛn ndaa yanswà asànaa kàtɛn Yɛsu, waa bàyilà isaa a Pak.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Udyà in'kyɛɛl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Màt 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kɔ 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Taaŋ làkwe la, Yɛsu kàkäl u mɛsà anà antööm. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ, mɛ kàkwen mbɔɔn mudyà Pak alà anà bɛ kusà muman mpay. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Lalan, mɛ ndandaa alàkyään naa mɛ in'fàsàdyà anki la tii ilä isàmɛnà mbuul a la uboo a Imwol a Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Apan, nde kàwɛl kɔɔb, kàfuur an'tɔɔn, waa kàtɛn naa: « Làwɛl kɔɔb là, làkäb la bɛ a bɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>ntɔn mɛ alàkyään naa sɛmà apanà mɛ in'fàsànwà anki vin tii mpal isàyà Imwol a Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Ungö apan, nde kàwɛl mampà, waa kàfuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam, kàtsül ma, kapɛ, waa kàtɛn naa: « Ayi ndür amɛ bàpɛ ntɔn bɛ. Làkyer abà ntɔn mukan'yɔbà. » <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Ungö a udyà, nde kàwɛl kɔɔb, waa kàtɛn naa: « Lalà kɔɔb a un'tüüb akün kan'kyer bi unsà an'kil amɛ amiyàpää ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Wɛɛ le, mbuur ayàyälà mɛ wà papà u mɛsà anà mɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Ntɔn Mwan a mbuur wàmukyà asànaa bàtsül ya, wɛɛ ngyɛb akà mbuur kàmun'yälà! » <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Apan, ba bàbulà mufufuul ba a ba naa uboo a ba nà ayàkyer undiir a tub awà.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nà kan'söön?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä mwɛy alɔŋki bàsyeelà mbaaŋ ba a ba: ba bàkwen muyöb naa uboo a ba nà awà mbuur a kölàköl. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Amfum a in'sɛŋ bàkyer afandyaar, baar abye anà ikɔ̈b udu a ba bàfàleŋ naa babel baar aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Kà yubwaŋ anki bɛ mukyer abà, yubwaŋ naa mbuur a kölàköl uboo a bɛ ukäl umbɛy, wɛɛ mbuur akayaalà ukäl asànaa un'syääl. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Uboo a an'kyän abɛ, nà awà kölàköl? Mbuur kan'bwaay u mɛsà lɛɛ mbuur akapaa isaa? Kà mbuur kan'bwaay u mɛsà anki? Wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ uboo a bɛ in'wà asànaa un'syääl. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Bɛ lan'ndäär u ndür amɛ taaŋ lanswà an'man mɛ mpay. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Lalan, asànaa kan'pɛ Taaràmɛ Imwol, mɛ sye amàlapà kya: <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Bɛ làsàdyà anà làsànwà u mɛsà anà mɛ, uboo a imwol amɛ, bɛ làsàbwaay udu a kir a imfum ntɔn mutsul nsaŋ a in'sɛŋ a Isàlɛl myàkwem aŋiyweel. »<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään ntöön a Petɔlà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Màt 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ywn 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Yàmɛnà naa Yɛsu kàtɛn a Simɔn Petɔlà naa: « Simɔn, Simɔn! Le, Satanà kàkyer alɔm naa nde kàlasɛk asànaa bàfàsɛk mbɛŋ mukaab ya anà isɛrà. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Wɛɛ mɛ kàyamà ntɔn ngye, ntɔn làkwikilà angye làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà. Wɛɛ ngye, ilä asyefurà ngye akà mɛ, pà atɔŋ angye ngwal. » <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Simɔn kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mwol, mɛ an'kyey mukyà anà ngye, itàkal u bɔlokà, itàkal kà ukwà. » <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Simɔn, mɛ ndandaa akyään, ŋabawà, kusà nkɔɔ mubel, ngye akyer an'tɔn mukan'yöb mbalà tär. »<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngim, ngɔɔr anà kɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Ungö apan, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Taaŋ kàlatöm mɛ ukɔɔn ngim, ngɔɔr anà an'sàbar, nkye we anà undiir kàlakɔ̈ɔ̈n? » Ba waa bàfuur naa: « Akà undiir. » <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Apan, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Wɛɛ papanà, isàkal naa mbuur we anà ngim, uwɛl ya, isàkal sye naa mbuur we anà ngɔɔr, uwɛl wa, isàkal naa mbuur kɔm latɛy, uyälà inkur ande, usöm làmwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Ntɔn mɛ alàkyään naa yubwaŋ naa undiir aŋàsɔn wà ukwe amu mɛ: "Nde bun'täŋ uboo a adwää baar." » <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Waa ba bàtɛn naa: « Mwol, le an'kɔm mɔ̈ɔ̈l amà. » Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Man'kwo! »<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kàyamà u mɔŋ a in'te a ɔlive</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Màt 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yàmɛnà naa Yɛsu kàkyer atoo, waa kàkyen u mbwo a mɔŋ a in'te a ɔlive asànaa ifà ande. Alɔŋki waa bun'läb. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Mpal kàtöl nde kà ikal akin, nde kaswɛŋ naa: « Làyamà, ntɔn bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà u ndɛb. » <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Wɛɛ nde, nde kàkyen ukɔl a ba kà isii a bwɛl ufàkàbwà un'kul awà ban'lom, kàbü an'köm, waa kàyamà <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>abà: « Ɔɔ Taa, kya ngye asàkwen, lwom kɔɔb là tsütsü apà mɛ! Wɛɛ taaŋ lanswà, wɛy bàkäl ukwen angye, kà bàmɛ anki. » [ <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Apan, un'kyeey mwɛy waa kàyamɛnà akà nde ntɔn mukun'pà ngwal. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Yàmɛnà naa nkyän yàkyer un'kaar, nde kàfàyamà nswɛy nswɛy, kyaŋ a ndür ande waa làbulà asànaa bin'kul a an'kil byàbwee u mɛɛn. ]<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Ungö a ngyamàkà ayi, nde waa kàmbarà, kàsin tsütsü apà alɔŋki ande, nde kamɛn bàkyàbɔ̈ɔ̈n a ngyɛb. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Apan, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye lan'bɔ̈ɔ̈n bɛ? Làmbarà! Làyamà ntɔn bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà u ndɛb. »<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nköör a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Màt 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Ywn 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Nde kàkäl mutɛn, mpal kàkɔlà un'kàbɔ a baar. Mbuur bàfabeelà Yudas, umwɛy uboo a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel, kàkäl kusà a ba. Nde kàsin tsütsü apà Yɛsu ntɔn mukundüür. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Waa Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Yudas, ngye Mwan a mbuur un'yälà a ndüür? » <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Mpal bàmɛn baar bàkäl a Yɛsu naa ndaa yan'täy, ba bun'fuul naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, nkye bi isyääl an'kɔm abi ntɔn munwan? » <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Utaaŋ nsil alan, umwɛy uboo a ba kàkäm un'syääl a undweer a angaŋ mwɛy kɔm, waa kun'ywaŋ tsü a ibaal. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Làwɛy, yan'kwo! » Apan, nde kàbä tsü a mbuur awun, waa kun'kɔɔr. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛn a amfum a angaŋ, a an'kaptɛn a ndwà a Nzam anà andwer a baar bàyi ntɔn mukun'kɔr: « Nkye mɛ in'wà un'dwää a baar waa bɛ làyi anà an'kɔm anà nköl? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Mɛ kàkälà anà bɛ ilä byanswà u ndwà a Nzam, wɛ akà mbuur kan'bä anki. Apanà là taaŋ abɛ anà ngwal a mpib. »<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petɔlà kan'tɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Màt 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Ywn 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Apan ba bun'te mpi, waa bun'syen u ndwà a amfum a angaŋ. Petɔlà kàyilabà ukwɛl. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Baar bàyöbà mbaa uboo a làpaŋ. Petɔlà kàbwaayà uboo a baar bàkäl ukɔl a ya. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Un'syääl mwɛy wà un'kaar kun'mɛn tsütsü a ba, laa kun'syebà u kyɛɛy a mbaa, waa kàtɛn naa: « Le, mbuur wà sye kàkäl anà nde. » <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Wɛɛ nde kàkyer un'tɔn, waa kàtɛn naa: « Un'kaar wà, mɛ nde un'yöb anki. » <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ungö a taaŋ ikikye, mbuur asin kàmɛn nde Petɔlà, kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye sye awà umwɛy uboo a baar bà! » Petɔlà naa: « Mbuur wà, mɛ mwo watɛy! » <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Tsütsü ungö a taaŋ làmwɛy, mbuur asin waa ufàtɛn a ngwal yanswà: « Ndandaa, mbuur wunà kàkäl anà nde ntɔn nde wà un'nsi Ngalilɛ. » <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Petɔlà kàfuur naa: « Mbuur wà, mɛ in'yöb anki naa ngye nkye akwen mutɛn. » Taaŋ nsil alan, nde kàkäl anki aŋàtàmay mutɛn, nkɔɔ waa kàbel. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Mwol kàbulà nde, waa kàler Petɔlà. Apan Petɔlà kàyɔbà ndaa kun'kyään Mwol: « Kusà nkɔɔ mutàbel ŋàbawà, ngye ayan'tɔn mbalà tär! » <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Apan laa kàtoo nde, waa kàlel ubwaŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmuto anà bàmudwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Màt 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Baar bàkäl muler Yɛsu bàkyer akun'sɛɛ anà kun'dübà. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Ba bun'bäämà ipfɛy u mii, waa bun'fuulà naa: « Le! Tà ngɔɔm! Ikyään nà kàmadwa! » <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Laa bun'töö ba in'tswe asin myà ifà ifà.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu u làbay a nsaŋ a kölàköl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Màt 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Ywn 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Mpal làsɛnà taaŋ, nkööŋ a andweer a un'sɛŋ, amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàkyer aköŋ, waa bun'syɛn u làbay a nsaŋ a kölàköl, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>waa bàtɛn naa: « Isàkal naa ngye, ngye awà Klistɔ, ikyään. » Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ in'sàlakyään, bɛ làyàkyey anki, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>mɛ in'sàlafuul, bɛ làyan'fuur anki. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Wɛɛ, sɛmà apanà, Mwan a mbuur ayàkal wàŋàbwaay u kɔɔ a ibaal a ngwal a Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Apan ba banswà bàtɛn naa: « Iswaŋà naa ngye awà Mwan a Nzam! » Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Bɛ ŋakwo lan'tɛn naa mɛ in'wà nde. » <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Apan, ba bàtɛn naa: « Bi mfun a imbäl ifàkal anki. Bi ŋakwo kan'wem u mun ande. »<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kusà a Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Màt 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ywn 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Yàmɛnà naa un'kàbɔ a baar wanswà kàkyer ambarà, waa kàsyen Yɛsu kusà a Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Akun, ba bàsɛmà mukun'füün abà: « Bi kan'man mbuur wà wàmutwaal lingyoomà uboo a un'sɛŋ abi: Nde akatsuŋà baar mufur itɛr akà Sɛzar, nde kan'tɛn sye naa nde wà Klistɔ, mfum! » <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Apan Pilatu kun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye awà mfum a Ayudà? » Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Ngye ŋakwo an'tɛn. » <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilatu kàtɛn a amfum a angaŋ anà un'kàbɔ a baar naa: « Mɛ in'manà anki undiir kan'kwo mɛ mupà mbuur wà ikwàndwà. » <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Wɛɛ ba bàsi unkiiŋ mutɛn naa: « Nde ayimbaar baar mukyer ube unsà an'lɔɔŋ ande u Yuday lanswà sɛmà u Ngalilɛ tii apà. » <verse eid="LUK 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Mpal kàwem Pilatu ndaa ayi, nde kafuul naa nkye mbuur awà wà un'nsi Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Umpal kàyöb nde naa nde wà mbuur a ikal ufàyaal Ɛlɔdi, nde kun'töm akà Ɛlɔdi. Taaŋ nsil alan Ɛlɔdi kàkäl u Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Ɛlɔdi kàkäl unsà un'sak mbɔɔn muman Yɛsu, ntɔn sɛmà itaan nde kàkwen mukun'man, ntɔn yinà kàweemà nde, nde kàleŋà naa nde utàman akà impà mwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Nde kun'si mfuul mbɔɔn, wɛɛ Yɛsu kàsàfuur anki akà ikikye. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Taaŋ nsil alan, amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàmbärà paa, bàmukun'füünà a nkyɛl. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Apan, Ɛlɔdi anà aŋità ande bun'mɛn asànaa undiir a bunàbun, waa bun'sɛɛ, bun'bwää inkur aŋàbwaŋ. Ɛlɔdi kun'fuur akà Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Ɛlɔdi anà Pilatu bàkäl ayiiŋ, wɛɛ sɛmà ilä akin ba bàbulà asam.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmutsüül mbar a ukwà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Màt 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ywn 18.39-19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Abun, Pilatu kàbel amfum a angaŋ, abyääl anà un'sɛŋ, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ lan'twääl mbuur wà naa nde wàmubuul an'kyän a un'sɛŋ. Wɛ mɛ, mɛ amun'fuul u mii abɛ, mɛ in'sàman anki undiir kan'kyer nde uboo a indiir byanswà lun'füünà bɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Ɛlɔdi sye usàman anki ube ande, lalan kàman'fuur nde awà. Abun, mbuur wà undiir ukyer nde watɛy awà ban'kwo mukun'dwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Mɛ in'swaŋ baar amɛ bun'käm an'füm, waa mɛ un'wɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Kà un'kyɔm a Pak wanswà Pilatu kàkäl anà nkääl mukatsuuŋ mbuur a bɔlokà mwɛy. <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Wɛɛ un'sɛŋ wanswà kàsɛmà musà in'kwɛŋ: « Idwääl mbuur wà! Un'tsuuŋ Barabas! » <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barabas awà bun'si ba u bɔlokà ntɔn lingyoomà làbü uboo a bul anà nde sye kàdwä mbuur. <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Wɛ Pilatu kàkwen muwɛy Yɛsu, waa kàfàtɛn mbalà asin a ba, <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>wɛɛ ba bàkuub in'kwɛŋ, waa bàtɛn naa: « Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! » <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Wɛɛ nde kàfafuul mbalà yàtär: « Ube nà nde kan'kyer? Mɛ in'sàman anki akà ube mwɛy ntɔn nde ukwe mukwà. Abun, mɛ in'pà mbwo naa bun'pɛ an'füm waa mɛ un'wɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Wɛɛ ba bàsi unkiiŋ u ndaa a ngwal naa bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi. In'kwɛŋ aba myàwɛl iböŋ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Lalan Pilatu kàyer akyey nde ndɔ̈ɔ̈m aba. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Nde kàtsuuŋ mbuur kàbilà bɔlokà ntɔn lingyoomà anà nkweel a mbuur mwɛy, waa kapɛ Yɛsu ntɔn ba bun'kyer undiir bàkweenà ba.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmubɛɛrà u kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Màt 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ywn 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Wɛɛ mpal bàkäl ba mukun'syen, ba bàbweey anà mbuur mwɛy kàkäl u mbwo kàfü nde itsuŋ a ndwà, ikɔb ande Simɔn un'nsi Sirɛn, ba bun'siinà a ngwal mubay Yɛsu musyen kulunsi ungö. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Un'kàbɔ a baar kàkäl muyilab. Akaar sye bàkäl mbɔɔn muyilel anà muman ntaan ntɔn nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yɛsu kàbulà ntsü akà ba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Akaar a Yɛlusàlɛm, twon lan'lel ntɔn mɛ! Làlel ntɔn bɛ ŋakwo anà baan abɛ, <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>ntɔn le, làyöb naa ilä iyàyà bàyàtɛn naa: "Un'sak akà akaar ikɔb anà akaar mpa bàbör anà mpa bànüü baan." <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Apan baar bàsàbulà mutɛn a myɔŋ a bwɛlàbwɛl naa: "Làbü udu a bi!" A myɔŋ a ikökö: "Lifwee!" <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Ntɔn isàkal naa un'te a un'bu bàmukyer abà, ya isàkal aben ntɔn un'te aŋàyɔm? »<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Yàmɛnà sye naa ba bàsyen, mbwo mwɛy anà Yɛsu, baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l bàfakyerà baar ube, ntɔn bàkadwa sye. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Mpal bàtöl ba kà ikal mwɛy ikɔb akya « Bɔl a un'tswe », ba bàbɛɛrà Yɛsu u kulunsi anà baar bööl abà, umwɛy u kɔɔ ande là ibaal, wumwɛy u kɔɔ ande là ikaar. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Waa Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Taa, adwääl nkul, ntɔn ba bàyöb anki ndaa bàkyerà ba. » Ba bàkäb ipfɛy ande mutà löb. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Un'sɛŋ kàkäl paa muleerà. Wɛɛ abyääl bàkäl musɛɛ nde, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde kàtsü baar asin mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛy nde utsü mɔ̈ɔ̈ nde ŋakwo isàkal naa nde wà Klistɔ, mbuur kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l Nzam. » <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Aŋità sye bàkäl mukun'sɛɛ. Ba bàsin tsütsü apà nde, waa bun'pɛɛ man a nkyään, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Isàkal naa ngye awà mfum a Ayudà, tswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ngye ŋakwo. » <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Udu a nde yàkäl anà ndaa aŋàsɔn abà: « Mbuur wà, wà mfum a Ayudà. » <verse eid="LUK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Umwɛy uboo a baar abe bàkäl u kulunsi waa kun'töö, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Nkye ngye kà Klistɔ anki? Tswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ngye ŋakwo anà bi mwo sye. » <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Wɛɛ wumwɛy waa kun'pɛl, kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye Nzam bɔɔmà un'tiin anki, ngye mbuur an'wal ntaaŋàmbar nsil ya? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Akà bi, bi ube abi kan'fur, wɛ nde undiir ube ukyer nde watɛy. » <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Waa kàkwɛy naa: « Yɛsu, ngyɔbà mpal asàyà ngye kà imwol angye. » <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Mɛ ndandaa akyään, ŋabawà ngye akal u du anà mɛ. » <verse eid="LUK 23:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Sɛmà tsütsü a taaŋ a midi tii taaŋ làtär ungö a midi làpib làkyer abwà u nsi yanswà. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Taaŋ làkäl lan'minà, rido a kölàköl làkäl uboo a ndwà a Nzam làkyer akaamà u boboo. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Apan Yɛsu kàsi in'kwɛŋ waa kàtɛn naa: « Taa, mɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ an'fuur akà ngye. » Ungö mutɛn ndaa ayi, laa kàkü nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Muman ndaa yàlyaaŋ yi, kaptɛn a Lɔmà kàsi Nzam làkoo anà kàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa mbuur wà kàkäl mbuur a balàbal. » <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Ungö apan, in'kàbɔ a baar myanswà myàyi muyàler ibaŋ a ndaa aki, bàfurà bàmuyibɛɛrà kà itɔl. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Asam a Yɛsu banswà anà akaar bàyilabà nde sɛmà Ngalilɛ, bàmbärà ukwɛl mulerà ndaa yàlyaaŋà.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmusà kà an'dii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Màt 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ywn 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Yàmɛnà naa kàkäl anà mbuur mwɛy ikɔb ande Yɔsɛfi, nde kàkäl mbuur a làbay a nsaŋ a kölàköl, mbuur aŋàbwaŋ anà wàbalàbal. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Nde kàkäl anki un'sak anà atɔŋ ande baar a Làbay a Nsaŋ a kölàköl ntɔn ayà bàtsül ba anà bàkyer ba. Nde kàkäl mbuur a bul a Yuday ikɔb la Arimatay, waa kàdilà ngyeel a Imwol a Nzam. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Nde kàkàlɔm ndür a Yɛsu akà Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Ungö mutɔl ya u kulunsi, nde kàläl ya uboo a làpye a ntal, waa kàsi ya kà an'dii akün bàfuun uboo a nkɔŋ anà mpa aŋàtàsà mbuur. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Kya kyàkäl ilä muyöŋà ntɔn saba làkäl tsütsü musɛmà. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Akaar bàläbà Yɛsu sɛmà Ngalilɛ bàläb Yɔsɛfi. Ba bàleerà an'dii anà muyöb naa ba ndür a Yɛsu bàtɔl aben. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Ungö, bàfurà ba ndwà aba, ba bàyilà may a usɔŋ anà an'nanàsi. Apan waa bàkyɛɛl saba asànaa Un'kɔɔn utɛɛnà wa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngwiiyà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Màt 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ywn 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Ilä a làmiŋ ututu tutu, akaar bàkyen kà an'dii, bàsyen may a usɔŋ bàläm ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Ba bàmɛn naa nkɔŋ yàkäl u mun a an'dii bàkyàbuum ukɔl. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Waa bàbilà, wɛɛ ba bàmɛn anki ndür a Mwol Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Kyekà mpal bàkäl ba mubem ndaa ayi, wɛɛ le, baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l bàŋàbwaar ipfɛy a in'ŋyäŋ bàyàmɛnà tsütsü apà ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Bɔɔmà lawɛl la, laa bàtsüüm ba u mɛɛn, waa bàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye làleŋà bɛ mbuur a mɔ̈ɔ̈ uboo a akü? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Nde papà watɛy, nde akyàwiyà. Làyɔbà ndaa kàlakyään nde mpal kàkäl nde u Ngalilɛ <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>anà kàtɛn nde naa: "Yubwaŋ naa Mwan a mbuur bun'yälà akà baar abe, bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi, waa nde uwiyà kà ilä kyàtär." »<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Apan ba bàyɔbà ndaa a Yɛsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Ba bàlwomà kà an'dii, waa bàkàkyään ndaa ayi yanswà akà Bàkwem Aŋimwɛy anà akà alɔŋki bumwɛy banswà. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Akaar aban bàkäl Màlye a Magàdalà, Zwan anà Màlye ngwän a Zyak. Akaar bumwɛy bàkäl anà ba bàkàkyään ndaa nsil ayi akà antööm. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Wɛɛ ba làkwikilà bàsi anki ntɔn ya yàkäl asànaa ndwɛy a mwäänà. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Itàkal abwɛy, Petɔlà waa kàmbarà, kàpaarà ntiin mukyà an'dii, laa kànyee nde, kàmɛn nde in'siŋ a ipfɛy mpɛl, waa kàfurà ndwà ande wàmuyibem ndaa yàlyaaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">U mbwo a Ɛmayüs</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä nsil akin, alɔŋki bööl bàkäl mukyà bul mwɛy ikɔb a la Ԑmayüs, la làkäl isii an'taaŋ mɔ̈ɔ̈l mà dwaan a Yɛlusàlɛm. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Ba bàkäl muyiyääm ndaa yanswà yàlyaaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Mpal bàkäl ba muyiyääm, Yɛsu ŋakwo kàsin tsütsü apà ba, waa uyikyà mbwo mwɛy anà ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Ba bàkyer un'manà, wɛɛ mii a ba myapɛɛ anki mbwo muyöb naa awà nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ ininà làyiyääm u mbwo làyikyà bɛ? » Ba waa bàmbär, anà ngyɛb yanswà. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Umwɛy uboo a ba ikɔb ande Klɔpas waa kun'fuul: « Ngye, ngye awà un'nsi Yɛlusàlɛm umwɛy mpɛl mpa uyöb indiir ikalyaaŋà ilä abi? » <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Nde waa kafuul naa: « Ininà bà? » Ba waa bun'fuur naa: « Ndaa yàbweel Yɛsu un'nsi Nasàlɛr! Nde kàkäl ŋangɔɔm a ngwal. Nde ya kàswɛŋ unsà nsyääl ande anà ndaa ande kusà a Nzam anà kusà a un'sɛŋ wanswà. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Wɛɛ amfum a angaŋ abi anà abyääl abi bàkyer aben mukun'yälà ntɔn bun'tsüül mbar a ukwà, waa bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Wɛɛ bi, bi kàsi làkyän naa nde mbuur ayàkɔɔr Isàlɛl. Udu a ayi yanswà, wɛɛ le, ŋàbawà ilä kyàtär sɛmà yan'lyaaŋ ndaa ayi yanswà. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Yà ndandaa naa akaar amwɛy uboo a un'tüüb abi bàyikyään ndaa a ubem: ba bàkyen ututu tutu kà an'dii, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>wɛɛ ba bàmɛn anki ndür ande. Waa ba bàyikyään sye naa akyeey a du bàyàmɛnà akà ba ntɔn mukakyään naa nde we anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Bumwɛy uboo abi waa bàkyen kà an'dii, ba bàmɛn asànaa bàtɛn akaar, wɛɛ ba nde bun'mɛn anki. » <verse eid="LUK 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Apan Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ɔɔ bɛ baar làkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'yɛnà, u mpem mpa ifàyöb agyägyä ndaa yanswà bàtɛn aŋangɔɔm! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Yàlɔ̈m anki naa Klistɔ umɛn mpay ayi yanswà, waa ubilà u làkoo ande? » <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Ungö, nde kakyään indiir byanswà bàsön ntɔn nde sɛmà Mɔsɛ tii aŋangɔɔm banswà. <verse eid="LUK 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Mpal nsil ayin, ba bàtöl tsütsü a bul bàkäl ba mukyà. Yàmɛnà asànaa Yɛsu alab mbwo ande. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Wɛɛ ba bun'si muküünà, waa bàtɛn naa: « Kal anà bi, ngye akimanà naa taaŋ làmuminà, mpib yàmubwà. » Nde kàbilà u ndwà ntɔn mukal anà ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Nde kàbwaay u mɛsà anà ba, waa kàwɛl mampà, ungö mufuur antɔɔn, nde kàtsül ma, waa kapɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Apan, mii aba waa myàdubà, bun'yöb ba, wɛɛ taaŋ nsil alan, laa kàyaalà nde kusà aba. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Ba waa bàsàbulà mutɛn un'tɔŋ a un'tɔŋ naa: « Mpem abi yàböl anki mpal uyitɛɛn nde u mbwo anà uyibuul nde Ndaa Aŋàsɔn? » <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Taaŋ nsil alan waa bàmbarà, waa bàfurà Yɛlusàlɛm. Akun ba bàmɛn Bàkwem Aŋimwɛy ban'köŋ anà baar bàkäl anà ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Ba banswà bawɛl ubwaŋ. Apan ba bàtɛn a ba naa: « Ndandaa Mwol akyàwiyà, nde amɛnà akà Simɔn. » <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Apan alɔŋki bɔ̈ɔ̈l abà bakyään indiir byanswà byàlyaaŋ u mbwo anà ba Yɛsu bun'yöb aben mpal kàtsül nde mampà.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu an'yàmɛnà akà alɔŋki ande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Màt 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ywn 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ian 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Mpal bàkäl ba muyäämà abà, Yɛsu ŋakwo kàyàmɛnà uboo a ba, waa kàtɛn naa: « Duu làkäl anà bɛ. » <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Wɛɛ ba bàkäl unsà ubem anà u bɔɔmà ntɔn ba bàsii naa ba ban'man buulà. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye lan'bulà bɛ udu udu? Ntɔn nkye nkyɛɛr yan'bilà ya u mpem abɛ? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Làler an'kɔɔ amɛ anà in'kɔl amɛ: awà mɛ. Lan'tɛ mpi anà làler! Ntɔn buulà ufàkal anki anà in'twaŋ anà in'kwo. Wɛɛ bɛ làkimanà naa mɛ in'we anà mya. » <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Mpal kàtɛɛnà nde abwɛy, nde kàkälà muswaŋ an'kɔɔ ande anà in'kɔl ande. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Abun, unsà un'sak, ba bàkwe anki musà làkwikilà, ba bàkäl mubem. Apan nde waa kafuul naa: « Nkye bɛ làwe anà undiir adyà apà? » <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Ba bun'pɛ itsu a nsö aŋàyaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Nde kàwɛl kya, waa kàdi kya u mii aba. <verse eid="LUK 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Ungö, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ lan'man ndaa kàtɛn mɛ a bɛ mpal kàkäl mɛ anà bɛ: "Yubwaŋ naa ndaa yanswà bàsön ntɔn mɛ uboo a Un'kɔɔn a Mɔsɛ, Aŋangɔɔm anà An'diim yan'mɛnà u mii." » <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Apan nde kaduub un'yɛnà ntɔn ba bàyöb Ndaa Aŋàsɔn. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bàsön naa: "Klistɔ ayàman ntaan, nde akyer ayàwiyà kà ilä kyàtär, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>waa bàyàlɔŋ kà ikɔb ande akà baar a in'sɛŋ myanswà, sɛmà Yɛlusàlɛm, naa ba bàkyer asɔɔmà, waa bàwal ndwääl a nkul a man'be aba. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Bɛ làbà ambäl a indiir abi byanswà. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Waa mɛ, mɛ in'yàlatööm undiir kàlapɛ Taa ilää. Wɛɛ akà bɛ, làkäl apà uboo a bul a kölàköl tii mpal làsàyɔl bɛ anà ngwal isàfà du. »<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'beenà du</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ian 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Ungö, nde kasyen u nsà a bul a tsütsü a Bɛtani, nde kàsɛn an'kɔɔ ande, waa kasaak. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Mpal kàkäl nde mukasaak, nde kàkaabà anà ba, waa bun'syen u du. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Wɛɛ akà ba, ungö mukun'sà làkoo, ba bàfurà Yɛlusàlɛm unsà un'sak mbɔɔn. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Wɛɛ ba bàkälà taaŋ lanswà u ndwà a Nzam musyaŋà Nzam.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
